(131488, 6331, 3317, '<td valign="top">tough to expose for, maybe a black piece would''ve let you light meter for the piece, the board, and the reflection, but i dunno. chess rules though.</td>', 'tough to expose for, maybe a black piece would''ve let you light meter for the piece, the board, and the reflection, but i dunno. chess rules though.', '2002-10-02 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131489, 6331, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, I''d be interested to see how you did it.  I wish the reflection was just a wee bit brighter.  I like the angle a lot.  Good job.  DPz</td>', 'Nice lighting, I''d be interested to see how you did it.  I wish the reflection was just a wee bit brighter.  I like the angle a lot.  Good job.  DPz', '2002-10-02 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131490, 6331, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautifull light, subtle and soft reflection. Like it.</td>', 'Beautifull light, subtle and soft reflection. Like it.', '2002-10-03 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131491, 6331, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is just superb  really like the lighting and composition. The reflection is subtle  I like that a lot. The darkness of the background has the effect of focusing all the power in the shot directly onto the subject making it really punch out  this effect is also enhanced by the use of the diagonal line   adding even more drama. Finally, to finish off, just a twist of backlight, and the cocktail is complete.  The final mix produces one hellishly stunning shot... First class photography (10+++)</td>', 'This is just superb  really like the lighting and composition. The reflection is subtle  I like that a lot. The darkness of the background has the effect of focusing all the power in the shot directly onto the subject making it really punch out  this effect is also enhanced by the use of the diagonal line   adding even more drama. Finally, to finish off, just a twist of backlight, and the cocktail is complete.  The final mix produces one hellishly stunning shot... First class photography (10+++)', '2002-10-04 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131492, 6331, 3072, '<td valign="top">I like your picture.</td>', 'I like your picture.', '2002-10-05 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
