(131542, 6340, 3080, '<td valign="top">This would also make the perfect trash photo. lol.  The reflection is really clear and very obvious.  The angle and framing/cropping are great, and the lighting is wonderful.  A really good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.~hbunch7187~</td>', 'This would also make the perfect trash photo. lol.  The reflection is really clear and very obvious.  The angle and framing/cropping are great, and the lighting is wonderful.  A really good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-02 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
