(131545, 6340, 3900, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action reflection.</td>', 'Nice stop action reflection.', '2002-10-04 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131546, 6340, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is superb I love the whole concept of this shot; I didn''t realise it was possible to pose just a hand, but I think you have done so really well.  You have also captured the moment delightfully.  What''s also worthy of remark is the way the bin doesn''t look transparent  until you look really closely.  The composition makes the shot; the colours contribute to the balance and the lighting gives it a wistful feel.  To get a shot like this, this good, personally, I''d have to resort to cheating Great photography (10)</td>', 'This is superb I love the whole concept of this shot; I didn''t realise it was possible to pose just a hand, but I think you have done so really well.  You have also captured the moment delightfully.  What''s also worthy of remark is the way the bin doesn''t look transparent  until you look really closely.  The composition makes the shot; the colours contribute to the balance and the lighting gives it a wistful feel.  To get a shot like this, this good, personally, I''d have to resort to cheating Great photography (10)', '2002-10-04 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
