(131556, 6342, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot overall, but I think that there are a few problems.  Firstly, the coat on the back of the chair doesn''t work within the context of the shot, in much the same way as the much darker area to the left that merges with said coat; these elements add unwanted conflict to the shot and contrast really strongly with the main subject.  It''s OK for the model to have the contrasting colour; but the other elements just pull the eyes away.  Cropped out, I think this shot would be a lot better.  Sorry to add more, but the other point relates to the models pose; it doesn''t look natural  you can almost hear the photographer saying, ''No, left a bit more'' Sorry to be so negative.  On the plus side, the rest of the shot works really well (4)</td>', 'This is a really nice shot overall, but I think that there are a few problems.  Firstly, the coat on the back of the chair doesn''t work within the context of the shot, in much the same way as the much darker area to the left that merges with said coat; these elements add unwanted conflict to the shot and contrast really strongly with the main subject.  It''s OK for the model to have the contrasting colour; but the other elements just pull the eyes away.  Cropped out, I think this shot would be a lot better.  Sorry to add more, but the other point relates to the models pose; it doesn''t look natural  you can almost hear the photographer saying, ''No, left a bit more'' Sorry to be so negative.  On the plus side, the rest of the shot works really well (4)', '2002-10-03 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131557, 6342, 2667, '<td valign="top">clean shot! love the texture of stone in reflection...also, like the subtle ''reflection'' of subject''s hair shades in the brick behind. good work!</td>', 'clean shot! love the texture of stone in reflection...also, like the subtle ''reflection'' of subject''s hair shades in the brick behind. good work!', '2002-10-04 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131558, 6342, 332, '<td valign="top">Great colors. That red just screams out. Sharp and good composition. -arnit</td>', 'Great colors. That red just screams out. Sharp and good composition. -arnit', '2002-10-04 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131559, 6342, 3072, '<td valign="top">I like your picture, the title could have been: "I Live on the South"</td>', 'I like your picture, the title could have been: "I Live on the South"', '2002-10-05 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131560, 6342, 3313, '<td valign="top">Very effective reflection. The problem for me is that the person takes the attention away from it. I wonder whether it could have been better with the wine glass and why not the bottle on the right and nearer the camera ?</td>', 'Very effective reflection. The problem for me is that the person takes the attention away from it. I wonder whether it could have been better with the wine glass and why not the bottle on the right and nearer the camera ?', '2002-10-05 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131561, 6342, 527, '<td valign="top">This is a real interesting photo but I really don''t think that the look of the person works very well here. She looks like she is trying to avoid the camera instead of interacting with it it.<br/><br/>T</td>', 'This is a real interesting photo but I really don''t think that the look of the person works very well here. She looks like she is trying to avoid the camera instead of interacting with it it.T', '2002-10-05 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131562, 6342, 4410, '<td valign="top">Good reflection</td>', 'Good reflection', '2002-10-06 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131563, 6343, 3080, '<td valign="top">Since the last time I viewed your photo, there has ben an admin not on here that says that it''s a valid reflection.  why on earth would anyone think otherwise??  That''s strange.  Anyway, I like the use of the black and white with the color.  Quite a nice touch.  The focus and clarity are good, and the angle you have chosen is very good.  I like this photo a lot. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Since the last time I viewed your photo, there has ben an admin not on here that says that it''s a valid reflection.  why on earth would anyone think otherwise??  That''s strange.  Anyway, I like the use of the black and white with the color.  Quite a nice touch.  The focus and clarity are good, and the angle you have chosen is very good.  I like this photo a lot. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-30 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131564, 6343, 3002, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very creative photograph and refreshing after looking at a slew of (ho-hum) ponds, buidlings, sunglasses and table tops.</td>', 'I think this is a very creative photograph and refreshing after looking at a slew of (ho-hum) ponds, buidlings, sunglasses and table tops.', '2002-09-30 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131565, 6343, 3859, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Very original.  I like the color with the black and white.  And I really like what you are conveying thru this shot.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this.  Very original.  I like the color with the black and white.  And I really like what you are conveying thru this shot.  A 10 from me.', '2002-09-30 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
