(131576, 6343, 133, '<td valign="top">A very moving photograph.</td>', 'A very moving photograph.', '2002-10-01 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131577, 6343, 2997, '<td valign="top">Yap, "the bloom of youth" (as the Bible notes) is like the passing of the wildflowers.  Its a bummer getting old.  I want to be 18 again.<br/>Enough editorializing.  Wonderful idea here.  I like it very much.  The blurred youth picture helps the viewer to know that it is "the past" while the focus on your face is the current reality. -Bart ("focus")</td>', 'Yap, "the bloom of youth" (as the Bible notes) is like the passing of the wildflowers.  Its a bummer getting old.  I want to be 18 again.Enough editorializing.  Wonderful idea here.  I like it very much.  The blurred youth picture helps the viewer to know that it is "the past" while the focus on your face is the current reality. -Bart ("focus")', '2002-10-01 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131578, 6343, 3380, '<td valign="top">Nice creativity. I find myself doing the same thing from time to time.</td>', 'Nice creativity. I find myself doing the same thing from time to time.', '2002-10-01 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131579, 6343, 1005, '<td valign="top">Awesome piece!  I almost made a stupid suggestion, but looked at the pic again, wow, I just can''t get over how well this is done.  I keep thinking I''d like to see more of your "current" hand, but it just wouldn''t work.  Very well thought out and set up!  10, of course!  Swash</td>', 'Awesome piece!  I almost made a stupid suggestion, but looked at the pic again, wow, I just can''t get over how well this is done.  I keep thinking I''d like to see more of your "current" hand, but it just wouldn''t work.  Very well thought out and set up!  10, of course!  Swash', '2002-10-01 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131580, 6343, 3557, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2002-10-01 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131581, 6343, 2618, '<td valign="top">Cool. A reflection of someone reflecting on the past.. Well done too. 8.</td>', 'Cool. A reflection of someone reflecting on the past.. Well done too. 8.', '2002-10-01 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131582, 6343, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot carries a lot of emotional impact.  I love that the photo is b&amp;w, and you are in color.  Love that the photo is defocused, and you are in focus.  I''m sure you will get some comments about the edges of the photograph showing, but I think it gives the shot a "fragmented" feel that is appropriate for the emotion of the shot.  Nice work. lhall-9</td>', 'This shot carries a lot of emotional impact.  I love that the photo is b&w, and you are in color.  Love that the photo is defocused, and you are in focus.  I''m sure you will get some comments about the edges of the photograph showing, but I think it gives the shot a "fragmented" feel that is appropriate for the emotion of the shot.  Nice work. lhall-9', '2002-10-02 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131583, 6343, 2923, '<td valign="top">i like it, the blur on the youth symbolizes passing and the new and angry looking guy on the left represents the present :)  9 paganini</td>', 'i like it, the blur on the youth symbolizes passing and the new and angry looking guy on the left represents the present :)  9 paganini', '2002-10-03 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131584, 6343, 656, '<td valign="top">Great, even with the lens reflection.   Subtle use of lighting, very effective concept.  If the out of focus ''past'' is intentional then fair enough, otherwise you might want to spend some time on the DoF/vs focal distance trade-offs to sharpen it up a bit.</td>', 'Great, even with the lens reflection.   Subtle use of lighting, very effective concept.  If the out of focus ''past'' is intentional then fair enough, otherwise you might want to spend some time on the DoF/vs focal distance trade-offs to sharpen it up a bit.', '2002-10-03 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131585, 6343, 3273, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, well executed</td>', 'Excellent idea, well executed', '2002-10-03 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131586, 6343, 2928, '<td valign="top">Absolute classic (10) Superbly done</td>', 'Absolute classic (10) Superbly done', '2002-10-03 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
