(131620, 6347, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 5<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 4<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 5<br/><br/>Score: 5 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 5Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 4WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 5Score: 5 - setzler', '2002-10-03 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
