(131622, 6347, 4145, '<td valign="top">message from the photographer: in response to setzler,  i was on an express train cruising along the middle of england , all i had to work with was what was on the train, so i did the best i could.  In response to Hendrik, i''m not really bothered about ur remark because different people have different opinions, and i have had loads of people say that its great so i ent bothered. I thank you all for the other comments made.</td>', 'message from the photographer: in response to setzler,  i was on an express train cruising along the middle of england , all i had to work with was what was on the train, so i did the best i could.  In response to Hendrik, i''m not really bothered about ur remark because different people have different opinions, and i have had loads of people say that its great so i ent bothered. I thank you all for the other comments made.', '2002-10-07 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
