(131633, 6348, 3317, '<td valign="top">i very much enjoy starbucks coffee as well. ever had verona? it''s the best, queen of coffees. i like double espressos, except when they''re serving verona i get 2 shots of espresso in a short cup of verona. ever notice the black tables outside the stores are highly reflective when wet? my portrait photo for this challenge got taken that way, it''s called ''christafari''. you should check out www.mirrorproject.com</td>', 'i very much enjoy starbucks coffee as well. ever had verona? it''s the best, queen of coffees. i like double espressos, except when they''re serving verona i get 2 shots of espresso in a short cup of verona. ever notice the black tables outside the stores are highly reflective when wet? my portrait photo for this challenge got taken that way, it''s called ''christafari''. you should check out www.mirrorproject.com', '2002-10-02 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
