(131649, 6350, 4005, '<td valign="top">Very very well done! I like this pic, the colors and the title...</td>', 'Very very well done! I like this pic, the colors and the title...', '2002-10-02 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131650, 6350, 2928, '<td valign="top">I like the overall shot, but I think that there are to many background divisions that just draw the eye away from the main subject. I think that if you''d cropped the boat on its own, this would have removed the conflict within the shot, looked really cool and added balance to the shot.  To me, it has too many backgrounds to be really effective.  As it stands, I still really like the shot; it''s interesting and well exposed (7)</td>', 'I like the overall shot, but I think that there are to many background divisions that just draw the eye away from the main subject. I think that if you''d cropped the boat on its own, this would have removed the conflict within the shot, looked really cool and added balance to the shot.  To me, it has too many backgrounds to be really effective.  As it stands, I still really like the shot; it''s interesting and well exposed (7)', '2002-10-02 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131651, 6350, 3447, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot.  Good work.    9                     JEM</td>', 'Really like this shot.  Good work.    9                     JEM', '2002-10-02 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
