(131657, 6350, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  It kinda reminds me of a famous painting, but I don''t remember either the title or the painter.  Great title, color, focus...nice job!  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice photo.  It kinda reminds me of a famous painting, but I don''t remember either the title or the painter.  Great title, color, focus...nice job!  9 Swash', '2002-10-04 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
