(131694, 6355, 1143, '<td valign="top">I feel like this has been cropped too much. The sides of the mt are chopped and the peak in the reflection is too close to the bottom edge. You already included some rocks so I think  few more wouldn''t hurt - or maybe a different angle would help. Dunno, but it''s a really beautiful shot and very close to a 10 for me. ~indigo997</td>', 'I feel like this has been cropped too much. The sides of the mt are chopped and the peak in the reflection is too close to the bottom edge. You already included some rocks so I think  few more wouldn''t hurt - or maybe a different angle would help. Dunno, but it''s a really beautiful shot and very close to a 10 for me. ~indigo997', '2002-10-01 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
