(131738, 6357, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is quite subtle, the reflective state of the background works well.  The composition is very good and I like colours in the mosaic.  The lamp itself, in my opinion, is too close to the reflective surface.  It makes the lamp look like it has a handle at first glance.  This effect draws the eye away from the subject, and although it''s just a tad, the effect does take away from the overall image Other than that, the shot works well (7)</td>', 'This is quite subtle, the reflective state of the background works well.  The composition is very good and I like colours in the mosaic.  The lamp itself, in my opinion, is too close to the reflective surface.  It makes the lamp look like it has a handle at first glance.  This effect draws the eye away from the subject, and although it''s just a tad, the effect does take away from the overall image Other than that, the shot works well (7)', '2002-10-02 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
