(131761, 6358, 2780, '<td valign="top">Definatly my favourite photo this week.<br/>It includes a reflection, there, you''ve met the challenge. That was easy enough, but this image goes further.<br/>I like the colours. They remind me of a scene in a fantasy setting, along with the bridge going into the mist, its awesome. I also love the contrast between right and left!  The fact I can see the land above the mist is great aswell. There photo has great composition aswell, with the bridge leading from left to right into the mist.<br/><br/>I couldn''t give this photo anything lower than a 10! And you will see this in my favourites come next week when the voting it over.<br/><br/>-Konador</td>', 'Definatly my favourite photo this week.It includes a reflection, there, you''ve met the challenge. That was easy enough, but this image goes further.I like the colours. They remind me of a scene in a fantasy setting, along with the bridge going into the mist, its awesome. I also love the contrast between right and left!  The fact I can see the land above the mist is great aswell. There photo has great composition aswell, with the bridge leading from left to right into the mist.I couldn''t give this photo anything lower than a 10! And you will see this in my favourites come next week when the voting it over.-Konador', '2002-10-01 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
