(131816, 6358, 772, '<td valign="top">This is another example of how *I* feel that the rule of thirds can add impact to a photo... the bridge support and bridge intersection here happens to be very close to a third intersection point...  The composition here is excellent :)</td>', 'This is another example of how *I* feel that the rule of thirds can add impact to a photo... the bridge support and bridge intersection here happens to be very close to a third intersection point...  The composition here is excellent :)', '2002-10-07 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
