(131820, 6358, 92, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering....how did you get the cool color effects? The sky blue and white and then that golden brown and black effect. It''s awesome !</td>', 'I''m wondering....how did you get the cool color effects? The sky blue and white and then that golden brown and black effect. It''s awesome !', '2002-10-07 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(131821, 6358, 3913, '<td valign="top">To answer Shiiizzzam:<br/>Because there was limited lighting when I took the shot, the picture had almost a natural black and white look to it. I then increased the saturation on the whole image and adjusted the color balance with a little more yellow and magenta to achieve the effect you see. <br/><br/>The fog created a natural gradient in the sky and also in the water. The neat thing about this image is that when I was taking the shot my battery was totally dead, and I had to keep turning my camera on because it kept shutting off due to lack of battery. I was able to snag a couple shots and this was one of them. I wasn''t sure if the image came out good or not until I got home to look at it on the pc. Thanks again for liking it.</td>', 'To answer Shiiizzzam:Because there was limited lighting when I took the shot, the picture had almost a natural black and white look to it. I then increased the saturation on the whole image and adjusted the color balance with a little more yellow and magenta to achieve the effect you see. The fog created a natural gradient in the sky and also in the water. The neat thing about this image is that when I was taking the shot my battery was totally dead, and I had to keep turning my camera on because it kept shutting off due to lack of battery. I was able to snag a couple shots and this was one of them. I wasn''t sure if the image came out good or not until I got home to look at it on the pc. Thanks again for liking it.', '2002-10-08 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(131822, 6358, 92, '<td valign="top">Thank you for going into so much detail. I read your bio and admire your talent/gifts and love for God and family.</td>', 'Thank you for going into so much detail. I read your bio and admire your talent/gifts and love for God and family.', '2002-10-08 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
