(131855, 6359, 3280, '<td valign="top">Iknow there has been some controversy over this shot but I really like it.  I looked at it a long time before the ring told me "the rest of the story".  The lighting is perfect, I''m sure it was a tough shot to get.  I''d be interested in the story behind the shot.  DPz</td>', 'Iknow there has been some controversy over this shot but I really like it.  I looked at it a long time before the ring told me "the rest of the story".  The lighting is perfect, I''m sure it was a tough shot to get.  I''d be interested in the story behind the shot.  DPz', '2002-10-02 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131856, 6359, 3859, '<td valign="top">Wow, you almost got me!  I was studying the picture trying to decide what you used for a reflective surface.  I assumed it could not be a mirror....then it hit me.<br/>The ring!  I think this is an outstanding photo, however IMO it is not a reflection.</td>', 'Wow, you almost got me!  I was studying the picture trying to decide what you used for a reflective surface.  I assumed it could not be a mirror....then it hit me.The ring!  I think this is an outstanding photo, however IMO it is not a reflection.', '2002-10-02 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
