(131861, 6359, 1827, '<td valign="top">UPDATE:<br/>This definitely made it to a 9 for me.  Great work.  9.<br/><br/>ORIGINAL COMMENT:<br/>Recently married then?  Congrats!  I like this image.  The B/W decision is a good one.  I like the use of negative space and the way the darkness kind of hugs your hands.  Okay, it''s not an exact reflection in the sense of creating a replica in a reflective surface, but it meets the challenge in two ways for me: 1) reflection in the sense of thought given to a topic -- this image shows reflection on the changes marriage brings to a life. 2) It mimics mirror reflection as defined above, which I think is a creative interpretation of the challenge.  Well done.  8-9, just-married (That means I''ll be tweaking this score one way or the other later.)</td>', 'UPDATE:This definitely made it to a 9 for me.  Great work.  9.ORIGINAL COMMENT:Recently married then?  Congrats!  I like this image.  The B/W decision is a good one.  I like the use of negative space and the way the darkness kind of hugs your hands.  Okay, it''s not an exact reflection in the sense of creating a replica in a reflective surface, but it meets the challenge in two ways for me: 1) reflection in the sense of thought given to a topic -- this image shows reflection on the changes marriage brings to a life. 2) It mimics mirror reflection as defined above, which I think is a creative interpretation of the challenge.  Well done.  8-9, just-married (That means I''ll be tweaking this score one way or the other later.)', '2002-10-03 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(131862, 6359, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  So close to a perfect "reflection," but not quite perfect... what were you trying to imply with that? :)  -   9    -   JB</td>', 'This is a great shot.  So close to a perfect "reflection," but not quite perfect... what were you trying to imply with that? :)  -   9    -   JB', '2002-10-03 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
