(131864, 6359, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Nice shapes, would have been a great neg space entry too! LOL. Like the highlights on the wedding ring. Without the ring it wouldn''t be half as good, so I see the wedding ring as a real focal point. I find it a fraction too dark overall in the skin tones for my tastes, but that''s just my preferences.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely! Nice shapes, would have been a great neg space entry too! LOL. Like the highlights on the wedding ring. Without the ring it wouldn''t be half as good, so I see the wedding ring as a real focal point. I find it a fraction too dark overall in the skin tones for my tastes, but that''s just my preferences.9, Kavey', '2002-10-04 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
