(131866, 6359, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, but the only actual reflection is very small (in the wedding ring) and nearly impossible to see.  If I am missing something and there is another reflection here, please set me straight ~ Myqyl ~<br/>After a third (or forth) look, I''m beginning to think you are trying for a personal reflection (ie. thought, contempation). And while that''s not obvious (at least to me) I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, but the only actual reflection is very small (in the wedding ring) and nearly impossible to see.  If I am missing something and there is another reflection here, please set me straight ~ Myqyl ~After a third (or forth) look, I''m beginning to think you are trying for a personal reflection (ie. thought, contempation). And while that''s not obvious (at least to me) I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2002-10-04 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
