(131903, 6361, 1005, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see it at first, but a second viewing, I see there is a second face on the other side of the window.  (Saved by your title!)  The two faces appear to be of different sizes, the reflection seems to "cancel" out most of the person behind the glass.  Very wierd and creative shot.  Sorry, but I still don''t like it that much.  6 Swash</td>', 'I didn''t see it at first, but a second viewing, I see there is a second face on the other side of the window.  (Saved by your title!)  The two faces appear to be of different sizes, the reflection seems to "cancel" out most of the person behind the glass.  Very wierd and creative shot.  Sorry, but I still don''t like it that much.  6 Swash', '2002-10-01 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
