(132106, 6377, 327, '<td valign="top">Alright I''m as old as dirt.....lol...Many of my friends had these in 69-70. They were so hot. Still are and this is very nice one...cared for with love. Nice. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'Alright I''m as old as dirt.....lol...Many of my friends had these in 69-70. They were so hot. Still are and this is very nice one...cared for with love. Nice. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-30 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132107, 6377, 2717, '<td valign="top">Cool Car...</td>', 'Cool Car...', '2002-09-30 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132108, 6377, 3932, '<td valign="top">Visually... this is unappealing to me.  I see a SLIGHT amount of reflection on the side of the vehicle, but have no clue what is really reflecting.  I also see a slight amount of reflection on the front bumper.  I just don''t see an obvious reflection in this shot?  -   4   -   JB</td>', 'Visually... this is unappealing to me.  I see a SLIGHT amount of reflection on the side of the vehicle, but have no clue what is really reflecting.  I also see a slight amount of reflection on the front bumper.  I just don''t see an obvious reflection in this shot?  -   4   -   JB', '2002-09-30 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132109, 6377, 1005, '<td valign="top">Photo appears to be inversed (look at the grill).  Is your reflection the side of the car?   If so, not very distinct.  Nit time:  I see two dots, one above the front tire and one below the grill, do you need to clean your lens or are these from the sun?  If you want to explain your reflection so I can better understand it, I would be willing to reconsider your score.  7 Swash<br/>Oh yes,  this is a fine shot of this car!<br/>A reflection within a reflection, very clever indeed.  At first glance, this seemed more like an opportunity to display your "pride and joy".  Steering wheel is on the wrong side, too.  I really should have guessed this one.  I wonder if the Site Admins would be willing to place a note on this one, saying notice the steering wheel and car name in the grill?????  Score up to notches!  9 Swash</td>', 'Photo appears to be inversed (look at the grill).  Is your reflection the side of the car?   If so, not very distinct.  Nit time:  I see two dots, one above the front tire and one below the grill, do you need to clean your lens or are these from the sun?  If you want to explain your reflection so I can better understand it, I would be willing to reconsider your score.  7 SwashOh yes,  this is a fine shot of this car!A reflection within a reflection, very clever indeed.  At first glance, this seemed more like an opportunity to display your "pride and joy".  Steering wheel is on the wrong side, too.  I really should have guessed this one.  I wonder if the Site Admins would be willing to place a note on this one, saying notice the steering wheel and car name in the grill?????  Score up to notches!  9 Swash', '2002-10-01 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132110, 6377, 3730, '<td valign="top">nice car...but I can think of at least 10 different angles that would make this an ok photo...just my opinion...and where''s the reflection?</td>', 'nice car...but I can think of at least 10 different angles that would make this an ok photo...just my opinion...and where''s the reflection?', '2002-10-01 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132111, 6377, 2490, '<td valign="top">I wish I could identify the reflection and that the background was cleaner.  Nothing against little buildings, but it would help the shot. 6 nards656</td>', 'I wish I could identify the reflection and that the background was cleaner.  Nothing against little buildings, but it would help the shot. 6 nards656', '2002-10-01 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
