(132121, 6377, 1005, '<td valign="top">Spiller, you did too good of a job with this reflection.  Suggestion for next time, include part of the truck''s window frame.  You''ll get nailed for it, but at least the people will see your reflection.  (Same thing happened to me for the Illusions challenge)  Swash</td>', 'Spiller, you did too good of a job with this reflection.  Suggestion for next time, include part of the truck''s window frame.  You''ll get nailed for it, but at least the people will see your reflection.  (Same thing happened to me for the Illusions challenge)  Swash', '2002-11-14 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
