(132123, 6378, 3932, '<td valign="top">I would love to give this a higher score... I really like the idea!  It just seems... a bit harsh?  Definitely meets the challenege... definitely has appeal... just a bit off technically.   -    7 -    JB</td>', 'I would love to give this a higher score... I really like the idea!  It just seems... a bit harsh?  Definitely meets the challenege... definitely has appeal... just a bit off technically.   -    7 -    JB', '2002-09-30 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
