(132126, 6378, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very creative and I love the reflection.  One of this weeks faves for me!  DPz</td>', 'Very creative and I love the reflection.  One of this weeks faves for me!  DPz', '2002-09-30 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132127, 6378, 3599, '<td valign="top">looks like you may have gone a little more on the unsharp mask than you should have.  either that or it just seems off to me.</td>', 'looks like you may have gone a little more on the unsharp mask than you should have.  either that or it just seems off to me.', '2002-10-01 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132128, 6378, 2928, '<td valign="top">I like the idea  I love frogs For me, the composition of the shot is a little too central; I''d have been temped to treat a shot like this in much the same way as the negative space challenge and used the background to focus attention onto Froggy.  Maybe, zoom out a few feet and place Froggy in the top right third of the image.  Hope that doesn''t sound too pedantic, good luck, and hey, it''s a not a bad shot anyway (7)</td>', 'I like the idea  I love frogs For me, the composition of the shot is a little too central; I''d have been temped to treat a shot like this in much the same way as the negative space challenge and used the background to focus attention onto Froggy.  Maybe, zoom out a few feet and place Froggy in the top right third of the image.  Hope that doesn''t sound too pedantic, good luck, and hey, it''s a not a bad shot anyway (7)', '2002-10-01 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132129, 6378, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot.  I like how I can see his body underwater and his head so clearly above.  Appears it has been sharpened a bit much.</td>', 'This is a very cool shot.  I like how I can see his body underwater and his head so clearly above.  Appears it has been sharpened a bit much.', '2002-10-01 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132130, 6378, 4343, '<td valign="top">Rule of 1/3''s would help this shot, nice try.</td>', 'Rule of 1/3''s would help this shot, nice try.', '2002-10-02 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132131, 6378, 2111, '<td valign="top">The part I like about this picture is you probably werent going to the pond to get a reflection of the frogs eyes. U were probably trying to see what reflected in the water. 7 for spontenaity Mags Coyote</td>', 'The part I like about this picture is you probably werent going to the pond to get a reflection of the frogs eyes. U were probably trying to see what reflected in the water. 7 for spontenaity Mags Coyote', '2002-10-02 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132132, 6378, 4358, '<td valign="top">wow...</td>', 'wow...', '2002-10-02 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132133, 6378, 3317, '<td valign="top">the trouble with frogs is that they''re all unionized, they all have agents, and they''ll sue your butt off if you didn''t get a release to use their likeness. side-effect of that whole budweiser thing. watch your back. amphibians.</td>', 'the trouble with frogs is that they''re all unionized, they all have agents, and they''ll sue your butt off if you didn''t get a release to use their likeness. side-effect of that whole budweiser thing. watch your back. amphibians.', '2002-10-02 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
