(132136, 6378, 4410, '<td valign="top">There once was a chicken who kept signing out a library book saying book..book ..the chicken left and came back for another book and then another and another...finally the librarian followed the chicken out of the library into a meadow and to the edge of a pond  where the chicken sat down and showed the book to a frog...every time the frog saw the book he said "read it" read it"  ha ha</td>', 'There once was a chicken who kept signing out a library book saying book..book ..the chicken left and came back for another book and then another and another...finally the librarian followed the chicken out of the library into a meadow and to the edge of a pond  where the chicken sat down and showed the book to a frog...every time the frog saw the book he said "read it" read it"  ha ha', '2002-10-05 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132137, 6378, 3982, '<td valign="top">How many frogs do you have to kiss before you find a prince?</td>', 'How many frogs do you have to kiss before you find a prince?', '2002-10-05 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
