(132145, 6379, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this.  A very good example of breaking the "thirds" rule to advantage.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious<br/></td>', 'I like this.  A very good example of breaking the "thirds" rule to advantage.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
