(132221, 6381, 3447, '<td valign="top">I''m sure Amanda is attractive but that is not a "reflective surface" as specified in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m sure Amanda is attractive but that is not a "reflective surface" as specified in the challenge.', '2002-10-03 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132222, 6381, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot I really like it but it does have quite a big flaw (in my opinion) The first thing I saw when I looked at the shot was a crack in the class just above right, centre.  It may not actually be a crack, but whatever it is, it totally kills the uniformity of the whole shot  mainly because it''s too close to thirds intersection I think I found, no matter how often I looked, it was the thing that I focused on first.  Once I''d gotten past that, the shot is absolutely superb.  The diagonal lines add drama, this works superbly with the pose, add to that the lighting and texture and the result  without crack  is indeed stunning.  If this is being marked down, it may well be the subliminal effect of the crack With this many pictures, some people may only look once (8) Great shooting</td>', 'This is a stunning shot I really like it but it does have quite a big flaw (in my opinion) The first thing I saw when I looked at the shot was a crack in the class just above right, centre.  It may not actually be a crack, but whatever it is, it totally kills the uniformity of the whole shot  mainly because it''s too close to thirds intersection I think I found, no matter how often I looked, it was the thing that I focused on first.  Once I''d gotten past that, the shot is absolutely superb.  The diagonal lines add drama, this works superbly with the pose, add to that the lighting and texture and the result  without crack  is indeed stunning.  If this is being marked down, it may well be the subliminal effect of the crack With this many pictures, some people may only look once (8) Great shooting', '2002-10-04 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132223, 6381, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like the texture of the reflective surface very much, as well as the lines in it. <br/>Kavey</td>', 'Very interesting. I like the texture of the reflective surface very much, as well as the lines in it. Kavey', '2002-10-04 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
