(132269, 6385, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is glass. Inside a round transparent ''skin'' is a green egg-shape. On  the border of the green and transparent there are bubbles. At certain apertures and focusing distances all the bubbles on one side are reflected in each bubble. Probably the roundish transparent outer skin and backlight have something to do with it. I found out a few weeks ago during Macro and tiff vs jpeg tests and was able to repeate the shot for this challenge. It took about 20 shots to find one with the effect and a good clean focus. Each bubble is app. 2mm in size and I believe that the whole image shows 1.5 to 2cm wide.<br/>The stripes inside the glass are just invariancies I guess, hardly visible with the naked eye, but I understand that you could think it is jello. I dont think you can get this effect in jello tough.<br/><br/>The shot was captured in the SuperMacro mode of the Fuji.</td>', 'It is glass. Inside a round transparent ''skin'' is a green egg-shape. On  the border of the green and transparent there are bubbles. At certain apertures and focusing distances all the bubbles on one side are reflected in each bubble. Probably the roundish transparent outer skin and backlight have something to do with it. I found out a few weeks ago during Macro and tiff vs jpeg tests and was able to repeate the shot for this challenge. It took about 20 shots to find one with the effect and a good clean focus. Each bubble is app. 2mm in size and I believe that the whole image shows 1.5 to 2cm wide.The stripes inside the glass are just invariancies I guess, hardly visible with the naked eye, but I understand that you could think it is jello. I dont think you can get this effect in jello tough.The shot was captured in the SuperMacro mode of the Fuji.', '2002-10-07 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(132270, 6387, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Wonderful colours and reflection.  Nice :) 9</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Wonderful colours and reflection.  Nice :) 9', '2002-09-30 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132271, 6387, 2553, '<td valign="top">Title not needed. Beautiful shot.  lhall-9</td>', 'Title not needed. Beautiful shot.  lhall-9', '2002-09-30 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132272, 6387, 3540, '<td valign="top">Lose the foreground rocks and I give you a 9....</td>', 'Lose the foreground rocks and I give you a 9....', '2002-09-30 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132273, 6387, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot with one small  in my opinion  element that lets it down. The rock at the bottom of picture draws you away, a bit like looking at the finger rather than to where it is pointing.  Crop that out and I think it would be a lot closer to the big Oooh factor.  Other than that, I think it''s a praiseworthy effort (7)</td>', 'This is a great shot with one small  in my opinion  element that lets it down. The rock at the bottom of picture draws you away, a bit like looking at the finger rather than to where it is pointing.  Crop that out and I think it would be a lot closer to the big Oooh factor.  Other than that, I think it''s a praiseworthy effort (7)', '2002-09-30 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132274, 6387, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. IMHO you could of cropped out the bottom rocks, they are distracting and way too bright. Over all this is a winner.  Score 8 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. IMHO you could of cropped out the bottom rocks, they are distracting and way too bright. Over all this is a winner.  Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
