(132292, 6388, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I don''t see a clearly defined reflection here.  I see a yellow light reflected in some spots on the tail light, but it really didn''t work for me.  Very nice shapes and lines, but a reflection really needs something to reflect.  At least in my opinion. If I''m missing something here, please feel free to enlighten me :) ~ myqyl ~</td>', 'I''m afraid I don''t see a clearly defined reflection here.  I see a yellow light reflected in some spots on the tail light, but it really didn''t work for me.  Very nice shapes and lines, but a reflection really needs something to reflect.  At least in my opinion. If I''m missing something here, please feel free to enlighten me :) ~ myqyl ~', '2002-09-30 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
