(132421, 6403, 772, '<td valign="top">challenge was no mirrors.. :( -setzler.. ok.. admin says it''s not a mirror... I''m wondering why you chose to make it appear so... i see now how it is done tho.. the candle wicks are not identical.... :)</td>', 'challenge was no mirrors.. :( -setzler.. ok.. admin says it''s not a mirror... I''m wondering why you chose to make it appear so... i see now how it is done tho.. the candle wicks are not identical.... :)', '2002-09-30 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132422, 6403, 4297, '<td valign="top">Very very clever, I had to come back to revise my vote on this one. UNfortunately the near perfection of the pseudo mirror might cause some people to think that this is a real mirror and not sticking to the format of the challnge.... Very creative..</td>', 'Very very clever, I had to come back to revise my vote on this one. UNfortunately the near perfection of the pseudo mirror might cause some people to think that this is a real mirror and not sticking to the format of the challnge.... Very creative..', '2002-09-30 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132423, 6403, 3002, '<td valign="top">This is very creative.  You can see that it is not a mirror, as the wicks on the candles are different, among other thing.  The only thing I see wrong with this image is that it is way too dark.</td>', 'This is very creative.  You can see that it is not a mirror, as the wicks on the candles are different, among other thing.  The only thing I see wrong with this image is that it is way too dark.', '2002-09-30 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
