(132443, 6403, 4162, '<td valign="top">Fun to play with.....!!  I like it!</td>', 'Fun to play with.....!!  I like it!', '2002-10-02 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132444, 6403, 2928, '<td valign="top">Aced Can''t fault this Lighting is dramatic.  I can''t quite see how you got the appearance of the double candle flame on the left side of the shot, possibly because there is glass in the frame, but however you did it, it''s the icing on an already mouth watering cake Fantastic inventiveness and superb shooting (10)</td>', 'Aced Can''t fault this Lighting is dramatic.  I can''t quite see how you got the appearance of the double candle flame on the left side of the shot, possibly because there is glass in the frame, but however you did it, it''s the icing on an already mouth watering cake Fantastic inventiveness and superb shooting (10)', '2002-10-03 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132445, 6403, 4182, '<td valign="top">umm isn''t that a mirror ?</td>', 'umm isn''t that a mirror ?', '2002-10-03 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132446, 6403, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever set up - feels a little dark and very orange, content doesn''t appeal overly to me. But clever idea.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Clever set up - feels a little dark and very orange, content doesn''t appeal overly to me. But clever idea.Kavey', '2002-10-03 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132447, 6403, 2700, '<td valign="top">Administrator Note: What you see is NOT a mirror.  Then what the hell is it?<br/>the reflected cadle is seen 2 times, once when the light is entering the mirror, and once when it is leaving the mirror. This same phenomena happens when you flip the swich on the rear view mirror in your car....</td>', 'Administrator Note: What you see is NOT a mirror.  Then what the hell is it?the reflected cadle is seen 2 times, once when the light is entering the mirror, and once when it is leaving the mirror. This same phenomena happens when you flip the swich on the rear view mirror in your car....', '2002-10-03 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132448, 6403, 4398, '<td valign="top">excellent - very clever</td>', 'excellent - very clever', '2002-10-04 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132449, 6403, 2798, '<td valign="top">Your light, framing and arrangement are all good. There''s plently to look at and just a subtle clue that this isn''t a real reflection (which is fine by me btw - In my opinion this fits the challenge just fine). My only question here is - why? Why make the reflection so similar that you can''t tell it''s not a real reflection? I''d bet that many voters didnt even spot it. 6 - floyd</td>', 'Your light, framing and arrangement are all good. There''s plently to look at and just a subtle clue that this isn''t a real reflection (which is fine by me btw - In my opinion this fits the challenge just fine). My only question here is - why? Why make the reflection so similar that you can''t tell it''s not a real reflection? I''d bet that many voters didnt even spot it. 6 - floyd', '2002-10-04 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132450, 6403, 3072, '<td valign="top">If what I see is not a mirror, this is a eat trick.</td>', 'If what I see is not a mirror, this is a eat trick.', '2002-10-04 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132451, 6403, 4444, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2002-10-06 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132452, 6403, 2109, '<td valign="top">duplicate set of items and an empty frame?  Just a guess.. its well done, but the lighting is a bit soft.  For all those people that likely recommended this for disqualification (mirror), tell them to take a closer look, especially at the candle wicks.  -8</td>', 'duplicate set of items and an empty frame?  Just a guess.. its well done, but the lighting is a bit soft.  For all those people that likely recommended this for disqualification (mirror), tell them to take a closer look, especially at the candle wicks.  -8', '2002-10-06 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132453, 6403, 4398, '<td valign="top">Not bad for your first entry</td>', 'Not bad for your first entry', '2002-10-07 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(132454, 6403, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, for those of you who no doubt marked this down as a 1 for using a mirror.. Look again, specifically at the wicks on the candles.. What you are seeing is a empty picture frame with the same scene set up on both sides using identical objects..<br/>Those who bothered to look into it, thanks for voting.. To be truthful I was expecting a higher position but then again for my first attempt I cannot expect miracles, I am still perfecting my technique and if I can place higher on the garbage challenge then I will be happy..<br/><br/>Mark.</td>', 'OK, for those of you who no doubt marked this down as a 1 for using a mirror.. Look again, specifically at the wicks on the candles.. What you are seeing is a empty picture frame with the same scene set up on both sides using identical objects..Those who bothered to look into it, thanks for voting.. To be truthful I was expecting a higher position but then again for my first attempt I cannot expect miracles, I am still perfecting my technique and if I can place higher on the garbage challenge then I will be happy..Mark.', '2002-10-07 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(132455, 6403, 4145, '<td valign="top">dont worry mate, its a really good picture, i know how u feel about not getting a higher mark, look for mine  ''Mystery''  number 199!  i thought it was a really good photograph for the situation i was in, but it has been slated.  keep it up and u''ll be fine</td>', 'dont worry mate, its a really good picture, i know how u feel about not getting a higher mark, look for mine  ''Mystery''  number 199!  i thought it was a really good photograph for the situation i was in, but it has been slated.  keep it up and u''ll be fine', '2002-10-08 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(132456, 6405, 2928, '<td valign="top">Superb idea, well executed.  I like the way you have done this; the hand was perhaps, not such a good selection because of the definition problems created by the virtually uncontrollable DOF.  Perhaps a car  or even just the window frame would have slightly improved the shot.  Having said that  it holds the attention and meets the challenge. (9)</td>', 'Superb idea, well executed.  I like the way you have done this; the hand was perhaps, not such a good selection because of the definition problems created by the virtually uncontrollable DOF.  Perhaps a car  or even just the window frame would have slightly improved the shot.  Having said that  it holds the attention and meets the challenge. (9)', '2002-09-30 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132457, 6405, 4198, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the execution. One thing that would have made this an OH WOW piece is for the reflected object to be an OH WOW object and to me the hand on the glass isn''t quite it. Not that I know what IT is but it isn''t my shot :) Good work.</td>', 'I like the concept and the execution. One thing that would have made this an OH WOW piece is for the reflected object to be an OH WOW object and to me the hand on the glass isn''t quite it. Not that I know what IT is but it isn''t my shot :) Good work.', '2002-09-30 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132458, 6405, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge, good detail around eye, clear reflection. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Meets challenge, good detail around eye, clear reflection. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132459, 6405, 3942, '<td valign="top">Cool reflections in the iris! Don''t like the composition and cropping.</td>', 'Cool reflections in the iris! Don''t like the composition and cropping.', '2002-09-30 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132460, 6405, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
