(132468, 6405, 3072, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture and a great concept, deserves first place.</td>', 'This is a great picture and a great concept, deserves first place.', '2002-10-04 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132469, 6405, 2553, '<td valign="top">Extreme close-ups of eyes kind of creep me out.  Your capture of the reflection is pretty good though.  lhall-6</td>', 'Extreme close-ups of eyes kind of creep me out.  Your capture of the reflection is pretty good though.  lhall-6', '2002-10-04 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132470, 6405, 4062, '<td valign="top">This image took about 90 tries to get right. Well, the focus isn''t spot on, I had a few shots that had better but they had some other faults. *sigh* Either the focus was wrong or the eye was in the wrong place :) .<br/>This image is a straight copy of the original, no cropping or other modifications done. The webcam I''m using is small so I can hold it right under my eye and I can get very nice macro shots by unscrewing the lens halfway.</td>', 'This image took about 90 tries to get right. Well, the focus isn''t spot on, I had a few shots that had better but they had some other faults. *sigh* Either the focus was wrong or the eye was in the wrong place :) .This image is a straight copy of the original, no cropping or other modifications done. The webcam I''m using is small so I can hold it right under my eye and I can get very nice macro shots by unscrewing the lens halfway.', '2002-10-07 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(132471, 6406, 51167, '<td valign="top">That is an awesome shot.  Hope no one rags on you too bad for being patriotic.  10 -Jubei</td>', 'That is an awesome shot.  Hope no one rags on you too bad for being patriotic.  10 -Jubei', '2002-09-30 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132472, 6406, 327, '<td valign="top">You did a good job, colors look great. Nice capture. Nice work. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'You did a good job, colors look great. Nice capture. Nice work. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-30 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132473, 6406, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Nice job!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132474, 6406, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but unexciting to me.  All I really see is a relatively flat piece of glass, very little texture and no contour, that''s reflecting... I wonder what the shot would look like with a harsh tilt?  Something to "loosen" the symmetry of the shot up?  -   6   -  JB</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but unexciting to me.  All I really see is a relatively flat piece of glass, very little texture and no contour, that''s reflecting... I wonder what the shot would look like with a harsh tilt?  Something to "loosen" the symmetry of the shot up?  -   6   -  JB', '2002-09-30 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132475, 6406, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  This is quite nice.  I love the angle and cropping/framing.  The lighting conditions were perfect for the shot.  Reflection is clear, visible, and well done.  Great shot! 9 Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very nicely done!  This is quite nice.  I love the angle and cropping/framing.  The lighting conditions were perfect for the shot.  Reflection is clear, visible, and well done.  Great shot! 9 Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-30 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
