(132593, 6417, 3080, '<td valign="top">This was not very obvious.  I knew there had to be a reflection in there somewhere.  I did finally find it only after brightening up my screen all the way.  The concept is good and your point is made well.  I am afraid that the reflection isn''t strong enough, and the people that wont take the time to try to see it will just mark it down.  It is a shame, as it is a really nice shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are great, and the focus is fine.  The lighting is nice on the subject.  Overall this is a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This was not very obvious.  I knew there had to be a reflection in there somewhere.  I did finally find it only after brightening up my screen all the way.  The concept is good and your point is made well.  I am afraid that the reflection isn''t strong enough, and the people that wont take the time to try to see it will just mark it down.  It is a shame, as it is a really nice shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are great, and the focus is fine.  The lighting is nice on the subject.  Overall this is a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-02 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
