(132599, 6417, 1827, '<td valign="top">I had some help on this one.  I had to turn the brightness on my monitor to it''s max in order to see this reflection.  I don''t know if it''s my monitor that''s off or yours, but perhaps when the challenge is over you can start a thread in the forums using your photo as an example for gamma settings or monitor calibration?  Anyway, good shot, though I wish the reflection were stronger.  6, just-married</td>', 'I had some help on this one.  I had to turn the brightness on my monitor to it''s max in order to see this reflection.  I don''t know if it''s my monitor that''s off or yours, but perhaps when the challenge is over you can start a thread in the forums using your photo as an example for gamma settings or monitor calibration?  Anyway, good shot, though I wish the reflection were stronger.  6, just-married', '2002-10-03 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
