(132649, 6419, 2472, '<td valign="top">IMHO, if you submit an image with such a basic problem as lack of focus, the only constructive critique you can expect is that, and that you already knew when you submitted the photo. I think you should have included the baby''s painted hand (right side of image), and not kept the baby right in the middle of the composition as an ordinary snapshot. I assume you used a flash, (although I might be wrong). Even if it''s another intense source of ilumination, it is very helpful to use a gauze strip or some translucent white fabric in front of it, in order to soften the strike of light. The girl is totally cute.</td>', 'IMHO, if you submit an image with such a basic problem as lack of focus, the only constructive critique you can expect is that, and that you already knew when you submitted the photo. I think you should have included the baby''s painted hand (right side of image), and not kept the baby right in the middle of the composition as an ordinary snapshot. I assume you used a flash, (although I might be wrong). Even if it''s another intense source of ilumination, it is very helpful to use a gauze strip or some translucent white fabric in front of it, in order to soften the strike of light. The girl is totally cute.', '2002-10-01 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132650, 6419, 3730, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any reflections in the eyes....cute kid though</td>', 'I don''t see any reflections in the eyes....cute kid though', '2002-10-01 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
