(132690, 6420, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 8<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 10<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 9<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 9<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 9<br/><br/>Score: 9 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 8Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 10Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 9Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 9WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 9Score: 9 - setzler', '2002-10-04 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132691, 6420, 2667, '<td valign="top">strong graphic composition and I really like the juxtaposition of the hard gloss and the fuzzy kitty...too cute. (10)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'strong graphic composition and I really like the juxtaposition of the hard gloss and the fuzzy kitty...too cute. (10)  ~mcmurma', '2002-10-04 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
