(132704, 6421, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow...sure is a lot of reflections here.  Definetly meets the challenge easily. Is it a reflection of light fixture on a table?  Good job! Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Wow...sure is a lot of reflections here.  Definetly meets the challenge easily. Is it a reflection of light fixture on a table?  Good job! Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132705, 6421, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative-Nice job. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Creative-Nice job. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132706, 6421, 2978, '<td valign="top">groovy!!</td>', 'groovy!!', '2002-10-01 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132707, 6421, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but very busy.  Lighting levels are very good.  Lots of reflections!  Very good focus.  Sooooo busy!  7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting, but very busy.  Lighting levels are very good.  Lots of reflections!  Very good focus.  Sooooo busy!  7 Swash', '2002-10-01 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132708, 6421, 3419, '<td valign="top">While the colors are great and the reflections are sharp (I can''t tell which is reflection or real), this photo is extremely busy. As a result, I find it difficult to look at it.</td>', 'While the colors are great and the reflections are sharp (I can''t tell which is reflection or real), this photo is extremely busy. As a result, I find it difficult to look at it.', '2002-10-01 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132709, 6421, 2928, '<td valign="top">The theory of order out of chaos is well founded in this shot.  This is superb in every respect apart from one small, but hugely slap in the face, point.  The white balance  If the white balance had been set, the colour cast wouldn''t be there.  This may have been by design, but I think it takes an awful lot away from a picture that  I think  could have been stunning.  The confusion in the shot creates a superb sense of drama and that element is out of this world; it''s inventive and it fits the challenge (8)  Sorry to score this as low as that, I think it''s fantastic apart from that cast</td>', 'The theory of order out of chaos is well founded in this shot.  This is superb in every respect apart from one small, but hugely slap in the face, point.  The white balance  If the white balance had been set, the colour cast wouldn''t be there.  This may have been by design, but I think it takes an awful lot away from a picture that  I think  could have been stunning.  The confusion in the shot creates a superb sense of drama and that element is out of this world; it''s inventive and it fits the challenge (8)  Sorry to score this as low as that, I think it''s fantastic apart from that cast', '2002-10-02 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132710, 6421, 4316, '<td valign="top">Many lights and reflection.  It give a pattern of texture.</td>', 'Many lights and reflection.  It give a pattern of texture.', '2002-10-02 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132711, 6421, 2553, '<td valign="top">Has kind of a modern abstract feel to it.  Your focus is great- I think it''s hard to get great focus on reflections a lot of the time.  There''s a lot going on in the composition and I find it difficult for my eye to find  a place to "rest".  The color range is very pleasing. lhall-7</td>', 'Has kind of a modern abstract feel to it.  Your focus is great- I think it''s hard to get great focus on reflections a lot of the time.  There''s a lot going on in the composition and I find it difficult for my eye to find  a place to "rest".  The color range is very pleasing. lhall-7', '2002-10-02 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132712, 6421, 3672, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of all the reflective lights. Good job 9 smshats</td>', 'I really like the use of all the reflective lights. Good job 9 smshats', '2002-10-02 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132713, 6421, 3127, '<td valign="top">Nice refelctions. Great shot!</td>', 'Nice refelctions. Great shot!', '2002-10-04 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
