(132828, 6433, 637, '<td valign="top">I like the composition... that all the action is on both sides... nothing special in the middle.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'I like the composition... that all the action is on both sides... nothing special in the middle.  6 sjgleah', '2002-10-01 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
