(132830, 6433, 3557, '<td valign="top">Not bad.</td>', 'Not bad.', '2002-10-01 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132831, 6433, 2923, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection.  But I don''t see my eyes being locked on a subject, sort of very touristy.  I think the reflection on the boat on the left is very interesting and if you were to concentrate on that more, this image would''ve been a lot more effective such that you show a bit of the boat and you show the reflection (sort of cropping on the bottom left corner of this photo, just an opinion.  paganini</td>', 'Very nice reflection.  But I don''t see my eyes being locked on a subject, sort of very touristy.  I think the reflection on the boat on the left is very interesting and if you were to concentrate on that more, this image would''ve been a lot more effective such that you show a bit of the boat and you show the reflection (sort of cropping on the bottom left corner of this photo, just an opinion.  paganini', '2002-10-02 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132832, 6433, 4008, '<td valign="top">Looks to give plenty of opportunity to make a more special composition, for example concentrate on the reflection of the white boat to the left</td>', 'Looks to give plenty of opportunity to make a more special composition, for example concentrate on the reflection of the white boat to the left', '2002-10-02 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132833, 6433, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.   It looks a little oversharpened to  me, but I am going to assume that is caused by my monitor (it tends to do such things).  karmat</td>', 'I really like this shot.   It looks a little oversharpened to  me, but I am going to assume that is caused by my monitor (it tends to do such things).  karmat', '2002-10-02 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132834, 6433, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well taken and captures the light and freshness of the day well. Too much to look at for me - I can''t find a point of focus - and the least interesting bit is between the two points of interest - the white boat and the two at the left, and because I keep flicking from one side to the other the boring bit ends up standing out more. If that makes any sense?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Well taken and captures the light and freshness of the day well. Too much to look at for me - I can''t find a point of focus - and the least interesting bit is between the two points of interest - the white boat and the two at the left, and because I keep flicking from one side to the other the boring bit ends up standing out more. If that makes any sense?Kavey', '2002-10-03 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132835, 6433, 4388, '<td valign="top">very good water picture!</td>', 'very good water picture!', '2002-10-03 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132836, 6433, 554, '<td valign="top">I really like this one and I overlook the clarity (focus). likely due to reduction or is my monitor. 10 and this weeks wallpaper.</td>', 'I really like this one and I overlook the clarity (focus). likely due to reduction or is my monitor. 10 and this weeks wallpaper.', '2002-10-03 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
