(132838, 6433, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is one of the interpretations of this challenge. I love the lines in this. The color is great  10, Gotcha<br/></td>', 'This is one of the interpretations of this challenge. I love the lines in this. The color is great  10, Gotcha', '2002-10-06 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132839, 6434, 1143, '<td valign="top">Hey! I like the colors of the sky. My biggest problem with this shot is technical. The quality seems to be lacking. It seems grainy, and the focus is soft. Did you use a tripod? Also, it''s a cute idea but doesn''t utilize reflections as well as some of the other entries.</td>', 'Hey! I like the colors of the sky. My biggest problem with this shot is technical. The quality seems to be lacking. It seems grainy, and the focus is soft. Did you use a tripod? Also, it''s a cute idea but doesn''t utilize reflections as well as some of the other entries.', '2002-09-30 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132840, 6434, 3380, '<td valign="top">I like the title.</td>', 'I like the title.', '2002-09-30 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132841, 6434, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Well executed.</td>', 'Great picture.  Well executed.', '2002-09-30 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132842, 6434, 327, '<td valign="top">Hee hee. Good title. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Hee hee. Good title. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-30 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132843, 6434, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great idea and not a bad shot considering the degradation the image must have suffered to get it.  No lake  great, gets another point :o)  I like a lot of things here, but  and I know how hard it would be to improve it  it does lack a bit of sharpness (8) First class idea</td>', 'Great idea and not a bad shot considering the degradation the image must have suffered to get it.  No lake  great, gets another point :o)  I like a lot of things here, but  and I know how hard it would be to improve it  it does lack a bit of sharpness (8) First class idea', '2002-10-01 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132844, 6434, 2618, '<td valign="top">Living room lights reflected in a doubled glazed window? Smart idea.</td>', 'Living room lights reflected in a doubled glazed window? Smart idea.', '2002-10-01 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132845, 6434, 4378, '<td valign="top">HEY  " Mulder"...is that it, thats your reflection???try focusing more on that area where u have your "ufo''s" (reflected lights), coz the picture is too much on the scene NOT ON THE reflection-WHICH IS WHAT THIS CHALLENGE IS ABOUT!</td>', 'HEY  " Mulder"...is that it, thats your reflection???try focusing more on that area where u have your "ufo''s" (reflected lights), coz the picture is too much on the scene NOT ON THE reflection-WHICH IS WHAT THIS CHALLENGE IS ABOUT!', '2002-10-03 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132846, 6434, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cunning.<br/>And very witty.<br/>Bit blurry for my tastes and the tree on the right is just too large a block of black for me - a little too dense to make a great silhouette. <br/>But...<br/>cunning.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Cunning.And very witty.Bit blurry for my tastes and the tree on the right is just too large a block of black for me - a little too dense to make a great silhouette. But...cunning.Kavey', '2002-10-03 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
