(132864, 6435, 3080, '<td valign="top">That''s a shiny grill.  Your reflections are clear and very noticable.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  The colors are very nice.  LIghting conditions were perfect.  I like the curved look the reflections take on in the grill.  The focus and clarity are excelent.  Great shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'That''s a shiny grill.  Your reflections are clear and very noticable.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  The colors are very nice.  LIghting conditions were perfect.  I like the curved look the reflections take on in the grill.  The focus and clarity are excelent.  Great shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-01 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
