(132877, 6437, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice colors off the reflector, but the reflection from the mounting is not at all clear.  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice colors off the reflector, but the reflection from the mounting is not at all clear.  6 Swash', '2002-10-01 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132878, 6437, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 2<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 4<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 3<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 4<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 3<br/><br/>Score: 3 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 2Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 4Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 3Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 4WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 3Score: 3 - setzler', '2002-10-01 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132879, 6437, 3730, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2002-10-01 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132880, 6437, 3317, '<td valign="top">not quite reflective enough for my tastes.</td>', 'not quite reflective enough for my tastes.', '2002-10-02 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132881, 6437, 2553, '<td valign="top">I do not see any "discernable" subject in the reflections.  But maybe you were going for just light/shadow reflections. For me, this photo is very low impact.  The only real subject seems to be the light, and I do not find it to be very interesting.  The reflections just seem to be a by-product of shooting the light. lhall-4</td>', 'I do not see any "discernable" subject in the reflections.  But maybe you were going for just light/shadow reflections. For me, this photo is very low impact.  The only real subject seems to be the light, and I do not find it to be very interesting.  The reflections just seem to be a by-product of shooting the light. lhall-4', '2002-10-04 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132882, 6437, 4410, '<td valign="top">Good shot</td>', 'Good shot', '2002-10-05 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132883, 6438, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat title, I had to "reflect" on it a while before I got it.  Good job with the reflection as well. I kind of wonder about the guy hanging there.  I assume that it is a tourist attraction of some sort. Perhaps you could explain it after the challenge. DPz</td>', 'Neat title, I had to "reflect" on it a while before I got it.  Good job with the reflection as well. I kind of wonder about the guy hanging there.  I assume that it is a tourist attraction of some sort. Perhaps you could explain it after the challenge. DPz', '2002-09-30 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132884, 6438, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection.  I like the colors.  They came out really well for a reflection.</td>', 'Nice reflection.  I like the colors.  They came out really well for a reflection.', '2002-09-30 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
