(132888, 6438, 2989, '<td valign="top">The reflection was not a particular wow to me, but I gave you a 10 becuase of yout title.  I wish I had thought of that.  10 for creativity!</td>', 'The reflection was not a particular wow to me, but I gave you a 10 becuase of yout title.  I wish I had thought of that.  10 for creativity!', '2002-10-04 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
