(132897, 6439, 2109, '<td valign="top">Ok, believe this or not, when I saw the thumbnail of this image, I thought it was a picture of a canal in venice.  Go figure</td>', 'Ok, believe this or not, when I saw the thumbnail of this image, I thought it was a picture of a canal in venice.  Go figure', '2002-10-06 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132898, 6445, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, the challenge specifically says I should NOT see your camera... The Nikon is CLEARLY visable!<br/><br/>hehehe... Just kidding!  Great shot!!!</td>', 'I''m sorry, the challenge specifically says I should NOT see your camera... The Nikon is CLEARLY visable!hehehe... Just kidding!  Great shot!!!', '2002-09-30 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132899, 6445, 2780, '<td valign="top">"Dont show the camera in the shot" lol, just kidding. Nice photo, good idea, but I think it could be improved if the reflection was not doubled, and if those scratches weren''t there.<br/>7<br/>Konador</td>', '"Dont show the camera in the shot" lol, just kidding. Nice photo, good idea, but I think it could be improved if the reflection was not doubled, and if those scratches weren''t there.7Konador', '2002-09-30 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132900, 6445, 327, '<td valign="top">Kind of spooky, creative work. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'Kind of spooky, creative work. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-30 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132901, 6445, 4173, '<td valign="top">The face looks too dark and kinda blurry, nice.</td>', 'The face looks too dark and kinda blurry, nice.', '2002-09-30 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132902, 6445, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  If it weren''t so dark, this would be a 10 for creativity alone.  Is the lens chipped?  9 Swash</td>', 'Very cool.  If it weren''t so dark, this would be a 10 for creativity alone.  Is the lens chipped?  9 Swash', '2002-09-30 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132903, 6445, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very unique and interesting. A little eerie!  But it''s a great photo and a great reflection.  I like how the face is positioned in the lens.</td>', 'Very unique and interesting. A little eerie!  But it''s a great photo and a great reflection.  I like how the face is positioned in the lens.', '2002-10-01 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132904, 6445, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea. Technically, it is very good. The lighting and focus are right on. The crop seems a little too tight for my personal taste tho, and I don''t like seeing the inside of the camera. Was it really impossible to create a strong enough reflection so that you could avoid that? Maybe different lighting or something? I guess not.  *sigh*  ~indi</td>', 'I really like this idea. Technically, it is very good. The lighting and focus are right on. The crop seems a little too tight for my personal taste tho, and I don''t like seeing the inside of the camera. Was it really impossible to create a strong enough reflection so that you could avoid that? Maybe different lighting or something? I guess not.  *sigh*  ~indi', '2002-10-02 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132905, 6445, 3936, '<td valign="top">Wonder if this violates not showing the camera. &amp;lt;grin&amp;gt;  Good pic</td>', 'Wonder if this violates not showing the camera. &lt;grin&gt;  Good pic', '2002-10-02 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132906, 6445, 472, '<td valign="top">maybe the reflection would not have been so dark had you used more light on the face?  i found it helpful to light my reflected scene completely separately from the rest of the image..  i very much like the mood this conveys and the pertinence to the challenge!  mag99</td>', 'maybe the reflection would not have been so dark had you used more light on the face?  i found it helpful to light my reflected scene completely separately from the rest of the image..  i very much like the mood this conveys and the pertinence to the challenge!  mag99', '2002-10-02 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132907, 6445, 4363, '<td valign="top">would crop the top to bring attention the the frount of the lens and the reflection</td>', 'would crop the top to bring attention the the frount of the lens and the reflection', '2002-10-02 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132908, 6445, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great idea, superbly done  Just the right level of lighting to give the shot a really spooky appearance. The only improvement I could possibly suggest here relates to the word Nikon. Because it also reflects the background, it does detract from the within notion - but I haven''t a clue as to how you could have prevented that. Aside from the really trivial point, it''s a great shot (9)</td>', 'Great idea, superbly done  Just the right level of lighting to give the shot a really spooky appearance. The only improvement I could possibly suggest here relates to the word Nikon. Because it also reflects the background, it does detract from the within notion - but I haven''t a clue as to how you could have prevented that. Aside from the really trivial point, it''s a great shot (9)', '2002-10-03 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
