(132940, 6448, 2618, '<td valign="top">Is this is tiny 1:1 crop from a much bigger shot? It looks really grainy. Also the swan''s back is over exposed and just a big white lump. Other than that, a nice picture! I really like the swan''s pose and the ripples centered on his beak. Artistically good but technically flawed I think. 5</td>', 'Is this is tiny 1:1 crop from a much bigger shot? It looks really grainy. Also the swan''s back is over exposed and just a big white lump. Other than that, a nice picture! I really like the swan''s pose and the ripples centered on his beak. Artistically good but technically flawed I think. 5', '2002-10-02 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132941, 6448, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think a sharp reflection would have worked better here.  The softness is too distracting.  Great subject.</td>', 'I think a sharp reflection would have worked better here.  The softness is too distracting.  Great subject.', '2002-10-02 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132942, 6448, 2490, '<td valign="top">Apparently you are trying to tell me that you wnat this to be soft.  I personally think it takes away from the photo for the focus to be this soft.  6 nards656</td>', 'Apparently you are trying to tell me that you wnat this to be soft.  I personally think it takes away from the photo for the focus to be this soft.  6 nards656', '2002-10-02 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
