(132956, 6449, 4173, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why you used what you did to make the reflection.  It looks so much like a mirror that I wouldn''t be suprized if this shot comes is last place.  It''s a great photo, but it looks so much like a mirror that it''s EXTREMELY hard to vote around the fact that it isn''t.</td>', 'I have no idea why you used what you did to make the reflection.  It looks so much like a mirror that I wouldn''t be suprized if this shot comes is last place.  It''s a great photo, but it looks so much like a mirror that it''s EXTREMELY hard to vote around the fact that it isn''t.', '2002-09-30 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
