(132958, 6449, 1005, '<td valign="top">The admin note wasn''t really nessessary, IF people would really look at the photos!  The left coat is a woman, the right is a man.  nouf said!  Great creativity!  9 Swash</td>', 'The admin note wasn''t really nessessary, IF people would really look at the photos!  The left coat is a woman, the right is a man.  nouf said!  Great creativity!  9 Swash', '2002-09-30 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
