(132961, 6449, 4266, '<td valign="top">I liked this one because the very first thought I had was "Hey! That''s a mirror!" Of course, upon looking closer, I can see that it''s not.  I''ve been back a few times to look at it and am liking it even more because of the subtle differences in the reflection.<br/><br/>Very tricky.</td>', 'I liked this one because the very first thought I had was "Hey! That''s a mirror!" Of course, upon looking closer, I can see that it''s not.  I''ve been back a few times to look at it and am liking it even more because of the subtle differences in the reflection.Very tricky.', '2002-10-01 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132962, 6449, 1779, '<td valign="top">aren''t you glad someone actually though this was a mirror... : )</td>', 'aren''t you glad someone actually though this was a mirror... : )', '2002-10-01 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132963, 6449, 3859, '<td valign="top">Ah ha!  Took me a minute, but then I realized that the two hats were a bit different, then I noticed the coats were. It is a very cool idea,  and I think I can see what you were trying to accomplish, but for this challenge, IMO, it is not a reflection.</td>', 'Ah ha!  Took me a minute, but then I realized that the two hats were a bit different, then I noticed the coats were. It is a very cool idea,  and I think I can see what you were trying to accomplish, but for this challenge, IMO, it is not a reflection.', '2002-10-01 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132964, 6449, 4316, '<td valign="top">Very good!  This is not a mirror image.</td>', 'Very good!  This is not a mirror image.', '2002-10-01 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132965, 6449, 3557, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2002-10-01 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132966, 6449, 2618, '<td valign="top">Warning, this mirror will invert your gender! Cool.<br/><br/>I would have rotated it round a bit though. Have the ''mirror'' at 45degrees and the ''reflected'' stand a little more head on. Having the frame obscuring part of the clothes is just distracting to me. Brilliant idea though. 8</td>', 'Warning, this mirror will invert your gender! Cool.I would have rotated it round a bit though. Have the ''mirror'' at 45degrees and the ''reflected'' stand a little more head on. Having the frame obscuring part of the clothes is just distracting to me. Brilliant idea though. 8', '2002-10-01 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132967, 6449, 2490, '<td valign="top">Only a careless observer would think this is a reflection.  I appreciate the humor, but can''t see even a faked reflection.  5 nards656</td>', 'Only a careless observer would think this is a reflection.  I appreciate the humor, but can''t see even a faked reflection.  5 nards656', '2002-10-01 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132968, 6449, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice illusion, but not a reflection.   Good pic though.</td>', 'Nice illusion, but not a reflection.   Good pic though.', '2002-10-02 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132969, 6449, 2928, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh, great shot I''ve been playing spot the difference for the last twenty minutes.  I can''t fault the composition, but I can fault it in one area.  The focus is slightly off.  But, that doesn''t mean the shot isn''t first class Any shot that can hold the attention for twenty minutes has to get a good score Great idea, worth ten for the idea alone, I really like the '' at first glance it''s a blooming mirror'' effect Then you start to spot the subtle changes made between the two subjects Keep this up, it''s inventive shots like this that make DPC a special place. (10+++)</td>', 'Ohhhh, great shot I''ve been playing spot the difference for the last twenty minutes.  I can''t fault the composition, but I can fault it in one area.  The focus is slightly off.  But, that doesn''t mean the shot isn''t first class Any shot that can hold the attention for twenty minutes has to get a good score Great idea, worth ten for the idea alone, I really like the '' at first glance it''s a blooming mirror'' effect Then you start to spot the subtle changes made between the two subjects Keep this up, it''s inventive shots like this that make DPC a special place. (10+++)', '2002-10-02 05:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(132970, 6449, 3599, '<td valign="top">if this isn''t a mirror what is it.  i like it though.</td>', 'if this isn''t a mirror what is it.  i like it though.', '2002-10-02 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
