(133036, 6453, 4269, '<td valign="top">very interesting architecture and photo</td>', 'very interesting architecture and photo', '2002-10-05 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133037, 6453, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is one of my absolute favourites this week. I love the way it seems to interweave these two, very interesting buildings. It kind of suggests an interconnectedness of all the people who live in them. I don''t know... I get a sense of close community from it. Great work - lisae</td>', 'This is one of my absolute favourites this week. I love the way it seems to interweave these two, very interesting buildings. It kind of suggests an interconnectedness of all the people who live in them. I don''t know... I get a sense of close community from it. Great work - lisae', '2002-10-06 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133038, 6453, 4316, '<td valign="top">Imginative!</td>', 'Imginative!', '2002-10-06 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133039, 6455, 4052, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I would have liked to see a less busy background, maybe just the watch and ring with a solid background.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I would have liked to see a less busy background, maybe just the watch and ring with a solid background.', '2002-09-30 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133040, 6455, 3900, '<td valign="top">I see at least two different reflections here.  Unfortunately, one seems to be a mirror, which is what the subjects are lying on.  And this seems to be the majority reflector here.  It looks like a mirror used in jewelry displays.  Therefore, I have to conclude that this does not meet the challenge as described.</td>', 'I see at least two different reflections here.  Unfortunately, one seems to be a mirror, which is what the subjects are lying on.  And this seems to be the majority reflector here.  It looks like a mirror used in jewelry displays.  Therefore, I have to conclude that this does not meet the challenge as described.', '2002-09-30 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133041, 6455, 327, '<td valign="top">Not crazy for the red/gold in the upper left. However most of the composition is just super. The blue is sure nice and so is the reflection. This is nice. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Not crazy for the red/gold in the upper left. However most of the composition is just super. The blue is sure nice and so is the reflection. This is nice. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133042, 6455, 4162, '<td valign="top">Maybe nicer if just the watch had been used (beautiful colours!)</td>', 'Maybe nicer if just the watch had been used (beautiful colours!)', '2002-09-30 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133043, 6455, 3913, '<td valign="top">Nice job, I like the ring.</td>', 'Nice job, I like the ring.', '2002-09-30 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133044, 6455, 2928, '<td valign="top">For me, this would have been superb but for a small  but hugely invasive  point; the diagonal wooden strut.  This just drags the eye away from what is a really good idea.  The shot itself, if you mask out the wooden bit, is first class; great colour, superb composition and terrific use of DOF. The other effect of the diagonal in this shot, is to remove the mood balance - rather like playing loud rock music at a chess club Sorry to be so negative, but it''s a really good shot that could have been superb (7)</td>', 'For me, this would have been superb but for a small  but hugely invasive  point; the diagonal wooden strut.  This just drags the eye away from what is a really good idea.  The shot itself, if you mask out the wooden bit, is first class; great colour, superb composition and terrific use of DOF. The other effect of the diagonal in this shot, is to remove the mood balance - rather like playing loud rock music at a chess club Sorry to be so negative, but it''s a really good shot that could have been superb (7)', '2002-09-30 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133045, 6455, 3751, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, I would have done something different on the background.</td>', 'I really like the idea, I would have done something different on the background.', '2002-09-30 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133046, 6455, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge just fine.  The chain being oof doesn''t really add anything good to the image.  I think it would be better without it.   Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Meets the challenge just fine.  The chain being oof doesn''t really add anything good to the image.  I think it would be better without it.   Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133047, 6455, 3280, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this week.  Actually a double-reflection!!  I love the color of the watch and you composition and lighting.  Great job!  DPz</td>', 'One of my favorites this week.  Actually a double-reflection!!  I love the color of the watch and you composition and lighting.  Great job!  DPz', '2002-09-30 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133048, 6455, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the different "levels" of reflections.  My only suggestion would be to play with angles so that you wouldn''t have the distracting background (is this on top of a piano?). karmat</td>', 'I like the different "levels" of reflections.  My only suggestion would be to play with angles so that you wouldn''t have the distracting background (is this on top of a piano?). karmat', '2002-10-01 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133049, 6455, 4008, '<td valign="top">Composition could have been better. Chain is across the reflection. Red item is disturbing.</td>', 'Composition could have been better. Chain is across the reflection. Red item is disturbing.', '2002-10-01 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133050, 6455, 4049, '<td valign="top">The chain is too blurry, and the background is distracting.</td>', 'The chain is too blurry, and the background is distracting.', '2002-10-01 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133051, 6455, 2618, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections in the watch itself although I''ve no idea what is creating those bright spots!</td>', 'I like the reflections in the watch itself although I''ve no idea what is creating those bright spots!', '2002-10-02 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133052, 6455, 2490, '<td valign="top">Knowing personally how hard this shot is makes me vote it up a notch.  9 nards656</td>', 'Knowing personally how hard this shot is makes me vote it up a notch.  9 nards656', '2002-10-02 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133053, 6455, 4182, '<td valign="top">a lot of reflection sin this picture I count like 10 so goo effort .. just a little setupo boring for my taste</td>', 'a lot of reflection sin this picture I count like 10 so goo effort .. just a little setupo boring for my taste', '2002-10-02 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133054, 6455, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is good. The only negative I can see is the brown pole or leg in the top left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'This is good. The only negative I can see is the brown pole or leg in the top left is a bit distracting.', '2002-10-02 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133055, 6455, 637, '<td valign="top">Original, yet classic.  7 sjgleah</td>', 'Original, yet classic.  7 sjgleah', '2002-10-03 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133056, 6455, 674, '<td valign="top">Technically correct , exposure, focus6, saturation7 , contrast.7<br/>Good composition.6 very busy and the out of focus chain spoils it  <br/>Tells a story or creates a mood 6<br/>      Impact to the viewer 5<br/>Relevance to the Challenge 9<br/>Overall6<br/>sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct , exposure, focus6, saturation7 , contrast.7Good composition.6 very busy and the out of focus chain spoils it  Tells a story or creates a mood 6      Impact to the viewer 5Relevance to the Challenge 9Overall6sulamk', '2002-10-03 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133057, 6455, 4378, '<td valign="top">THEY''RE ASKIN'' FOR THE REFLECTION , NOT FOR A MAGAZINE AD EFFECT. u focused too much on the subjects, instead of the reflections!</td>', 'THEY''RE ASKIN'' FOR THE REFLECTION , NOT FOR A MAGAZINE AD EFFECT. u focused too much on the subjects, instead of the reflections!', '2002-10-03 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133058, 6455, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice but looks a bit put-together</td>', 'nice but looks a bit put-together', '2002-10-03 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133059, 6455, 3599, '<td valign="top">i''m impressed with the double reflection from the watch and ring.  the chain in the foreground really stands out and almost gives this picture a 3d look.  good job and good luck.</td>', 'i''m impressed with the double reflection from the watch and ring.  the chain in the foreground really stands out and almost gives this picture a 3d look.  good job and good luck.', '2002-10-04 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133060, 6455, 3982, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this photo better if you had left out the chain and possibly movedin a little closer to the ring and watch. Good otherwise.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this photo better if you had left out the chain and possibly movedin a little closer to the ring and watch. Good otherwise.', '2002-10-05 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133061, 6455, 4269, '<td valign="top">I like very much and would have been a 10 from me if not for top left corner - so a nine and very nice</td>', 'I like very much and would have been a 10 from me if not for top left corner - so a nine and very nice', '2002-10-05 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133062, 6455, 3419, '<td valign="top">Crafty! Multiple reflections!  However, since the focus on the chain and its reflection in the foreground is not clear, I would have left the chain out as I find it distracting. 7 for accomplishing a clear reflection on the watch face as well as on the surface the objects are resting on (not a mirror, I hope?).</td>', 'Crafty! Multiple reflections!  However, since the focus on the chain and its reflection in the foreground is not clear, I would have left the chain out as I find it distracting. 7 for accomplishing a clear reflection on the watch face as well as on the surface the objects are resting on (not a mirror, I hope?).', '2002-10-06 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133063, 6456, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Meets challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133064, 6456, 3112, '<td valign="top">That is one serious reflective floor! 7</td>', 'That is one serious reflective floor! 7', '2002-09-30 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133065, 6456, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Neat. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. Neat. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133066, 6456, 4316, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Simple and effective.</td>', 'Great idea!  Simple and effective.', '2002-09-30 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133067, 6456, 3859, '<td valign="top">You have a nice reflection.  The subject matter isn''t very interesting though.</td>', 'You have a nice reflection.  The subject matter isn''t very interesting though.', '2002-10-01 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133068, 6456, 2928, '<td valign="top">Classic idea.  Classic shot with only one tiny flaw  as far as I am concerned anyway.  The diagonal lines that look as though they are growing out of the ducks kill the balance within the shot; I would suggest an un-tiled floor.  Try photoshopping them out  and you''ll see what I mean.  Sorry to be negative  great idea and a great shot though (8)</td>', 'Classic idea.  Classic shot with only one tiny flaw  as far as I am concerned anyway.  The diagonal lines that look as though they are growing out of the ducks kill the balance within the shot; I would suggest an un-tiled floor.  Try photoshopping them out  and you''ll see what I mean.  Sorry to be negative  great idea and a great shot though (8)', '2002-10-01 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133069, 6456, 637, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the lighting alot.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the lighting alot.  6 sjgleah', '2002-10-03 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133070, 6456, 2553, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, and meeting challenge - good.  Moderate visual impact for me. lhall-7</td>', 'Composition, lighting, and meeting challenge - good.  Moderate visual impact for me. lhall-7', '2002-10-03 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
