(133072, 6456, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the focus and clarity is so nice that I''m not even sure if it is is B &amp; W or soft color.  Great job!  DPz</td>', 'Very nice, the focus and clarity is so nice that I''m not even sure if it is is B & W or soft color.  Great job!  DPz', '2002-10-04 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
