(133112, 6458, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 6<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 8<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 4<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 7<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 7<br/><br/>Score: 6 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 6Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 8Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 4Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 7WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 7Score: 6 - setzler', '2002-10-01 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133113, 6458, 2618, '<td valign="top">There''s too much leaf (background)and not enough rose (subject) to my eye. You just can''t see enough detail in the flower - it took me a moment to realise it was a  rose not just the thing in front of the droplet. Nice idea and a good attempt it though. 5</td>', 'There''s too much leaf (background)and not enough rose (subject) to my eye. You just can''t see enough detail in the flower - it took me a moment to realise it was a  rose not just the thing in front of the droplet. Nice idea and a good attempt it though. 5', '2002-10-02 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
