(133116, 6458, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, it''s the most similar to mine!  You getting hammered with "what is this" type comments?  The yellow line had me thinking, then I realized it was a vein in the leaf.  What kind of plant has these leaves?  The rose is soft, but the three views are cool.  Oops, that is four or more views, very, very cool!  9 Swash</td>', 'Interesting shot, it''s the most similar to mine!  You getting hammered with "what is this" type comments?  The yellow line had me thinking, then I realized it was a vein in the leaf.  What kind of plant has these leaves?  The rose is soft, but the three views are cool.  Oops, that is four or more views, very, very cool!  9 Swash', '2002-10-04 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
