(133120, 6458, 2997, '<td valign="top">Admittedly, it was a difficult shot to pull off.  I made several variations of the shot and got the best DOF I could (given the equipment).<br/>The original shot was considerable larger and the submitted shot was cropped considerably.  For those that feel they could have done better, I''d love to see it, really.</td>', 'Admittedly, it was a difficult shot to pull off.  I made several variations of the shot and got the best DOF I could (given the equipment).The original shot was considerable larger and the submitted shot was cropped considerably.  For those that feel they could have done better, I''d love to see it, really.', '2002-10-07 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
