(133253, 6468, 4198, '<td valign="top">Good location. I just wish the reflection was more interesting.</td>', 'Good location. I just wish the reflection was more interesting.', '2002-10-02 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133254, 6468, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool  -  a reflection with a reflection in it!  Pretty shot.  Good focus.  Your score is going up!  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool  -  a reflection with a reflection in it!  Pretty shot.  Good focus.  Your score is going up!  8 Swash', '2002-10-03 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133255, 6468, 3599, '<td valign="top">That''s some reflection, I had to study it for a second.</td>', 'That''s some reflection, I had to study it for a second.', '2002-10-04 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133256, 6469, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love all the great lines and angles.  Very interesting shot.  lhall-8</td>', 'Love all the great lines and angles.  Very interesting shot.  lhall-8', '2002-09-30 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133257, 6469, 3913, '<td valign="top">Sure does help to be in old PAris! Nice photo.</td>', 'Sure does help to be in old PAris! Nice photo.', '2002-09-30 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133258, 6469, 1280, '<td valign="top">attractive image and good use of reflections. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'attractive image and good use of reflections. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133259, 6469, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. WOW Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. WOW Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133260, 6469, 3932, '<td valign="top">Although it isn''t the most "original" photo of the week - the content is among the best in my opinion.  The texture/contour of the glass is great.  Nice shot!  -  9  - JB</td>', 'Although it isn''t the most "original" photo of the week - the content is among the best in my opinion.  The texture/contour of the glass is great.  Nice shot!  -  9  - JB', '2002-09-30 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133261, 6469, 4371, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that...</td>', 'Been there, done that...', '2002-10-03 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133262, 6469, 2928, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the right third of picture is conflicting heavily with the rest of the image.  It moves moved from a symmetrical approach to dramatic diagonal lines within the same shot.  This is actually  in my opinion  two separate shots in one; both of which would stand on their own. Try cropping out both sections and looking at them separately  Other than that, it''s a well taken shot. (8)</td>', 'I like the idea, but the right third of picture is conflicting heavily with the rest of the image.  It moves moved from a symmetrical approach to dramatic diagonal lines within the same shot.  This is actually  in my opinion  two separate shots in one; both of which would stand on their own. Try cropping out both sections and looking at them separately  Other than that, it''s a well taken shot. (8)', '2002-10-03 06:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133263, 6469, 4388, '<td valign="top">very nice composition!</td>', 'very nice composition!', '2002-10-03 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133264, 6469, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great verticals and I like the way the different angles and sizes of windows play with the reflection of the building opposite.</td>', 'Great verticals and I like the way the different angles and sizes of windows play with the reflection of the building opposite.', '2002-10-04 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133265, 6469, 2109, '<td valign="top">very nice patterns! -9</td>', 'very nice patterns! -9', '2002-10-06 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133266, 6470, 674, '<td valign="top">Technically correct , exposure6, focus7, saturation6 , contrast. 8<br/>Good composition.  7<br/>Tells a story or creates a mood 7<br/>      Impact to the viewer 6<br/>Relevance to the Challenge 8<br/>Overall 7<br/>sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct , exposure6, focus7, saturation6 , contrast. 8Good composition.  7Tells a story or creates a mood 7      Impact to the viewer 6Relevance to the Challenge 8Overall 7sulamk', '2002-09-30 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133267, 6470, 3859, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach with several reflections of the same thing. I like the B&amp;W for this shot. I think maybe something like a  coffee cup would have been a bit more appealing than the plastic cream cheese tub.  But overall I think it''s unique and nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting approach with several reflections of the same thing. I like the B&W for this shot. I think maybe something like a  coffee cup would have been a bit more appealing than the plastic cream cheese tub.  But overall I think it''s unique and nicely done.', '2002-09-30 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133268, 6470, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great use of symmetry, great use of B&amp;W.  The composition works.  Only gripe is that it looks a little on the dark side (7)</td>', 'Great use of symmetry, great use of B&W.  The composition works.  Only gripe is that it looks a little on the dark side (7)', '2002-09-30 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133269, 6470, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work, creative. Love the B&amp;W. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice work, creative. Love the B&W. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133270, 6470, 637, '<td valign="top">My kind of kitchen.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'My kind of kitchen.  6 sjgleah', '2002-10-01 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133271, 6470, 4095, '<td valign="top">Good Composition</td>', 'Good Composition', '2002-10-01 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133272, 6470, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lots of reflections and no camera in site, well done!  Now with that said, it might be a little overly busy.  On the other hoof, the more I look at this, the more I like it.  I started you out as a 7, how about a slight bump up to 8?  Swash</td>', 'Lots of reflections and no camera in site, well done!  Now with that said, it might be a little overly busy.  On the other hoof, the more I look at this, the more I like it.  I started you out as a 7, how about a slight bump up to 8?  Swash', '2002-10-01 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133273, 6470, 3540, '<td valign="top">b&amp;w doesn''t do it with the subject.</td>', 'b&w doesn''t do it with the subject.', '2002-10-01 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133274, 6470, 3900, '<td valign="top">That''s some very clean appliances.  Tricky job not getting the camera in there somewhere.</td>', 'That''s some very clean appliances.  Tricky job not getting the camera in there somewhere.', '2002-10-02 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133275, 6470, 4287, '<td valign="top">Interesting look.  A little closer might have been nice.</td>', 'Interesting look.  A little closer might have been nice.', '2002-10-02 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133276, 6470, 4384, '<td valign="top">This is a magnificant work of art... I don''t know how someone would come up with something as extraordinary as this!  I am stunned and extremely impressed by the artistic capabilities of who created this masterpiece.<br/>K.M.N.</td>', 'This is a magnificant work of art... I don''t know how someone would come up with something as extraordinary as this!  I am stunned and extremely impressed by the artistic capabilities of who created this masterpiece.K.M.N.', '2002-10-03 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1);
