(133282, 6471, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I wish the reflection would have been a little clearer.  Might have been better shot just a few minutes earlier to allow a bit more exposure.</td>', 'Great colors.  I wish the reflection would have been a little clearer.  Might have been better shot just a few minutes earlier to allow a bit more exposure.', '2002-10-01 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
