(133284, 6471, 3599, '<td valign="top">i like the colors.  there seems to be a lot of noise though.  there''s also a lot of nothing at the bottom of the picture.</td>', 'i like the colors.  there seems to be a lot of noise though.  there''s also a lot of nothing at the bottom of the picture.', '2002-10-02 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133285, 6471, 2798, '<td valign="top">There''s this big black gap a the bottom of the shot that''s making me wish you''d been in landscape rather than portrait. Although looking at the noise speckle in your sky you perhaps dont have enough pixels in your original shot to crop it down to landscape. The colours are beautiful, though and the silhouette very effective. 7 - floyd.</td>', 'There''s this big black gap a the bottom of the shot that''s making me wish you''d been in landscape rather than portrait. Although looking at the noise speckle in your sky you perhaps dont have enough pixels in your original shot to crop it down to landscape. The colours are beautiful, though and the silhouette very effective. 7 - floyd.', '2002-10-02 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133286, 6471, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors on this.  Maybe too much foreground since the sky is so interesting. karmat</td>', 'I like the colors on this.  Maybe too much foreground since the sky is so interesting. karmat', '2002-10-02 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133287, 6471, 4287, '<td valign="top">Absolutely awsome!  Excellent timing.</td>', 'Absolutely awsome!  Excellent timing.', '2002-10-02 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
