(133293, 6471, 2221, '<td valign="top">Moody picture. I like the backlighting. I would have tried to show more of the nice sky and less of the black water. -stephan<br/></td>', 'Moody picture. I like the backlighting. I would have tried to show more of the nice sky and less of the black water. -stephan', '2002-10-05 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133294, 6471, 2111, '<td valign="top">I was scrolling down to find out what I needed to buy  from your ad. lol Beautiful 6 Mags Coyote</td>', 'I was scrolling down to find out what I needed to buy  from your ad. lol Beautiful 6 Mags Coyote', '2002-10-05 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133295, 6471, 656, '<td valign="top">wow - very low scores.  I thought this should have been much higher - one of my favourite shots this week.</td>', 'wow - very low scores.  I thought this should have been much higher - one of my favourite shots this week.', '2002-10-07 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(133296, 6472, 4198, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the vibrant green leaves for contrast.</td>', 'Nice use of the vibrant green leaves for contrast.', '2002-09-30 04:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133297, 6472, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a superb shot.  The artistry of the light is wonderful.  It has an amazingly relaxing quality and I also like the use of the leaves to add the reality punch.  OK, I can''t fault the picture- I really like the shot.  But, I''m not sure how it fits the challenge.  Is there a reflection here, not sure; it looks like a picture of a painting of a rose was used Hmmm Hope that makes sense (9) Yes, I do like it that much </td>', 'This is a superb shot.  The artistry of the light is wonderful.  It has an amazingly relaxing quality and I also like the use of the leaves to add the reality punch.  OK, I can''t fault the picture- I really like the shot.  But, I''m not sure how it fits the challenge.  Is there a reflection here, not sure; it looks like a picture of a painting of a rose was used Hmmm Hope that makes sense (9) Yes, I do like it that much ', '2002-09-30 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133298, 6472, 3459, '<td valign="top">Very visually pleasent.</td>', 'Very visually pleasent.', '2002-09-30 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133299, 6472, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty ....prrrrrrrrrreeeeeettttttttttty. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'Pretty ....prrrrrrrrrreeeeeettttttttttty. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-30 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133300, 6472, 2204, '<td valign="top">First class!!  Delightful new take.  I love how it looks like a painting.  I''ve looked and looked and can''t see where the photo contains any reflection.  I feel strongly about photos meeting the criteria of the challenge.  =8 normally, IMO,... -2 for no reflection. =6 syamjonimi<br/><br/>Upgraded score =10<br/><br/>This is the lowest possible score you will receive.  However, it may be re-evaluated to a higher score during final review.</td>', 'First class!!  Delightful new take.  I love how it looks like a painting.  I''ve looked and looked and can''t see where the photo contains any reflection.  I feel strongly about photos meeting the criteria of the challenge.  =8 normally, IMO,... -2 for no reflection. =6 syamjonimiUpgraded score =10This is the lowest possible score you will receive.  However, it may be re-evaluated to a higher score during final review.', '2002-09-30 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133301, 6472, 3655, '<td valign="top">this is what book covers and hallmark cards are all about -  10</td>', 'this is what book covers and hallmark cards are all about -  10', '2002-09-30 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133302, 6472, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  The leaves at the bottom really make it.  I''ll be real interested to see how you did the lighting. I even like the line in the marble and the way it leads to the rose.  Super, super job!  Good luck in the challenge!  DPz</td>', 'Great photo!  The leaves at the bottom really make it.  I''ll be real interested to see how you did the lighting. I even like the line in the marble and the way it leads to the rose.  Super, super job!  Good luck in the challenge!  DPz', '2002-10-01 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133303, 6472, 3791, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you left the reflecting object out of sight....</td>', 'I like the fact that you left the reflecting object out of sight....', '2002-10-01 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133304, 6472, 3669, '<td valign="top">What a lovely effect!!  Assuming that I''m right and that the reflective surface is a marble countertop, including a vein in the corner of the picture was very nice.  I understand and appreciate the placement of the leaves, however I can''t help but wonder what it would look like if they were "attached" to the reflection of the rose stem.  Just a thought.  Congrats on the photo and good luck in the challange.  10</td>', 'What a lovely effect!!  Assuming that I''m right and that the reflective surface is a marble countertop, including a vein in the corner of the picture was very nice.  I understand and appreciate the placement of the leaves, however I can''t help but wonder what it would look like if they were "attached" to the reflection of the rose stem.  Just a thought.  Congrats on the photo and good luck in the challange.  10', '2002-10-01 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133305, 6472, 2618, '<td valign="top">I would have left the two leaves out of the shot and just had the reflected flower. But still one of my favourites this week. 9</td>', 'I would have left the two leaves out of the shot and just had the reflected flower. But still one of my favourites this week. 9', '2002-10-01 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133306, 6472, 1143, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a greeting card. It almost looks like there''s a piece of vellum over the rose. Is the surface marble? It''s very pretty, and putting the leaves in the shot is a great balance. It bothers me to see the reflection of the...bottle (?) tho.  ~indigo997</td>', 'This reminds me of a greeting card. It almost looks like there''s a piece of vellum over the rose. Is the surface marble? It''s very pretty, and putting the leaves in the shot is a great balance. It bothers me to see the reflection of the...bottle (?) tho.  ~indigo997', '2002-10-01 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133307, 6472, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 7<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 8<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 5<br/><br/>Score: 6 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 7Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 8WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 5Score: 6 - setzler', '2002-10-01 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133308, 6472, 2752, '<td valign="top">the subtle reflection is lovely..great  feeling of calm.  I like the contrast between the leaves and negative space.</td>', 'the subtle reflection is lovely..great  feeling of calm.  I like the contrast between the leaves and negative space.', '2002-10-01 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133309, 6472, 3946, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been able to figure out why you would have needed to prove that it was a valid refection.  To me, it''s obvious.  The reflective surface is marble, isn''t it?  I think it''s beautiful.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I haven''t been able to figure out why you would have needed to prove that it was a valid refection.  To me, it''s obvious.  The reflective surface is marble, isn''t it?  I think it''s beautiful.  Nicely done.', '2002-10-02 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133310, 6472, 4316, '<td valign="top">Simply with leaves.</td>', 'Simply with leaves.', '2002-10-02 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133311, 6472, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, your focus on the rose is great.  Almost looks like a painting.  The leaves in the lower right corner kind of spoil the soft ghostly feel of the shot for me.  lhall-9</td>', 'Very cool shot, your focus on the rose is great.  Almost looks like a painting.  The leaves in the lower right corner kind of spoil the soft ghostly feel of the shot for me.  lhall-9', '2002-10-02 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133312, 6472, 2111, '<td valign="top">Your eye seems to have to convince you that this is a reflection so for me it takes time to realize the beauty of this shot. Is there anyway you couldve shot this where it didnt take so long to "see"? 6 Mags Coyote</td>', 'Your eye seems to have to convince you that this is a reflection so for me it takes time to realize the beauty of this shot. Is there anyway you couldve shot this where it didnt take so long to "see"? 6 Mags Coyote', '2002-10-02 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133313, 6472, 2490, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe somebody recommended this for DQ.  I love this, and I think I know how you did it.  I only wish there was a little shape or something on the top right to break up the surface.  But that''s me.  9 nards656</td>', 'I cannot believe somebody recommended this for DQ.  I love this, and I think I know how you did it.  I only wish there was a little shape or something on the top right to break up the surface.  But that''s me.  9 nards656', '2002-10-02 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133314, 6472, 4162, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours!   cant really make out the reflection though</td>', 'Lovely colours!   cant really make out the reflection though', '2002-10-02 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133315, 6472, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice touch to include the green leaves.</td>', 'Nice touch to include the green leaves.', '2002-10-03 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133316, 6472, 3730, '<td valign="top">Print it , frame it , hang it on wall....beautiful shot</td>', 'Print it , frame it , hang it on wall....beautiful shot', '2002-10-03 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133317, 6472, 2920, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture and certainly the Rose appears to be trapped within the stone.  The tone is excellent.<br/>I assume the leaves were placed bottom right to help with the composition.  However, for me personally,  I think this distracts slightly - as the leaves appear to be out of proportion and disconnected from the Rose.  I hope you understand my point (even if you disagree with it) as overall I still think this is a very good picture  8 :-)<br/></td>', 'I really like this picture and certainly the Rose appears to be trapped within the stone.  The tone is excellent.I assume the leaves were placed bottom right to help with the composition.  However, for me personally,  I think this distracts slightly - as the leaves appear to be out of proportion and disconnected from the Rose.  I hope you understand my point (even if you disagree with it) as overall I still think this is a very good picture  8 :-)', '2002-10-04 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133318, 6472, 3087, '<td valign="top">Such pretty faded colours but brought kicking into life by the leaves at the bottom.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Such pretty faded colours but brought kicking into life by the leaves at the bottom.Kavey', '2002-10-04 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133319, 6472, 2667, '<td valign="top">lovely soft reflection in the marble. (wondered how a few rose petals would have looked instead of the leaves? assumed you were looking for a higher contrast in texture and color by using the leaves...ummm.)</td>', 'lovely soft reflection in the marble. (wondered how a few rose petals would have looked instead of the leaves? assumed you were looking for a higher contrast in texture and color by using the leaves...ummm.)', '2002-10-04 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133320, 6472, 3072, '<td valign="top">I like your picture, the green leafs enhance the stone rose, perhaps the title could have been: "My memory of You"</td>', 'I like your picture, the green leafs enhance the stone rose, perhaps the title could have been: "My memory of You"', '2002-10-04 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133321, 6472, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. This photo has a "vintage" feeling. I really like it! How did you create this?</td>', 'Beautifully done. This photo has a "vintage" feeling. I really like it! How did you create this?', '2002-10-06 03:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133322, 6472, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle look; I think you could even tone back the leaves  a bit and keep the effect, but I like it as is..</td>', 'I like the subtle look; I think you could even tone back the leaves  a bit and keep the effect, but I like it as is..', '2002-10-06 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133323, 6473, 3380, '<td valign="top">Very inviting. Good use of the reflective material.</td>', 'Very inviting. Good use of the reflective material.', '2002-09-30 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133324, 6473, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
