(133345, 6474, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Not... Not as far as I can tell...<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 4<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 7<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 4<br/><br/>Score: 5 (-3 for not meeting challenge) = 2  - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: Not... Not as far as I can tell...Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 4Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 7WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 4Score: 5 (-3 for not meeting challenge) = 2  - setzler', '2002-10-02 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
