(133347, 6474, 3313, '<td valign="top">Good idea ! I know it''s not allowed here but it might be fun to have the photo in his hand in colour and the rest in B&amp;W. It would force the focus on the photo which is the key to your composition. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Good idea ! I know it''s not allowed here but it might be fun to have the photo in his hand in colour and the rest in B&W. It would force the focus on the photo which is the key to your composition. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-10-03 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
