(133351, 6476, 2928, '<td valign="top">I think you have over done it with the title, but that''s irrelevant to the shot.  I think this is great. The colours are beautiful and the wall adds a superb texture making it look a bit like a photoshop filter.  Great inventiveness; BTW I did work out how you did it without reading the title. I love the graduation effect from dark to light as well.  Good shooting (10)</td>', 'I think you have over done it with the title, but that''s irrelevant to the shot.  I think this is great. The colours are beautiful and the wall adds a superb texture making it look a bit like a photoshop filter.  Great inventiveness; BTW I did work out how you did it without reading the title. I love the graduation effect from dark to light as well.  Good shooting (10)', '2002-09-30 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
