(133385, 6477, 2553, '<td valign="top">I truly wish this wasn''t so very dark - I would have liked a little more light on the kitty.  I love how the kitty is framed right into the frame of the art on the wall - that is cool.  Can''t imagine how you got this shot.  Don''t know how you could have taken this without the lampshade in the shot, but I find it distracting.  My eye is drawn right to the lampshade, and it competes with the image of the cat.  lhall-7</td>', 'I truly wish this wasn''t so very dark - I would have liked a little more light on the kitty.  I love how the kitty is framed right into the frame of the art on the wall - that is cool.  Can''t imagine how you got this shot.  Don''t know how you could have taken this without the lampshade in the shot, but I find it distracting.  My eye is drawn right to the lampshade, and it competes with the image of the cat.  lhall-7', '2002-10-04 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
