(133419, 6487, 3786, '<td valign="top">I have seen several photos depicting a reflection on a lake. This is the first, though, that give the reflection the importance it has to have due to the theme of this challenge (2/3 part of the photo is reflection and 1/3 are real trees. Good job.</td>', 'I have seen several photos depicting a reflection on a lake. This is the first, though, that give the reflection the importance it has to have due to the theme of this challenge (2/3 part of the photo is reflection and 1/3 are real trees. Good job.', '2002-10-01 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133420, 6487, 656, '<td valign="top">the right is more interesting than the left, I think because you''ve overexposed the<br/>sky so much.  I can see that there were interesting clouds, and blue sky, from the reflection but its all gone.  Lot of potential if the exposure had been worked better - something to experiment with.</td>', 'the right is more interesting than the left, I think because you''ve overexposed thesky so much.  I can see that there were interesting clouds, and blue sky, from the reflection but its all gone.  Lot of potential if the exposure had been worked better - something to experiment with.', '2002-10-03 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133421, 6487, 4182, '<td valign="top">it''s a shame the real sky came out overexposed as a mirrored image would have been too good !</td>', 'it''s a shame the real sky came out overexposed as a mirrored image would have been too good !', '2002-10-03 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
