(133440, 6490, 2700, '<td valign="top">ok nice try. VERY creative. However, Matrix is all about "coolnes" lose the background and the table top, and you would have a very "cool" photo.</td>', 'ok nice try. VERY creative. However, Matrix is all about "coolnes" lose the background and the table top, and you would have a very "cool" photo.', '2002-10-03 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
