(133443, 6490, 3080, '<td valign="top">I get it!  The Matrix.  lol.  I''m not sure what happened to the chair in the background.  Parts of it look "broken" like someone moved it during the photo, but then parts of it look just fine.  Was there an upload problem? Or maybe it''s just the file freaking out on my computer.  I think I would have prefered the chair not in the photo at all actually, but you have a great andgle, and the focus and clarity are great.  Nice shot. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I get it!  The Matrix.  lol.  I''m not sure what happened to the chair in the background.  Parts of it look "broken" like someone moved it during the photo, but then parts of it look just fine.  Was there an upload problem? Or maybe it''s just the file freaking out on my computer.  I think I would have prefered the chair not in the photo at all actually, but you have a great andgle, and the focus and clarity are great.  Nice shot. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-06 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133444, 6490, 1336, '<td valign="top">would have been more effective without the wooden chair in the background</td>', 'would have been more effective without the wooden chair in the background', '2002-10-06 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
