(133452, 6491, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot!  The fog/haze really sets a mood for the shot.  You know it will be ok soon though, because the sun will burn it all off :)  Youv''e definitely met the challenge with this shot, and subject matter is very appealing to me.  - 8  -   JB</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot!  The fog/haze really sets a mood for the shot.  You know it will be ok soon though, because the sun will burn it all off :)  Youv''e definitely met the challenge with this shot, and subject matter is very appealing to me.  - 8  -   JB', '2002-09-30 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133453, 6491, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge.  Nice misty, moody feel.  I don''t understand what happened to the rest of the ship.  Please excuse my ignorance.... I''m sure there''s a perfectly good explanation.</td>', 'Meets challenge.  Nice misty, moody feel.  I don''t understand what happened to the rest of the ship.  Please excuse my ignorance.... I''m sure there''s a perfectly good explanation.', '2002-09-30 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
