(133456, 6491, 1829, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful image.  I really like the front end of this boats reflection.  The mist is fantastic (well captured).   The only small  quiry I have is the sun in the upper left is a little overpowering, but that''s life and we as people can''t tell the sun where to go.  But that''s IMO.  When I first saw this picture I immediately thought of the ''Titanic''.  I admire your effort in capturing this beauty.  Good luck with this weeks challenge :) 9</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful image.  I really like the front end of this boats reflection.  The mist is fantastic (well captured).   The only small  quiry I have is the sun in the upper left is a little overpowering, but that''s life and we as people can''t tell the sun where to go.  But that''s IMO.  When I first saw this picture I immediately thought of the ''Titanic''.  I admire your effort in capturing this beauty.  Good luck with this weeks challenge :) 9', '2002-10-01 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133457, 6491, 133, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2002-10-01 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
