(133466, 6491, 3080, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful!  I love the fog, and how the ship dissapears into it.  The lighting conditions are perfect for the shot, and the reflection is clear and very obvious.  This definately portrays a mood.  Great shot. One of my 10''s this week. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful!  I love the fog, and how the ship dissapears into it.  The lighting conditions are perfect for the shot, and the reflection is clear and very obvious.  This definately portrays a mood.  Great shot. One of my 10''s this week. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-02 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
