(133506, 6492, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, it''s one of my 10s this week. I love the way the light chatches the girl''s face in the reflection, and the mood the black and white and the background of pebbles give to her. I just wish it was a little bit clearer about what she''s doing, it''s hard to tell. But then the air of mystery would be gone. 10 (as  I said) - lisae</td>', 'I love this photo, it''s one of my 10s this week. I love the way the light chatches the girl''s face in the reflection, and the mood the black and white and the background of pebbles give to her. I just wish it was a little bit clearer about what she''s doing, it''s hard to tell. But then the air of mystery would be gone. 10 (as  I said) - lisae', '2002-10-06 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133507, 6492, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=Very dramatic<br/>Composition=beautifully done<br/>Clarity (focus, details)=well done<br/>Exposure=very greyscale, but I like it... I wonder if a bit more contrast would further enhance the drama?<br/>Interesting or Emotive=This is excellent. A winner. I love the idea, the drama, the emotion... you have a great artistic eye. Nice work.<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it helpful. Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)</td>', 'Initial=Very dramaticComposition=beautifully doneClarity (focus, details)=well doneExposure=very greyscale, but I like it... I wonder if a bit more contrast would further enhance the drama?Interesting or Emotive=This is excellent. A winner. I love the idea, the drama, the emotion... you have a great artistic eye. Nice work.I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it helpful. Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)', '2002-10-06 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
