(133514, 6493, 1829, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a nine for this shot, because I really like how you have have a reflection in the cup as well as the transparency.  It is a ''busy'' kind of photo with lots to look at and it tells a story.  I like that in a photo.  I liked reading the text too.  Lovely encouraging words.  I also like the colours of the flowers, it  gives the image a nice effect.  Good luck in this weeks challenge  :) 9</td>', 'I''m giving you a nine for this shot, because I really like how you have have a reflection in the cup as well as the transparency.  It is a ''busy'' kind of photo with lots to look at and it tells a story.  I like that in a photo.  I liked reading the text too.  Lovely encouraging words.  I also like the colours of the flowers, it  gives the image a nice effect.  Good luck in this weeks challenge  :) 9', '2002-10-01 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
