(133532, 6495, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is just so weird; I found I kept coming back to it.  There are points in the shot that make it less than perfect, for example, the green seems to compromise the background quite a lot and perhaps it needs to be more central, but the picture keeps me looking.  There is something about the shot  flawed or otherwise  that make it special, why?  I don''t know.  The photographer in me can find faults, but my eye thinks it''s a superb photograph  and I''m afraid I can''t argue with what my eye tells me (10)</td>', 'This is just so weird; I found I kept coming back to it.  There are points in the shot that make it less than perfect, for example, the green seems to compromise the background quite a lot and perhaps it needs to be more central, but the picture keeps me looking.  There is something about the shot  flawed or otherwise  that make it special, why?  I don''t know.  The photographer in me can find faults, but my eye thinks it''s a superb photograph  and I''m afraid I can''t argue with what my eye tells me (10)', '2002-10-04 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133533, 6495, 4402, '<td valign="top">The lighting and the subject matter is wonderful but the depth of field seems a little lower then it should have been.</td>', 'The lighting and the subject matter is wonderful but the depth of field seems a little lower then it should have been.', '2002-10-04 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
