(133679, 6517, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  one of my two favorite for the week.  I love the colors.  I like that you kept the portion of the red handle in the shot.  I like the way the reflection continues the line of paint.  Very well-composed.  10, just-married</td>', 'Very nice.  one of my two favorite for the week.  I love the colors.  I like that you kept the portion of the red handle in the shot.  I like the way the reflection continues the line of paint.  Very well-composed.  10, just-married', '2002-10-05 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133680, 6519, 2553, '<td valign="top">Kind of abstract.  All the glowing "amber" color gives it a warm feel.   lhall-8</td>', 'Kind of abstract.  All the glowing "amber" color gives it a warm feel.   lhall-8', '2002-09-30 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133681, 6519, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  My favorite so far.</td>', 'Great shot.  My favorite so far.', '2002-09-30 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133682, 6519, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is good, really good.  The composition makes the image look like the objects are carefully balanced rather than reflected - and the lighting effect is just superb.  The much darker surrounding objects add to the balanced effect  you have to look really closely to see any reflection there.  If I were being cynical, I''d say you have used a mirror and cleverly disguised the fact.  But, I have spent the last 20 minutes trying to decide, but can''t  so, I''d have to say, wicked shot (10)  thanks for making this shot really interesting</td>', 'This is good, really good.  The composition makes the image look like the objects are carefully balanced rather than reflected - and the lighting effect is just superb.  The much darker surrounding objects add to the balanced effect  you have to look really closely to see any reflection there.  If I were being cynical, I''d say you have used a mirror and cleverly disguised the fact.  But, I have spent the last 20 minutes trying to decide, but can''t  so, I''d have to say, wicked shot (10)  thanks for making this shot really interesting', '2002-09-30 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133683, 6519, 3913, '<td valign="top">Nice work with lighting!</td>', 'Nice work with lighting!', '2002-09-30 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133684, 6519, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Might be a bit bright in my opinion, but that just me. I like this. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Pretty. Might be a bit bright in my opinion, but that just me. I like this. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1);
