(133874, 6532, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 3<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 4<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 4<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 4<br/><br/>Score: 4 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 3Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 4Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 4WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 4Score: 4 - setzler', '2002-10-02 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133875, 6532, 656, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Some windex would help the surface spots, painful though it is to do.<br/><br/>Colours seem a bit flat, some increase saturation/ tweaking would help improve the final result.</td>', 'Cool.  Some windex would help the surface spots, painful though it is to do.Colours seem a bit flat, some increase saturation/ tweaking would help improve the final result.', '2002-10-03 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133876, 6532, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic idea and a superb shot technically.  I can''t fault lighting, exposure or sharpness.  But, I do feel that the subject area looks a little too busy.  Although you have followed all the rules of still life to perfection, I think fewer objects would have improved the shot dramatically. For example, to the right of the beer bottle  above the dice / dominos  there is another jar of some kind, but I can''t make out what it is This may sound a little pedantic, but it certainly  in my opinion  takes a lot away from the overall shot.  I really like the balance of the shot and the colours blend together really well. (8) Yes, despite what I say as a critic, I still think it''s a class capture  just not quite perfect</td>', 'This is a fantastic idea and a superb shot technically.  I can''t fault lighting, exposure or sharpness.  But, I do feel that the subject area looks a little too busy.  Although you have followed all the rules of still life to perfection, I think fewer objects would have improved the shot dramatically. For example, to the right of the beer bottle  above the dice / dominos  there is another jar of some kind, but I can''t make out what it is This may sound a little pedantic, but it certainly  in my opinion  takes a lot away from the overall shot.  I really like the balance of the shot and the colours blend together really well. (8) Yes, despite what I say as a critic, I still think it''s a class capture  just not quite perfect', '2002-10-03 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133877, 6532, 472, '<td valign="top">THIS RULES! i like it a lot.  i only wish the bottle didnt seem tilted to the left. mag99</td>', 'THIS RULES! i like it a lot.  i only wish the bottle didnt seem tilted to the left. mag99', '2002-10-04 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133878, 6532, 3599, '<td valign="top">the corona bottle looks a little soft to me. and I think it could have used some more light.</td>', 'the corona bottle looks a little soft to me. and I think it could have used some more light.', '2002-10-04 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133879, 6532, 332, '<td valign="top">Seeing that beer makes me thirsty. I''m gonna grab a beer. Be right back. -arnit</td>', 'Seeing that beer makes me thirsty. I''m gonna grab a beer. Be right back. -arnit', '2002-10-04 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133880, 6532, 3072, '<td valign="top">I like your concept, but it lacks drama.</td>', 'I like your concept, but it lacks drama.', '2002-10-05 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133881, 6532, 2527, '<td valign="top">To all of you!<br/>Thank you very much for spending the time to give me feedback around my photo.<br/>Thanks for the feedback!!!!!<br/>The 3 amigos were the guitar, the domino and the corona!<br/>A Bohemian night for every mexican! :)<br/>The Salt, Lime and Corona... that will be the 3 Brothers! ;)<br/>I agreed... it was a little bit dark... it has lack of sharpness, and needs more cropping... <br/>and Gordon.... you were right... i forgot about the windex! ;)<br/>Thanks again!<br/>Salud!<br/><br/></td>', 'To all of you!Thank you very much for spending the time to give me feedback around my photo.Thanks for the feedback!!!!!The 3 amigos were the guitar, the domino and the corona!A Bohemian night for every mexican! :)The Salt, Lime and Corona... that will be the 3 Brothers! ;)I agreed... it was a little bit dark... it has lack of sharpness, and needs more cropping... and Gordon.... you were right... i forgot about the windex! ;)Thanks again!Salud!', '2002-10-08 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(133882, 6533, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133883, 6533, 2923, '<td valign="top">more like orange boat....  it''d be nice if the water shows the color too.</td>', 'more like orange boat....  it''d be nice if the water shows the color too.', '2002-09-30 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
