(133929, 6535, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and cool reflective photo.  At work (I''m a nurse), I was showing the pictures from the challenge to my co-workers.  My fellow nurses all commented about how edematous the person''s arm was and that it should be looked at by a doctor.  I had to laugh because that was before they realized that it was caused by distortion of the reflection in the TV screen.  LOL  Just thought I would share that with you.</td>', 'Excellent idea and cool reflective photo.  At work (I''m a nurse), I was showing the pictures from the challenge to my co-workers.  My fellow nurses all commented about how edematous the person''s arm was and that it should be looked at by a doctor.  I had to laugh because that was before they realized that it was caused by distortion of the reflection in the TV screen.  LOL  Just thought I would share that with you.', '2002-10-01 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
