(133937, 6535, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really think I would have liked it much better with the edges of the TV cropped out of the shot.  The reflection is really pretty cool, and has a nice "old world" feel to it. ( No I''m not talking about your age, or what looks like gray in your beard! LOL;) )The reflection has the nice soft, warm, aged looked that old paintings get. lhall-7</td>', 'I really think I would have liked it much better with the edges of the TV cropped out of the shot.  The reflection is really pretty cool, and has a nice "old world" feel to it. ( No I''m not talking about your age, or what looks like gray in your beard! LOL;) )The reflection has the nice soft, warm, aged looked that old paintings get. lhall-7', '2002-10-02 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
