(133966, 6536, 2490, '<td valign="top">Right spot at right time, but I would have liked sharper pic.  Looks like you focused on the foreground items and the background wnt slightly out.  7 nards656</td>', 'Right spot at right time, but I would have liked sharper pic.  Looks like you focused on the foreground items and the background wnt slightly out.  7 nards656', '2002-10-02 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133967, 6536, 2928, '<td valign="top">This shot gets me all of the wrong reasons.  I like the shot a lot, and those flocking birds look great, but I''d have cropped them out of the skyline. The wheel hub and the coloured pieces of rubbish really distract from the primary subject, but they are so stark against the rest of the shot it works.  If this were a shot of those items, and not the reflection, it would have been perfect. I like the shot a lot, but, like a say, perhaps for the wrong reasons (8)</td>', 'This shot gets me all of the wrong reasons.  I like the shot a lot, and those flocking birds look great, but I''d have cropped them out of the skyline. The wheel hub and the coloured pieces of rubbish really distract from the primary subject, but they are so stark against the rest of the shot it works.  If this were a shot of those items, and not the reflection, it would have been perfect. I like the shot a lot, but, like a say, perhaps for the wrong reasons (8)', '2002-10-03 07:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(133968, 6536, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. I think it would have been better to crop the buttom half.</td>', 'Nice pic. I think it would have been better to crop the buttom half.', '2002-10-03 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
