(133978, 6538, 3932, '<td valign="top">Is this truly made with a kaleidoscope?  I''ll assume that mirrors weren''t used, for scoring purposes...  I was trying this same idea with different objects, but couldn''t get it to work as well as you did.  I think you did a great job of capturing reflections, albeit an abstract.  Nice colors... might be just a hair soft though?  I would like to see an image like this crystal clear.  Overall  -   6    -   JB</td>', 'Is this truly made with a kaleidoscope?  I''ll assume that mirrors weren''t used, for scoring purposes...  I was trying this same idea with different objects, but couldn''t get it to work as well as you did.  I think you did a great job of capturing reflections, albeit an abstract.  Nice colors... might be just a hair soft though?  I would like to see an image like this crystal clear.  Overall  -   6    -   JB', '2002-09-30 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
