(134163, 6555, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but I think a couple of things could be done to make it even more effective.  However, I am not sure any of them are possible.  First, I am assuming you are standing on an adjacent bridge.  I would move more to my right and get it centered up more evenly.  Then, if possible, I would zoom in tighter (I know this may not be possible without a boat or really $$$ conversion lens) so that the bridge filled up more of the frame. karmat</td>', 'I really like this shot, but I think a couple of things could be done to make it even more effective.  However, I am not sure any of them are possible.  First, I am assuming you are standing on an adjacent bridge.  I would move more to my right and get it centered up more evenly.  Then, if possible, I would zoom in tighter (I know this may not be possible without a boat or really $$$ conversion lens) so that the bridge filled up more of the frame. karmat', '2002-10-02 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134164, 6555, 4343, '<td valign="top">To much black in the foreground.</td>', 'To much black in the foreground.', '2002-10-02 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134165, 6555, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  I hate to say that I would like to have seen it a bit bigger, cause you may not have good zoom, and I understand that it''s impossible to walk out into the middle of the water to take the shot.  Was there a different angle this could have been taken at that would have allowed you to get a bit closer?  The lighting and reflections are beautiful.  I really like the lights in the background.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  I hate to say that I would like to have seen it a bit bigger, cause you may not have good zoom, and I understand that it''s impossible to walk out into the middle of the water to take the shot.  Was there a different angle this could have been taken at that would have allowed you to get a bit closer?  The lighting and reflections are beautiful.  I really like the lights in the background.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-02 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134166, 6555, 4182, '<td valign="top">angles look a little distorted .. but great photo, it''s hard on some digi cams to keep the night exposure right.</td>', 'angles look a little distorted .. but great photo, it''s hard on some digi cams to keep the night exposure right.', '2002-10-03 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
