(134172, 6558, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is so close to perfection it hurts If you were to have cropped out the colour banding at the top of the picture, I think this would have been awesome.  For me, the reflected colour bands pull the eye away from the main subject, and it''s then that the whole shot becomes an obvious reflection.  Ghost light is superb idea; ghost ceiling doesn''t work.  I put my hand across those bands and wow, what a difference.  Sorry, (7)</td>', 'This is so close to perfection it hurts If you were to have cropped out the colour banding at the top of the picture, I think this would have been awesome.  For me, the reflected colour bands pull the eye away from the main subject, and it''s then that the whole shot becomes an obvious reflection.  Ghost light is superb idea; ghost ceiling doesn''t work.  I put my hand across those bands and wow, what a difference.  Sorry, (7)', '2002-09-30 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134173, 6558, 2764, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''ve been on this ride at disneyland- the hologram ghosts come out next, right?  Nice shot.  I like that one image is mostly round shapes and the other is all squares. one is sunlight and the other is lighbulbs.  one is fancy and one is plain - Nice contrast of two worlds. 8</td>', 'Hey, I''ve been on this ride at disneyland- the hologram ghosts come out next, right?  Nice shot.  I like that one image is mostly round shapes and the other is all squares. one is sunlight and the other is lighbulbs.  one is fancy and one is plain - Nice contrast of two worlds. 8', '2002-09-30 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134174, 6558, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2002-09-30 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
