(134249, 6567, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful !!!!! VERY well done ! = 10 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Beautiful !!!!! VERY well done ! = 10 Shiiizzzam', '2002-09-30 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134250, 6567, 3859, '<td valign="top">A definite reflection, but the subject matter isn''t very interesting.  The sepia tone does give an aged look, but perhaps this one would look better in color.</td>', 'A definite reflection, but the subject matter isn''t very interesting.  The sepia tone does give an aged look, but perhaps this one would look better in color.', '2002-09-30 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134251, 6567, 327, '<td valign="top">lol @ the title, fun. This shot is so nice, love the tones. Score8 Justine</td>', 'lol @ the title, fun. This shot is so nice, love the tones. Score8 Justine', '2002-09-30 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134252, 6567, 2661, '<td valign="top">this photo has a lovely feel to it. the subject, sepia tone, and mottled reflection give it an old look, but there''s something mysterious about it at the same time.</td>', 'this photo has a lovely feel to it. the subject, sepia tone, and mottled reflection give it an old look, but there''s something mysterious about it at the same time.', '2002-09-30 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134253, 6567, 133, '<td valign="top">Great sepia photograph.</td>', 'Great sepia photograph.', '2002-10-01 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134254, 6567, 2618, '<td valign="top">The pattern on the reflecting surface detracts from the reflection somewhat I think. But the use of black &amp; white definitely works.</td>', 'The pattern on the reflecting surface detracts from the reflection somewhat I think. But the use of black & white definitely works.', '2002-10-01 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134255, 6567, 1543, '<td valign="top">like the sepia</td>', 'like the sepia', '2002-10-01 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134256, 6567, 3317, '<td valign="top">i can just barely see the pixels on the curve, not sure if there''s much you can do about that, but it''s worth looking into. either you''ve got a low megapixel camera, or maybe your photo program''s doing it. nice picture though.</td>', 'i can just barely see the pixels on the curve, not sure if there''s much you can do about that, but it''s worth looking into. either you''ve got a low megapixel camera, or maybe your photo program''s doing it. nice picture though.', '2002-10-02 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134257, 6567, 3080, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been able to figure out why this looks like it has a left tilt.  The plate its self doesn''t tilt, but I think that it''s the angle that it is sitting in the corner that gives it the appearance of the tilt.  The reflection is very clear and very obvious.  The focus and clarity are good, and I really like the sepia tones.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I haven''t been able to figure out why this looks like it has a left tilt.  The plate its self doesn''t tilt, but I think that it''s the angle that it is sitting in the corner that gives it the appearance of the tilt.  The reflection is very clear and very obvious.  The focus and clarity are good, and I really like the sepia tones.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-02 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134258, 6567, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 7<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 8<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 6<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 7<br/><br/>Score: 7 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 7Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 8Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 6WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 7Score: 7 - setzler', '2002-10-02 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
