(134265, 6570, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the two dogs but not the other part of the image - the cars and driveway etc. It makes the image very cluttered and composition is somewhat too busy for me.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I like the reflection of the two dogs but not the other part of the image - the cars and driveway etc. It makes the image very cluttered and composition is somewhat too busy for me.Kavey', '2002-10-03 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134266, 6571, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Have you had 20 comments saying its underexposed?  It is, and done very well.  I like it just like this.  Too bad the water wasn''t a little calmer.  Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.  Have you had 20 comments saying its underexposed?  It is, and done very well.  I like it just like this.  Too bad the water wasn''t a little calmer.  Great shot.', '2002-09-30 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
