(134277, 6571, 656, '<td valign="top">lovely.  well done - though I think I''d prefer the sun and the swan shadow to be more distinct from each other.  The sun almost ''spoils'' the impact of the reflection</td>', 'lovely.  well done - though I think I''d prefer the sun and the swan shadow to be more distinct from each other.  The sun almost ''spoils'' the impact of the reflection', '2002-10-03 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
