(134324, 6574, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice sheen and colours. Like textured surface beneath spoon - would prefer this as entire background without the objects (books?) behind.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Nice sheen and colours. Like textured surface beneath spoon - would prefer this as entire background without the objects (books?) behind.Kavey', '2002-10-04 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
