(134327, 6574, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very striking photo - I like how the lights create stripes on the spoon.</td>', 'Very striking photo - I like how the lights create stripes on the spoon.', '2002-10-06 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134328, 6574, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo really appeals to me. I think part of it is the juxtaposition of the shiny metal and the texture of the carpet/rug. Also the parallel bright orange highlights on the spoon against the lines of the rug catch my eye. There are some great directional elements here all over the place. It doesn''t have a lot of emotion, but it grabs me aesthetically. 10 - lisae</td>', 'This photo really appeals to me. I think part of it is the juxtaposition of the shiny metal and the texture of the carpet/rug. Also the parallel bright orange highlights on the spoon against the lines of the rug catch my eye. There are some great directional elements here all over the place. It doesn''t have a lot of emotion, but it grabs me aesthetically. 10 - lisae', '2002-10-06 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134329, 6576, 2123, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, it just feels a little busy to me.</td>', 'I like the concept, it just feels a little busy to me.', '2002-09-30 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134330, 6576, 92, '<td valign="top">The lighting is GREAT in this photo. So much in it that just gives it a studio type of effect.  This works...it''s just great ! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'The lighting is GREAT in this photo. So much in it that just gives it a studio type of effect.  This works...it''s just great ! Shiiizzzam', '2002-09-30 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134331, 6576, 4039, '<td valign="top">Awesome Idea! nice shot!!!! 10 drnxantx</td>', 'Awesome Idea! nice shot!!!! 10 drnxantx', '2002-09-30 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134332, 6576, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Turn it up!!!!! Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job.  Turn it up!!!!! Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134333, 6576, 734, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this shot is what first really brings me into the image.... the feeling of multi dimension throughout the image works well.  All i can say is great job the use of imagination runs rampant through out the image.  My only question: is there a way to not have the cd seem so washed out?  or is that just the way it has to be for the right amount of light to play on the disk.<br/>Ronin 8<br/>Ronin - 8</td>', 'The clarity of this shot is what first really brings me into the image.... the feeling of multi dimension throughout the image works well.  All i can say is great job the use of imagination runs rampant through out the image.  My only question: is there a way to not have the cd seem so washed out?  or is that just the way it has to be for the right amount of light to play on the disk.Ronin 8Ronin - 8', '2002-09-30 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134334, 6576, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot. And I''m not sure if this is a case of reflection or refraction - but I will score it as reflection :) Maybe it''s both... It seems to really follow the rule of thirds!  You did a good job with the cd - it''s noticeably the main subject, but doesn''t detract from the item behind it...  *Addition* This is definitely a case of reflection, and a great reflection at that!  Great extended DOF, everything seems to be in great focus.  The microphone at the top, is great filler... it covers up right where the guitar would go, causing a neat illusion.  -   9  -   JB</td>', 'This is a neat shot. And I''m not sure if this is a case of reflection or refraction - but I will score it as reflection :) Maybe it''s both... It seems to really follow the rule of thirds!  You did a good job with the cd - it''s noticeably the main subject, but doesn''t detract from the item behind it...  *Addition* This is definitely a case of reflection, and a great reflection at that!  Great extended DOF, everything seems to be in great focus.  The microphone at the top, is great filler... it covers up right where the guitar would go, causing a neat illusion.  -   9  -   JB', '2002-09-30 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134335, 6576, 3669, '<td valign="top">If this one doesn''t win this week, I''m just going to have to throw my hands up and say "I must jinx these poor people".  (My favorites haven''t been winning lately).  Anyway, the reflection that you got off the CD is superb.  I thought of doing something like that because the reflected colors are so cool, but knew I couldn''t get it to do right for me.  This is my 10 this week...hope it doesn''t jinx you...and will be in my favorites at the end.  Good luck</td>', 'If this one doesn''t win this week, I''m just going to have to throw my hands up and say "I must jinx these poor people".  (My favorites haven''t been winning lately).  Anyway, the reflection that you got off the CD is superb.  I thought of doing something like that because the reflected colors are so cool, but knew I couldn''t get it to do right for me.  This is my 10 this week...hope it doesn''t jinx you...and will be in my favorites at the end.  Good luck', '2002-09-30 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
