(134343, 6576, 2928, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  The composition works really well; I''m not sure if this counts, but the guitar stand spoils it a bit. But, it is part of the studio, so I''d guess that it doesn''t.  Because I''m a musician myself with a similar set of equipment, I have spent a little more time on this one  I''ve got a similar spec guitar I think, mine''s an Ibanez Jem 77 Floral  because it interests me personally.  Great shot (9)</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  The composition works really well; I''m not sure if this counts, but the guitar stand spoils it a bit. But, it is part of the studio, so I''d guess that it doesn''t.  Because I''m a musician myself with a similar set of equipment, I have spent a little more time on this one  I''ve got a similar spec guitar I think, mine''s an Ibanez Jem 77 Floral  because it interests me personally.  Great shot (9)', '2002-10-04 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134344, 6576, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, definitely fits the challenge.</td>', 'Nice use of color, definitely fits the challenge.', '2002-10-06 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
