(134375, 6580, 3419, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you were able to capture this without showing the actual person too (ie - the finger on the switch). It''s wondering how you did that which makes this photo interesting to me.</td>', 'Interesting that you were able to capture this without showing the actual person too (ie - the finger on the switch). It''s wondering how you did that which makes this photo interesting to me.', '2002-10-01 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
