(134377, 6580, 2928, '<td valign="top">Inventive, great use of neutral colour, superb composition; this is a terrific shot.  The real winner for me is the way that you''ve handled the focus on the switch and reflection  it works so well because of it''s simplicity  so often, less is best (10) Great shooting</td>', 'Inventive, great use of neutral colour, superb composition; this is a terrific shot.  The real winner for me is the way that you''ve handled the focus on the switch and reflection  it works so well because of it''s simplicity  so often, less is best (10) Great shooting', '2002-10-03 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
