(134390, 6581, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 4<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 6<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 8<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 5<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 5<br/><br/>Score: 6 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 4Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 6Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 8Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 5WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 5Score: 6 - setzler', '2002-10-02 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134391, 6581, 2857, '<td valign="top">wish it was cropped a bit tighter</td>', 'wish it was cropped a bit tighter', '2002-10-02 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134392, 6581, 3080, '<td valign="top">I almost said to take one step to the left, but then realized that then you and the camera might be in the photo.  The reflections are clear and obvious, and I really like the addition of the flowers in the bottom left corner.  Very pretty photo. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'I almost said to take one step to the left, but then realized that then you and the camera might be in the photo.  The reflections are clear and obvious, and I really like the addition of the flowers in the bottom left corner.  Very pretty photo. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-02 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134393, 6581, 1005, '<td valign="top">The hand set glass in the lead frames offers a jigsaw effect that is bizarre and wonderful!  Good eye!  I just don''t see anything to NOT like about this photo.  It doesn''t quite have 10 punch, but it''s soooo close.  High 9, Swash</td>', 'The hand set glass in the lead frames offers a jigsaw effect that is bizarre and wonderful!  Good eye!  I just don''t see anything to NOT like about this photo.  It doesn''t quite have 10 punch, but it''s soooo close.  High 9, Swash', '2002-10-02 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134394, 6581, 2928, '<td valign="top">If only you could get rid of the flowers in the bottom left hand corner The eye is immediately drawn away from the subject because of the heavily contrasting colours down there.  This creates a huge conflict within the image, mainly because of the symmetrical uniformity within the rest of the shot If I mentally crop them out, the shot becomes significantly better, probably by about four points on my personal scale.  Sorry to be so negative (5)</td>', 'If only you could get rid of the flowers in the bottom left hand corner The eye is immediately drawn away from the subject because of the heavily contrasting colours down there.  This creates a huge conflict within the image, mainly because of the symmetrical uniformity within the rest of the shot If I mentally crop them out, the shot becomes significantly better, probably by about four points on my personal scale.  Sorry to be so negative (5)', '2002-10-03 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134395, 6581, 2553, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting having the reflected "picture" all broken up into bits like that.  I think I might have preferred a tighter crop on the window.  lhall-7</td>', 'Kind of interesting having the reflected "picture" all broken up into bits like that.  I think I might have preferred a tighter crop on the window.  lhall-7', '2002-10-03 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
