(134399, 6582, 3786, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2002-09-30 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134400, 6582, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot,... I asked myself though, why you chose this particular "coloring scheme?"  I would like to see the reflection in color :)  The water doesn''t seem very photogenic, and maybe that''s why the reflection worked better with this sort of coloring?  Overall, a neat reflection, very clear and precise...  -   6-   JB</td>', 'This is a neat shot,... I asked myself though, why you chose this particular "coloring scheme?"  I would like to see the reflection in color :)  The water doesn''t seem very photogenic, and maybe that''s why the reflection worked better with this sort of coloring?  Overall, a neat reflection, very clear and precise...  -   6-   JB', '2002-09-30 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
