(134411, 6583, 3859, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, but I wish the colors were brighter.</td>', 'Nice reflection, but I wish the colors were brighter.', '2002-09-30 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134412, 6583, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Focus is a bit soft for my personal taste. Score 6  Justine</td>', 'Nice.  Focus is a bit soft for my personal taste. Score 6  Justine', '2002-09-30 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134413, 6583, 157, '<td valign="top">tranquility? the poor thing is tagged! :(</td>', 'tranquility? the poor thing is tagged! :(', '2002-10-01 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134414, 6583, 2928, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a great shot, but perhaps the composition shouldn''t have been quite so central.  I think there''s something not right here, but I''m not sure what, and that''s the only explanation I can come up with that makes any sense. (5)</td>', 'I think it''s a great shot, but perhaps the composition shouldn''t have been quite so central.  I think there''s something not right here, but I''m not sure what, and that''s the only explanation I can come up with that makes any sense. (5)', '2002-10-01 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134415, 6583, 2123, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like this in the center of the frame or not.  Very pretty though. 7 kathleenm</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like this in the center of the frame or not.  Very pretty though. 7 kathleenm', '2002-10-01 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134416, 6583, 1143, '<td valign="top">Don''t you hate when someone else has the same idea? This is a pretty shot tho. The exposure on the feathers is good. Focus seems a tad soft on the head. Did you try messing with levels in post-processing?  I''m also not sure that a different crop wouldn''t help. He''s just so very centered.   :o)</td>', 'Don''t you hate when someone else has the same idea? This is a pretty shot tho. The exposure on the feathers is good. Focus seems a tad soft on the head. Did you try messing with levels in post-processing?  I''m also not sure that a different crop wouldn''t help. He''s just so very centered.   :o)', '2002-10-01 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134417, 6583, 4366, '<td valign="top">i dont know what your doing to that swans blurry little leg but it is yet another pic</td>', 'i dont know what your doing to that swans blurry little leg but it is yet another pic', '2002-10-02 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134418, 6583, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice, tranquil image.  I like the look on the bird''s face, real and reflected.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'Nice, tranquil image.  I like the look on the bird''s face, real and reflected.  6 sjgleah', '2002-10-03 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134419, 6583, 4008, '<td valign="top">Sorry nothing special or appealing. Not fully sharp and very flat light and color, very few details in the swan''s feathers.</td>', 'Sorry nothing special or appealing. Not fully sharp and very flat light and color, very few details in the swan''s feathers.', '2002-10-03 04:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134420, 6583, 3072, '<td valign="top">The title could have been: "Reflecting on Myself"</td>', 'The title could have been: "Reflecting on Myself"', '2002-10-04 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134421, 6583, 3900, '<td valign="top">Perfect pose.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Perfect pose.  Nice shot.', '2002-10-05 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134422, 6585, 2829, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this shot, don''t know exactly why but it''s very good.</td>', 'Wow, I love this shot, don''t know exactly why but it''s very good.', '2002-09-30 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134423, 6585, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I like chess but I''m not good at it. Lovely set you have.  Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. I like chess but I''m not good at it. Lovely set you have.  Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134424, 6585, 3679, '<td valign="top">how very creative the reflections on chess...and you do just that....nice work!</td>', 'how very creative the reflections on chess...and you do just that....nice work!', '2002-09-30 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134425, 6585, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, clarity, and composition.</td>', 'Nice colors, clarity, and composition.', '2002-10-01 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134426, 6585, 3540, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites</td>', 'One of my favorites', '2002-10-01 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134427, 6585, 1543, '<td valign="top">nice idea. 9 queen</td>', 'nice idea. 9 queen', '2002-10-01 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134428, 6585, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice set! I think this is a good idea, but you might have executed it more effectively. The grass in the bg and the sky &amp; tree  reflections distract from the subject. You could try a solid bg indoors with some dramatic lighting to create the reflections. Wait..someone else did that! But I think the problem with their photo is that they didnt show the whole board. Combine the two and you''ve got it made.  :o)  The repetition of the pieces is really nice. You might also try just focusing on one side of the board with the line of pieces since the reflections on the front side are cut off anyway. Just some ideas. I do like the perspective.  ~indi</td>', 'Nice set! I think this is a good idea, but you might have executed it more effectively. The grass in the bg and the sky & tree  reflections distract from the subject. You could try a solid bg indoors with some dramatic lighting to create the reflections. Wait..someone else did that! But I think the problem with their photo is that they didnt show the whole board. Combine the two and you''ve got it made.  :o)  The repetition of the pieces is really nice. You might also try just focusing on one side of the board with the line of pieces since the reflections on the front side are cut off anyway. Just some ideas. I do like the perspective.  ~indi', '2002-10-02 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134429, 6585, 3946, '<td valign="top">What really bugs me is that the chess pieces aren''t on a chess board.  Isn''t that a backgammon board?  Please forgive me if I''m wrong.  Otherwise nice reflection.</td>', 'What really bugs me is that the chess pieces aren''t on a chess board.  Isn''t that a backgammon board?  Please forgive me if I''m wrong.  Otherwise nice reflection.', '2002-10-02 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134430, 6585, 1003, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2002-10-02 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134431, 6585, 2490, '<td valign="top">I really would have voted a black background higher instead of the grass.  This needs a dignified look, but I understand that may not have been your goal.  8 nards656</td>', 'I really would have voted a black background higher instead of the grass.  This needs a dignified look, but I understand that may not have been your goal.  8 nards656', '2002-10-02 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134432, 6585, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice and great chess set.  Good job.  DPz</td>', 'Very nice and great chess set.  Good job.  DPz', '2002-10-04 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134433, 6585, 3127, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot (colors and clarity) with great depth.</td>', 'Very pretty shot (colors and clarity) with great depth.', '2002-10-04 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134434, 6585, 332, '<td valign="top">Get closer to the peaces. -arnit</td>', 'Get closer to the peaces. -arnit', '2002-10-04 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134435, 6585, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image and great reflections. It''s a little incongruous to show a chess set on a backgammon board. Presume your chess board is not made of glass :) 9 Journey</td>', 'Nice image and great reflections. It''s a little incongruous to show a chess set on a backgammon board. Presume your chess board is not made of glass :) 9 Journey', '2002-10-05 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134436, 6585, 4383, '<td valign="top">nice chance but.....</td>', 'nice chance but.....', '2002-10-06 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134437, 6585, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m reflecting on how you move the pieces on a backgammon board...nice set though!</td>', 'I''m reflecting on how you move the pieces on a backgammon board...nice set though!', '2002-10-06 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134438, 6585, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is excellent... one of the best this week!</td>', 'This is excellent... one of the best this week!', '2002-10-06 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134439, 6585, 3080, '<td valign="top">I just have one thing to say.  LOOK AT THE DANG PHOTO.  Not to be rude or anything, but it''s a glass chess board set with a backgammon board built in underneath.  The reflections obviously cover most of the squares, but if you LOOK at the photo, in the bottom right corner, they are quite obvious.  And to further point it out...the pawn in the bottom right is on a dark square.</td>', 'I just have one thing to say.  LOOK AT THE DANG PHOTO.  Not to be rude or anything, but it''s a glass chess board set with a backgammon board built in underneath.  The reflections obviously cover most of the squares, but if you LOOK at the photo, in the bottom right corner, they are quite obvious.  And to further point it out...the pawn in the bottom right is on a dark square.', '2002-10-07 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134440, 6589, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very geometric.  At first, I thought it was b&amp;w,  but the faint blue adds something to the shot.  Interesting and well done.  lhall-8</td>', 'Very geometric.  At first, I thought it was b&w,  but the faint blue adds something to the shot.  Interesting and well done.  lhall-8', '2002-09-30 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134441, 6589, 327, '<td valign="top">I like it all here, color, composition. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'I like it all here, color, composition. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-30 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134442, 6589, 3002, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.</td>', 'Very, very nice.', '2002-09-30 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134443, 6589, 3913, '<td valign="top">cool. Nice Building</td>', 'cool. Nice Building', '2002-09-30 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134444, 6589, 3112, '<td valign="top">I like the geometry in this photo.  Also, it is nearly b/w, without ACTUALLY being b/w, which means you have a very consistent color base. A little overexposed.  8</td>', 'I like the geometry in this photo.  Also, it is nearly b/w, without ACTUALLY being b/w, which means you have a very consistent color base. A little overexposed.  8', '2002-09-30 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134445, 6589, 1793, '<td valign="top">SUPERB. stunning. *breath taken* this will win! 10</td>', 'SUPERB. stunning. *breath taken* this will win! 10', '2002-09-30 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134446, 6589, 2661, '<td valign="top">what a great photo! nothing I can say about this except "wow."</td>', 'what a great photo! nothing I can say about this except "wow."', '2002-09-30 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134447, 6589, 3791, '<td valign="top">i like it!</td>', 'i like it!', '2002-10-01 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
