(134455, 6589, 2352, '<td valign="top">Nice interplay of lines and angles.  Great color and lighting!<br/>Sharp focus.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice interplay of lines and angles.  Great color and lighting!Sharp focus.  Nice shot!', '2002-10-03 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134456, 6589, 656, '<td valign="top">this one feels ''almost there'' to me - there are a lot of great elements, but it seems a bit too confused.  Maybe even just focusing on the windows(?) on the lower left and leaving the gantry to the reflection might have made it less confused ?</td>', 'this one feels ''almost there'' to me - there are a lot of great elements, but it seems a bit too confused.  Maybe even just focusing on the windows(?) on the lower left and leaving the gantry to the reflection might have made it less confused ?', '2002-10-03 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134457, 6589, 4259, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity - clear, sharp edges, and it fits the theme well.</td>', 'Nice clarity - clear, sharp edges, and it fits the theme well.', '2002-10-03 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134458, 6589, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is growing on me.  First  glance said to me, uninteresting, but more viewing helps.  The reflection seems to make the superstructure continue past the top of the building, very nice.  Bump 1 to 8.  Swash</td>', 'This is growing on me.  First  glance said to me, uninteresting, but more viewing helps.  The reflection seems to make the superstructure continue past the top of the building, very nice.  Bump 1 to 8.  Swash', '2002-10-03 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134459, 6589, 4287, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the line of the structural members continues through the reflections.</td>', 'I really like the way the line of the structural members continues through the reflections.', '2002-10-03 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134460, 6589, 2700, '<td valign="top">amazing angle!</td>', 'amazing angle!', '2002-10-03 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134461, 6589, 3280, '<td valign="top">I love the way you lined this up. Great composition. DPz</td>', 'I love the way you lined this up. Great composition. DPz', '2002-10-04 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134462, 6589, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is one that just looks great in full size but nothing much in thumbnail. The texture in the wall and the silver frames and dividers is just wonderful. I love how the curve of the metal structure continues through the reflections. The sails are lovely and the overall composition is very good. <br/>Bumping up to 9, Kavey</td>', 'This is one that just looks great in full size but nothing much in thumbnail. The texture in the wall and the silver frames and dividers is just wonderful. I love how the curve of the metal structure continues through the reflections. The sails are lovely and the overall composition is very good. Bumping up to 9, Kavey', '2002-10-04 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134463, 6589, 3072, '<td valign="top">good picture, the title could have been: "I Live on the World at the Left"</td>', 'good picture, the title could have been: "I Live on the World at the Left"', '2002-10-04 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134464, 6589, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wow- this is very cool!</td>', 'Wow- this is very cool!', '2002-10-05 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134465, 6589, 3419, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition - the lines of the tubular frame do indeed make the building look transparent. Good eye to catch this.</td>', 'Excellent composition - the lines of the tubular frame do indeed make the building look transparent. Good eye to catch this.', '2002-10-06 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134466, 6589, 2109, '<td valign="top">I like it!  This would make nice wallpaper</td>', 'I like it!  This would make nice wallpaper', '2002-10-06 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134467, 6589, 4005, '<td valign="top">Gratulation!<br/>...auch wenn''s nicht bunt ist...</td>', 'Gratulation!...auch wenn''s nicht bunt ist...', '2002-10-07 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134468, 6589, 3942, '<td valign="top">Thanx a lot for your wonderful comments on my 2nd pic in dpc. They really made me proud!<br/><br/>@KAOS:<br/>Sorry, but the sony center isn''t much more colorful, and spot editing is not allowed... IMHO the lack of colours accentuates the composition with shapes and lines. But i''ll try to make a more coloured shot for you in future ;-) Greetings back to Erlangen and only the best for you!</td>', 'Thanx a lot for your wonderful comments on my 2nd pic in dpc. They really made me proud!@KAOS:Sorry, but the sony center isn''t much more colorful, and spot editing is not allowed... IMHO the lack of colours accentuates the composition with shapes and lines. But i''ll try to make a more coloured shot for you in future ;-) Greetings back to Erlangen and only the best for you!', '2002-10-07 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134469, 6592, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great compostion, very evocative.</td>', 'Great compostion, very evocative.', '2002-09-30 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134470, 6592, 4098, '<td valign="top">Just too bad you couldn''t get the whole thing in the frame...</td>', 'Just too bad you couldn''t get the whole thing in the frame...', '2002-10-01 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134471, 6592, 3127, '<td valign="top">Very moving. Great photo!</td>', 'Very moving. Great photo!', '2002-10-01 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134472, 6592, 3557, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2002-10-01 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134473, 6592, 4095, '<td valign="top">Nice Composition</td>', 'Nice Composition', '2002-10-01 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134474, 6592, 1143, '<td valign="top">I''ve been a little overwhelmed with patriotism lately, but this is very nice. It''s a great reflection that definitely adds to the image. I like the colors in the reflection. The one problem is the frame on the right side. I think it would look better if you could have figured out a way to get rid of that and just shown the glass, but with the sizing restrictions I''m sure it''s difficult. Good work. 8  ~indigo997</td>', 'I''ve been a little overwhelmed with patriotism lately, but this is very nice. It''s a great reflection that definitely adds to the image. I like the colors in the reflection. The one problem is the frame on the right side. I think it would look better if you could have figured out a way to get rid of that and just shown the glass, but with the sizing restrictions I''m sure it''s difficult. Good work. 8  ~indigo997', '2002-10-01 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134475, 6592, 3730, '<td valign="top">the contrast of the words with the contrast/detail of the building really make this very busy and hard to look at</td>', 'the contrast of the words with the contrast/detail of the building really make this very busy and hard to look at', '2002-10-01 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134476, 6592, 637, '<td valign="top">Wonderful concept and execution.  I find myself thrown off by the somewhat crooked composition.  7 sjgleah</td>', 'Wonderful concept and execution.  I find myself thrown off by the somewhat crooked composition.  7 sjgleah', '2002-10-02 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134477, 6592, 835, '<td valign="top">Very well done</td>', 'Very well done', '2002-10-02 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134478, 6592, 3317, '<td valign="top">ten ten ten. beautiful, meets the challenge, real sharp, perfect rectangle, full of meaning. big fat ten. you''re gonna win.</td>', 'ten ten ten. beautiful, meets the challenge, real sharp, perfect rectangle, full of meaning. big fat ten. you''re gonna win.', '2002-10-02 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134479, 6592, 2111, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection I dont like the cut off points u chose though 6 Mags Coyote</td>', 'I love the reflection I dont like the cut off points u chose though 6 Mags Coyote', '2002-10-02 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134480, 6592, 2490, '<td valign="top">I love it.  Thanks for braving the patriotism criticism.  10 nards656</td>', 'I love it.  Thanks for braving the patriotism criticism.  10 nards656', '2002-10-02 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134481, 6592, 1696, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is good, it would be better if it was cropped, or framed differently. I think if the words weren''t cut off at the bottom, etc. it would have a stronger impact.</td>', 'I think this picture is good, it would be better if it was cropped, or framed differently. I think if the words weren''t cut off at the bottom, etc. it would have a stronger impact.', '2002-10-03 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134482, 6592, 2928, '<td valign="top">Sad image; but the shot works really well.  The colours and lines, DOF and sharpness all work really well together with the exception of the much darker lower portion of the shot; this adds a little to much subliminal conflict for my liking; I''d have cropped that section personally. Apart from that, the shot is well balanced and interesting. (7)</td>', 'Sad image; but the shot works really well.  The colours and lines, DOF and sharpness all work really well together with the exception of the much darker lower portion of the shot; this adds a little to much subliminal conflict for my liking; I''d have cropped that section personally. Apart from that, the shot is well balanced and interesting. (7)', '2002-10-04 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134483, 6593, 2923, '<td valign="top">there is too much clutter in this photo</td>', 'there is too much clutter in this photo', '2002-09-30 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134484, 6593, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Neat colors Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. Neat colors Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1);
