(134577, 6598, 2618, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked close and I can''t see any evidence that any part of the image is a reflection.<br/><br/>You could possibly say that there is a figure in the rock formation on left hand side that appears to be looking left. I assume that you are meaning that this is George reflecting on some deep and meaningful thought. If so, good idea but it is a little too subtle and tenuous to be certain.  Well, I''ll go with that idea anyway ''cos I like it and its a pretty good picture either way.  6</td>', 'I''ve looked close and I can''t see any evidence that any part of the image is a reflection.You could possibly say that there is a figure in the rock formation on left hand side that appears to be looking left. I assume that you are meaning that this is George reflecting on some deep and meaningful thought. If so, good idea but it is a little too subtle and tenuous to be certain.  Well, I''ll go with that idea anyway ''cos I like it and its a pretty good picture either way.  6', '2002-10-02 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
