(134594, 6598, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked and looked and looked... but I don''t see it...<br/><br/>LoL! As I type this my daughter (4) walks up and says "It''s a big guy rock"... I guess it''s there... You see it... she sees it...  I''m the clueless one... I''m bumping your score up...</td>', 'I''ve looked and looked and looked... but I don''t see it...LoL! As I type this my daughter (4) walks up and says "It''s a big guy rock"... I guess it''s there... You see it... she sees it...  I''m the clueless one... I''m bumping your score up...', '2002-10-06 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134595, 6598, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, I like this shot, it''s really clever, and the likeness to washington is amazing.  I guess I don''t understand how it''s reflecting.  I know there are full reflection shots this week, and "mental reflection" shots, so I assume there is some kind of reflection here, but I am not seeing it.  Can''t penalize you for my ignorance though, so here is what I think technically.  The angle and framing/cropping are great, and the sky is just perfect.  Ligjting conditions are really good for this shot.  The colors are nice, and I really like the concept.  Overall nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Well, I like this shot, it''s really clever, and the likeness to washington is amazing.  I guess I don''t understand how it''s reflecting.  I know there are full reflection shots this week, and "mental reflection" shots, so I assume there is some kind of reflection here, but I am not seeing it.  Can''t penalize you for my ignorance though, so here is what I think technically.  The angle and framing/cropping are great, and the sky is just perfect.  Ligjting conditions are really good for this shot.  The colors are nice, and I really like the concept.  Overall nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-06 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134596, 6598, 63, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented on this photo.  I probably made a mistake thinking "reflecting" instead of "reflection".  The photo is of a rock formation that looks like George Washington looking up to the sky.  Think of Mt. Rushmore turned sideways.  Hopefully more of you will see him now.<br/>I think George had a lot to reflect on, don''t you?</td>', 'Thanks to all who commented on this photo.  I probably made a mistake thinking "reflecting" instead of "reflection".  The photo is of a rock formation that looks like George Washington looking up to the sky.  Think of Mt. Rushmore turned sideways.  Hopefully more of you will see him now.I think George had a lot to reflect on, don''t you?', '2002-10-07 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134597, 6598, 2764, '<td valign="top">I guess you have separated us literal thinkers from those with imaginations.  Sorry for being so dense.</td>', 'I guess you have separated us literal thinkers from those with imaginations.  Sorry for being so dense.', '2002-10-07 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
