(134599, 6599, 1827, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Excellent choice.  I''m not even tempted to turn my head sideways and see the real image.  Your decision here really turned a run of the mill landscape shot into an evocative study in form and negative space.  I can make out a face in the image (in the way that children make images in clouds...)  Well done.  9, just-married</td>', 'Wow.  Excellent choice.  I''m not even tempted to turn my head sideways and see the real image.  Your decision here really turned a run of the mill landscape shot into an evocative study in form and negative space.  I can make out a face in the image (in the way that children make images in clouds...)  Well done.  9, just-married', '2002-09-30 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
