(134605, 6599, 2661, '<td valign="top">very nice reflection. did you submit it sideways on purpose? perhaps to make the viewer guess the orientation? perhaps to make us appreciate the shapes of the picture? Well anyways, it has great color. The only thing tht really bothers me is the overexposed sky, but that''s a toughie to fix. You could wait around until the sky darkens, but who has that kind of time?</td>', 'very nice reflection. did you submit it sideways on purpose? perhaps to make the viewer guess the orientation? perhaps to make us appreciate the shapes of the picture? Well anyways, it has great color. The only thing tht really bothers me is the overexposed sky, but that''s a toughie to fix. You could wait around until the sky darkens, but who has that kind of time?', '2002-09-30 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
