(134608, 6599, 3932, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is a great shot!  It took me a minute to figure out that I needed to turn my head sideways :)  Did you intend to post it 90 degrees to the left? :)  I''ll comment on it as if you did... The symetry is awesome.  The entire shoreline is reflecting, so you a perfect replica.  The reflection is clear and obvious, great DOF - everything seems to be in focus.. Beautiful colors... Well worth a 10  -    JB</td>', 'Wow... this is a great shot!  It took me a minute to figure out that I needed to turn my head sideways :)  Did you intend to post it 90 degrees to the left? :)  I''ll comment on it as if you did... The symetry is awesome.  The entire shoreline is reflecting, so you a perfect replica.  The reflection is clear and obvious, great DOF - everything seems to be in focus.. Beautiful colors... Well worth a 10  -    JB', '2002-09-30 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
