(134642, 6599, 1037, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. I thought the rotation was a good, creative idea.</td>', 'I gave this a 9. I thought the rotation was a good, creative idea.', '2002-10-07 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134643, 6599, 772, '<td valign="top">Raspii, I simply did not understand the purpose in the rotation.  Creative as it may be, I just asked myself why and couldn''t come up with an answer...  It''s still a nice shot :)</td>', 'Raspii, I simply did not understand the purpose in the rotation.  Creative as it may be, I just asked myself why and couldn''t come up with an answer...  It''s still a nice shot :)', '2002-10-07 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134644, 6599, 656, '<td valign="top">I voted this pretty high, as I thought the rotation was intentional.  It is a much better picture in the submitted aspect than it was when I straightened it out!  This sort of focusing on the forms and shapes, rather than the actual things they ''are''  is really interesting to me just now.  Turning it on its side like this makes the sky, lake, trees all irrelevent and focuses on the shapes.</td>', 'I voted this pretty high, as I thought the rotation was intentional.  It is a much better picture in the submitted aspect than it was when I straightened it out!  This sort of focusing on the forms and shapes, rather than the actual things they ''are''  is really interesting to me just now.  Turning it on its side like this makes the sky, lake, trees all irrelevent and focuses on the shapes.', '2002-10-10 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134645, 6600, 255, '<td valign="top">hehe, i see a smiley face!!</td>', 'hehe, i see a smiley face!!', '2002-09-30 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134646, 6600, 327, '<td valign="top">lol the smiley face. Too funny. Good capture. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'lol the smiley face. Too funny. Good capture. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134647, 6600, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the agedness of the building in the reflection. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I like the agedness of the building in the reflection. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134648, 6600, 1779, '<td valign="top">hey, look at that happy face! : )</td>', 'hey, look at that happy face! : )', '2002-10-01 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134649, 6600, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but loses a lot of sharpness.</td>', 'Great idea, but loses a lot of sharpness.', '2002-10-01 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134650, 6600, 4082, '<td valign="top">I like the sticker in the window....  :-)</td>', 'I like the sticker in the window....  :-)', '2002-10-03 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134651, 6600, 4062, '<td valign="top">Hehe. The smiley is just too much :)</td>', 'Hehe. The smiley is just too much :)', '2002-10-06 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134652, 6601, 327, '<td valign="top">FUN -Creative shooting. This is just super. Nice job. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'FUN -Creative shooting. This is just super. Nice job. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-30 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134653, 6601, 133, '<td valign="top">Very nice rainy day capture.  The hint that there is a person is very well done.</td>', 'Very nice rainy day capture.  The hint that there is a person is very well done.', '2002-10-01 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134654, 6601, 2111, '<td valign="top">nice shot 6 Mags Coyote</td>', 'nice shot 6 Mags Coyote', '2002-10-01 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134655, 6601, 2928, '<td valign="top">Really interesting shot  I like the idea, but I don''t like the jacketed figure.  I think the shot would have stood really well without it  the overall texture, the rain and the sky reflection would have worked really well on their own; but that figure is a blot on the shot that draws the eye away from the wonderful patterns created by the rain drops.  Sorry to be so negative, and good luck (4)</td>', 'Really interesting shot  I like the idea, but I don''t like the jacketed figure.  I think the shot would have stood really well without it  the overall texture, the rain and the sky reflection would have worked really well on their own; but that figure is a blot on the shot that draws the eye away from the wonderful patterns created by the rain drops.  Sorry to be so negative, and good luck (4)', '2002-10-02 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134656, 6601, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I can feel this! I''d like the person just a little further into frame but it''s an interesting composition and nice colours and shapes too.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely. I can feel this! I''d like the person just a little further into frame but it''s an interesting composition and nice colours and shapes too.8, Kavey', '2002-10-04 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134657, 6601, 3072, '<td valign="top">The title could have been: "My Distinct mfemory of You"</td>', 'The title could have been: "My Distinct mfemory of You"', '2002-10-05 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134658, 6601, 4427, '<td valign="top">very tangible feel to the water</td>', 'very tangible feel to the water', '2002-10-06 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134659, 6602, 2829, '<td valign="top">VERY overexposed. The reflection in the eye barely saves this photo.</td>', 'VERY overexposed. The reflection in the eye barely saves this photo.', '2002-09-30 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134660, 6602, 3913, '<td valign="top">Very neat effect. I can''t quite make out the relection in the eye though but Very cool.</td>', 'Very neat effect. I can''t quite make out the relection in the eye though but Very cool.', '2002-09-30 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134661, 6602, 3380, '<td valign="top">too bright. nice concept though</td>', 'too bright. nice concept though', '2002-09-30 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134662, 6602, 2928, '<td valign="top">OK, it looks like an illegal filter, however, I shall assume otherwise because it''s still here.  This is quite superb all said and done, and regardless of how it was achieved, it''s still a first class artistic shot. There is a lot of emotion and even though the reflection in the eye itself is undefined, this shot still works  and very well.  Good shooting (10)</td>', 'OK, it looks like an illegal filter, however, I shall assume otherwise because it''s still here.  This is quite superb all said and done, and regardless of how it was achieved, it''s still a first class artistic shot. There is a lot of emotion and even though the reflection in the eye itself is undefined, this shot still works  and very well.  Good shooting (10)', '2002-09-30 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134663, 6602, 3166, '<td valign="top">Nice light effect.</td>', 'Nice light effect.', '2002-09-30 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134664, 6602, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I really like the high key impression in this picture. Only the colors look a little like illness (particularly that yellow). Did you tried out a b&amp;w version? And by the way: what kind of vision you had in this moment? Voted 8 - good luck for the challenge...</td>', 'Nice shot! I really like the high key impression in this picture. Only the colors look a little like illness (particularly that yellow). Did you tried out a b&w version? And by the way: what kind of vision you had in this moment? Voted 8 - good luck for the challenge...', '2002-09-30 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134665, 6602, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job, cool mood, cool lighting.  Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job, cool mood, cool lighting.  Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134666, 6602, 3112, '<td valign="top">The blown out look actually makes my eyes hurt a little.  (I know it''s just a psychosomatic issue, but whatcha gonna do?) Original.</td>', 'The blown out look actually makes my eyes hurt a little.  (I know it''s just a psychosomatic issue, but whatcha gonna do?) Original.', '2002-09-30 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134667, 6602, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is really bright and washed out.  I think there is a reflection in the eye, but everything is so bright that I think it loses a lot of detail and I can''t even tell what it is.  The eye its self is really good.  The angle and the placement within the photo are really nice.  I like the cropping/framing as well.  Just a little too bright for my tastes. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Wow...this is really bright and washed out.  I think there is a reflection in the eye, but everything is so bright that I think it loses a lot of detail and I can''t even tell what it is.  The eye its self is really good.  The angle and the placement within the photo are really nice.  I like the cropping/framing as well.  Just a little too bright for my tastes. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-30 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134668, 6602, 4246, '<td valign="top">interesting and dreamy</td>', 'interesting and dreamy', '2002-10-01 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134669, 6602, 3936, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the washed out colors of the face.  Unfortnately the reflection is very hard to make out.  You are on the right track here...  8</td>', 'Nice idea with the washed out colors of the face.  Unfortnately the reflection is very hard to make out.  You are on the right track here...  8', '2002-10-02 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134670, 6602, 4343, '<td valign="top">Sorry too soft for my liking.  But its still well done.</td>', 'Sorry too soft for my liking.  But its still well done.', '2002-10-02 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134671, 6602, 4361, '<td valign="top">i love this picture, it looks as if u are seeing an angle in her eyes.</td>', 'i love this picture, it looks as if u are seeing an angle in her eyes.', '2002-10-02 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134672, 6602, 3599, '<td valign="top">is he being abducted by aliens?</td>', 'is he being abducted by aliens?', '2002-10-03 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134673, 6602, 2472, '<td valign="top">IMHO, although there is a reflection on the iris, it''s so vague, that it looks more like a defect, than the theme of the image. The contrasted result of the color management makes for a photo that seems to be unfinished and raw, more than attractive or captivating.</td>', 'IMHO, although there is a reflection on the iris, it''s so vague, that it looks more like a defect, than the theme of the image. The contrasted result of the color management makes for a photo that seems to be unfinished and raw, more than attractive or captivating.', '2002-10-03 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134674, 6602, 1005, '<td valign="top">While this is interesting, the overblown thing doesn''t do much for me.  7 Swash</td>', 'While this is interesting, the overblown thing doesn''t do much for me.  7 Swash', '2002-10-03 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134675, 6602, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the faded colour choice - though there is just a little too much white for my tastes. <br/>I am confused by the reflection.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I like the composition and the faded colour choice - though there is just a little too much white for my tastes. I am confused by the reflection.Kavey', '2002-10-04 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134676, 6602, 835, '<td valign="top">way too bright for my taste</td>', 'way too bright for my taste', '2002-10-04 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134677, 6602, 3072, '<td valign="top">I like your picture and your execution.</td>', 'I like your picture and your execution.', '2002-10-05 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134678, 6602, 1280, '<td valign="top">The reflection isn''t very strong here but I want you to know that I think this is a fine piece of art. I like it very much. Grayce</td>', 'The reflection isn''t very strong here but I want you to know that I think this is a fine piece of art. I like it very much. Grayce', '2002-10-05 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134679, 6602, 2221, '<td valign="top">Well... of course it was not an illegal filter (will this never stop ;-)) and the overexposure was intentional of course, too. I even made it brighter in postprocessing :-) Maybe I make another version where I leave the brightness just as it is. I''m not sure if this is a monitor calibration thing again, because when I looked at the photo on a TFT display with not so much contrast it was really ugly.<br/><br/>And yes, this is a self portrait. That was the really tricky part. Try it and you''ll see that photographing your own eye is not easy. At least it wasn''t for me. The light is afternoon sunlight btw.<br/><br/>I understand that some poeple think it''s a bit weak at meeting the challenge because the reflection is not the "main thing" of the photo. I almost guessed that in advance but I submitted it anyway. I like the lighting and the overall look of it very much. To me it has a lot of emotion.<br/><br/>The comments were mostly very pleasing and I enjoyed them a lot. I think I''ll just ignore the score ;-)<br/></td>', 'Well... of course it was not an illegal filter (will this never stop ;-)) and the overexposure was intentional of course, too. I even made it brighter in postprocessing :-) Maybe I make another version where I leave the brightness just as it is. I''m not sure if this is a monitor calibration thing again, because when I looked at the photo on a TFT display with not so much contrast it was really ugly.And yes, this is a self portrait. That was the really tricky part. Try it and you''ll see that photographing your own eye is not easy. At least it wasn''t for me. The light is afternoon sunlight btw.I understand that some poeple think it''s a bit weak at meeting the challenge because the reflection is not the "main thing" of the photo. I almost guessed that in advance but I submitted it anyway. I like the lighting and the overall look of it very much. To me it has a lot of emotion.The comments were mostly very pleasing and I enjoyed them a lot. I think I''ll just ignore the score ;-)', '2002-10-07 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(134680, 6603, 327, '<td valign="top">He heeeeeeee! I like it, creative shooting. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'He heeeeeeee! I like it, creative shooting. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134681, 6603, 3859, '<td valign="top">A bit blurry, but a cool and unusual reflection.</td>', 'A bit blurry, but a cool and unusual reflection.', '2002-09-30 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134682, 6603, 3786, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of showing the head only in the reflection. Very original, it''s not the typical water reflection.</td>', 'I like the idea of showing the head only in the reflection. Very original, it''s not the typical water reflection.', '2002-09-30 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134683, 6603, 2928, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I don''t think it works too well composition wise. Yes, it''s a reflection; but I don''t think there''s enough of it.  The water, which I assume is the prime subject, is  in my opinion  lost to all the distractions around the table that draw the eye away from the central subject.  The lighting is a little dull and he focus is slightly soft.  I think that cropping the image to only show the blue of the table, the bottom half of the picture, would have worked much better.  Sorry to be so negative (2)</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I don''t think it works too well composition wise. Yes, it''s a reflection; but I don''t think there''s enough of it.  The water, which I assume is the prime subject, is  in my opinion  lost to all the distractions around the table that draw the eye away from the central subject.  The lighting is a little dull and he focus is slightly soft.  I think that cropping the image to only show the blue of the table, the bottom half of the picture, would have worked much better.  Sorry to be so negative (2)', '2002-10-01 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134684, 6603, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 3<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 5<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 6<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 6<br/><br/>Score: 5 - setzler</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 3Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 7Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 5Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 6WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 6Score: 5 - setzler', '2002-10-01 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(134685, 6603, 4182, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2002-10-02 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134686, 6603, 2553, '<td valign="top">I think I would have been happier with just the reflection, leaving out what you can see above the table.   Does he have dreads??? Don''t know why, but I don''t get those.  lhall-7</td>', 'I think I would have been happier with just the reflection, leaving out what you can see above the table.   Does he have dreads??? Don''t know why, but I don''t get those.  lhall-7', '2002-10-03 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134687, 6603, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the head is cropped off the actual image and seen only as a reflection. The background is cluttered and I''d prefer it without someone else in shot.<br/>Creative/ interesting idea.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I like the way that the head is cropped off the actual image and seen only as a reflection. The background is cluttered and I''d prefer it without someone else in shot.Creative/ interesting idea.Kavey', '2002-10-04 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134688, 6603, 835, '<td valign="top">very original, well done</td>', 'very original, well done', '2002-10-04 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134689, 6603, 4098, '<td valign="top">Would have been great that the cut-off point of the reflection be the same as the cut-off point on the top edge of the picture.  Does this make sense?</td>', 'Would have been great that the cut-off point of the reflection be the same as the cut-off point on the top edge of the picture.  Does this make sense?', '2002-10-04 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134690, 6603, 3072, '<td valign="top">Your picture is good. I do not understand the title.</td>', 'Your picture is good. I do not understand the title.', '2002-10-04 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134691, 6603, 3982, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see it cropped off with just the table but that is my personal observation.</td>', 'I think I would like to see it cropped off with just the table but that is my personal observation.', '2002-10-05 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134692, 6603, 2563, '<td valign="top">great reflection</td>', 'great reflection', '2002-10-05 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134693, 6603, 4444, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection but overall composition lacking</td>', 'Interesting reflection but overall composition lacking', '2002-10-06 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134694, 6603, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m just commenting on all my 10s before the challenge ends. I love this photo! Technically, it''s not amazing, but it''s such an incredible candid shot, and I love the way it''s composed. 10 (as I said)  - lisae</td>', 'I''m just commenting on all my 10s before the challenge ends. I love this photo! Technically, it''s not amazing, but it''s such an incredible candid shot, and I love the way it''s composed. 10 (as I said)  - lisae', '2002-10-07 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134695, 6605, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty good composition, nice reflection and good color. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Pretty good composition, nice reflection and good color. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134696, 6605, 2928, '<td valign="top">I think the white background doesn''t work.  It sucks the eye away from the subject area rather than pushing it into it.  Perhaps a black, or even a dark red, would have set the shot better.  Composition is fine, no problem there.  Sorry to sound so negative (5)</td>', 'I think the white background doesn''t work.  It sucks the eye away from the subject area rather than pushing it into it.  Perhaps a black, or even a dark red, would have set the shot better.  Composition is fine, no problem there.  Sorry to sound so negative (5)', '2002-09-30 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134697, 6605, 3859, '<td valign="top">I do like the red.</td>', 'I do like the red.', '2002-09-30 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134698, 6605, 3730, '<td valign="top">can''t see much of a reflection here...great color though</td>', 'can''t see much of a reflection here...great color though', '2002-10-01 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134699, 6605, 3419, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter and composition, nice color. Has an abstract look.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter and composition, nice color. Has an abstract look.', '2002-10-02 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134700, 6605, 4361, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of christmas</td>', 'this reminds me of christmas', '2002-10-02 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134701, 6605, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great!  Doesnt seem to be much of a refelction though</td>', 'Great!  Doesnt seem to be much of a refelction though', '2002-10-02 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134702, 6605, 4078, '<td valign="top">nice color!</td>', 'nice color!', '2002-10-03 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134703, 6605, 4388, '<td valign="top">it''s a reflection.</td>', 'it''s a reflection.', '2002-10-03 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134704, 6605, 1696, '<td valign="top">Martha Stewart.</td>', 'Martha Stewart.', '2002-10-03 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134705, 6605, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I can imagine this being used in a commercial context.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Beautiful. I can imagine this being used in a commercial context.Kavey', '2002-10-04 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134706, 6607, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job=grace. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job=grace. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134707, 6607, 3419, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully captured shot - the colors are clean and crisp. Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a beautifully captured shot - the colors are clean and crisp. Nicely done.', '2002-10-01 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134708, 6607, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very tough subject to shoot because of the exposure problems associated with white feathers. I love swans tho, and you did a good job of catching one up close. I would rather see his head. Too bad he didnt turn it to his other side  ;o) Meets the challenge, technically good, pleasing subject.  6  ~indigo997</td>', 'Very tough subject to shoot because of the exposure problems associated with white feathers. I love swans tho, and you did a good job of catching one up close. I would rather see his head. Too bad he didnt turn it to his other side  ;o) Meets the challenge, technically good, pleasing subject.  6  ~indigo997', '2002-10-01 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134709, 6607, 4343, '<td valign="top">Great detail, but think a lower angle would work better.</td>', 'Great detail, but think a lower angle would work better.', '2002-10-02 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134710, 6607, 3900, '<td valign="top">That''s a great pose you caught him in.  Nice shot.</td>', 'That''s a great pose you caught him in.  Nice shot.', '2002-10-02 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134711, 6607, 1003, '<td valign="top">nicely cropped</td>', 'nicely cropped', '2002-10-02 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134712, 6607, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good reflection.Moderate visual impact for me.  lhall-7</td>', 'Nice shot, good reflection.Moderate visual impact for me.  lhall-7', '2002-10-03 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134713, 6607, 4259, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colours and reflection. I wish I''d got one like this!</td>', 'Fantastic colours and reflection. I wish I''d got one like this!', '2002-10-06 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134714, 6608, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good composition, tonal range.</td>', 'Good composition, tonal range.', '2002-09-30 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134715, 6608, 3932, '<td valign="top">I like this shot!  Original idea... The reflection works very well in this picture, because it allows you to see a lot more of the subjects face.  I''d like to see your outtakes of this.. did you try any somewhat over the shoulder, and focusing just on the reflection?  -   8 -   JB</td>', 'I like this shot!  Original idea... The reflection works very well in this picture, because it allows you to see a lot more of the subjects face.  I''d like to see your outtakes of this.. did you try any somewhat over the shoulder, and focusing just on the reflection?  -   8 -   JB', '2002-09-30 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134716, 6608, 3380, '<td valign="top">Do what you have to do. 8</td>', 'Do what you have to do. 8', '2002-09-30 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134717, 6608, 3913, '<td valign="top">Nice clean photography. It helps to have a model readily available! great use of b&amp;w. 8</td>', 'Nice clean photography. It helps to have a model readily available! great use of b&w. 8', '2002-09-30 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
