(134846, 6618, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is the reflection in the eye?  I know the shot needed to be dark, but this is hard to look at.  Monitors tend to not be very photogenic.  Good creativity, but I needed more of the challenge aspect for a high, high score.  6 Swash</td>', 'Is the reflection in the eye?  I know the shot needed to be dark, but this is hard to look at.  Monitors tend to not be very photogenic.  Good creativity, but I needed more of the challenge aspect for a high, high score.  6 Swash', '2002-10-01 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
