(134862, 6619, 3080, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective.  it''s funny how the dogs head looks like it''s on the drivers body.  there is a reflection in the rear view mirror, but other than that, I dont see one.  I am assuming that the "reflection" is more of a mental reflection rather than a physical reflection.  Your focus is ok, black fur is really hard to shoot.  there is little distinction between his fir and his eye.  overall, this is a neat idea.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'interesting perspective.  it''s funny how the dogs head looks like it''s on the drivers body.  there is a reflection in the rear view mirror, but other than that, I dont see one.  I am assuming that the "reflection" is more of a mental reflection rather than a physical reflection.  Your focus is ok, black fur is really hard to shoot.  there is little distinction between his fir and his eye.  overall, this is a neat idea.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-30 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134863, 6619, 3932, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit confused on this one meeting the challenge?  I see the obvious reflection in the mirror, but there is really nothing to that reflection?  I don''t know if it''s a non-literal translation of reflections (looking back on something)  but, I don''t see how the dog fits in.  I hate to score it this low, but I don''t feel that it met the challenge. Sorry-   3  -   JB</td>', 'I''m a bit confused on this one meeting the challenge?  I see the obvious reflection in the mirror, but there is really nothing to that reflection?  I don''t know if it''s a non-literal translation of reflections (looking back on something)  but, I don''t see how the dog fits in.  I hate to score it this low, but I don''t feel that it met the challenge. Sorry-   3  -   JB', '2002-09-30 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134864, 6619, 4098, '<td valign="top">It''s a clever shot, but I don''t see a "without mirrors" reflection...</td>', 'It''s a clever shot, but I don''t see a "without mirrors" reflection...', '2002-09-30 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134865, 6619, 4328, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed, although I am a dog photographer...Good Luck.<br/><br/>Brodie</td>', 'Very nice indeed, although I am a dog photographer...Good Luck.Brodie', '2002-10-01 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134866, 6619, 4266, '<td valign="top">Amusing photo, but I guess I''m missing the relevance to the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Amusing photo, but I guess I''m missing the relevance to the challenge.', '2002-10-01 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134867, 6619, 2337, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I have to ask the question I''m sure you''ve heard more than once so far this week... Where is the reflection?  If I''m missing something, please feel free to enlighten me :)  ~ myqyl ~<br/>As I go through my forth (and likely last) look at all the shots, I''m still puzzled here.  The only physical reflection is from the mirror, and I don''t see thoughtful pondering (another definition of reflection) here either.  <br/><br/>On the technical side, the sloped horizon doesn''t add much for me.  However, this IS certainly a clever, cute shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I have to ask the question I''m sure you''ve heard more than once so far this week... Where is the reflection?  If I''m missing something, please feel free to enlighten me :)  ~ myqyl ~As I go through my forth (and likely last) look at all the shots, I''m still puzzled here.  The only physical reflection is from the mirror, and I don''t see thoughtful pondering (another definition of reflection) here either.  On the technical side, the sloped horizon doesn''t add much for me.  However, this IS certainly a clever, cute shot.', '2002-10-01 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134868, 6619, 1779, '<td valign="top">very cool idea. i don''t think people will get it and therefore u know what''s gonna happen, so would help u with a good grade just for being funny.</td>', 'very cool idea. i don''t think people will get it and therefore u know what''s gonna happen, so would help u with a good grade just for being funny.', '2002-10-01 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
