(134875, 6619, 2928, '<td valign="top">This looks like a person with the head of a dog.  It''s great in that respect, and I can''t fault the shot  it''s actually quite amusing But, the mirror in the shot voids the challenge aspect; in terms of picture quality it''s fine Sorry to be so negative (3)</td>', 'This looks like a person with the head of a dog.  It''s great in that respect, and I can''t fault the shot  it''s actually quite amusing But, the mirror in the shot voids the challenge aspect; in terms of picture quality it''s fine Sorry to be so negative (3)', '2002-10-02 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
