(134881, 6619, 1054, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see the connection here outside of the title.  The only connection to reflections I see here comes from the mirror.  Please feel free to let me know if I''m missing something. -ClubJuggle</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see the connection here outside of the title.  The only connection to reflections I see here comes from the mirror.  Please feel free to let me know if I''m missing something. -ClubJuggle', '2002-10-03 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134882, 6619, 1005, '<td valign="top">While this is a really great photo, and I love the dog''s face as if it were driving, but ... shoe falling....I think this is a secondary definition of reflection that IMHO pushes the line between creativity and the boundaries set by the challenge.  If this were a visual reflection and a reflective concept, you''d win hands down.  I am very willing to consider changing my vote.  (You also have a mirror in the photo..)  Started as an 8, considering the literal/creative differences of opinion, I''ll go a 6 as it really is a very well taken photo.   (fair?)   Swash</td>', 'While this is a really great photo, and I love the dog''s face as if it were driving, but ... shoe falling....I think this is a secondary definition of reflection that IMHO pushes the line between creativity and the boundaries set by the challenge.  If this were a visual reflection and a reflective concept, you''d win hands down.  I am very willing to consider changing my vote.  (You also have a mirror in the photo..)  Started as an 8, considering the literal/creative differences of opinion, I''ll go a 6 as it really is a very well taken photo.   (fair?)   Swash', '2002-10-03 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
