(134892, 6620, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I think that the wide central column draws the eye away from the reflection; seems to affect the balance of the foreground / background images.  Perhaps taking the picture from an angle such that the column wasn''t visible would have given a slightly better result.  (5)</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I think that the wide central column draws the eye away from the reflection; seems to affect the balance of the foreground / background images.  Perhaps taking the picture from an angle such that the column wasn''t visible would have given a slightly better result.  (5)', '2002-10-01 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134893, 6620, 1005, '<td valign="top">This reminds of an old nursery ryhme (sp) - there was an crooked man that build a crooked house......A bit drab, sorry.  7 Swash</td>', 'This reminds of an old nursery ryhme (sp) - there was an crooked man that build a crooked house......A bit drab, sorry.  7 Swash', '2002-10-01 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
