(134895, 6620, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, good reflection, but overall a little dark for my taste.  I would love to have seen it on a day when there was good light on the steeple really making it pop out. lhall-7</td>', 'Cool shot, good reflection, but overall a little dark for my taste.  I would love to have seen it on a day when there was good light on the steeple really making it pop out. lhall-7', '2002-10-03 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
