(134903, 6621, 2829, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Very well executed and the birdie is cute. I have a parakeet who does nothing but stare in his little mirror all day and spit at it. Very detailed.</td>', 'I love this shot. Very well executed and the birdie is cute. I have a parakeet who does nothing but stare in his little mirror all day and spit at it. Very detailed.', '2002-09-30 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
