(134905, 6621, 2997, '<td valign="top">I got a little chuckle out of this picture.  Its a nice picture but mostly wanted to note that I''ve had two cockatiels as pets.  Neither were "caged" and the first one was strongly attached to me.  From the moment I walked in the door, he would drop from his perch, waddle over to me, walk up my pants and then for the next 20 minutes "hen peck" me and jabber.  I think he was saying: "Where have you been?  Why were gone so long?  Why didn''t take me this time?"</td>', 'I got a little chuckle out of this picture.  Its a nice picture but mostly wanted to note that I''ve had two cockatiels as pets.  Neither were "caged" and the first one was strongly attached to me.  From the moment I walked in the door, he would drop from his perch, waddle over to me, walk up my pants and then for the next 20 minutes "hen peck" me and jabber.  I think he was saying: "Where have you been?  Why were gone so long?  Why didn''t take me this time?"', '2002-10-01 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
