(134917, 6621, 806, '<td valign="top">Initial=cute!<br/>Composition=I find the yellow cloth distracting, as well as the white and blue wall/door in the background <br/>Clarity (focus, details)=the feathers and bird itself could be in sharper focus... A smaller aperature setting may help with this... I am wondering if you were in low light conditions, as some of the colors and areas are blotchy<br/>Exposure=good<br/>Interesting or Emotive=interesting<br/><br/>I am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanks<br/>autool!). I hope you find it helpful.<br/>Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)<br/></td>', 'Initial=cute!Composition=I find the yellow cloth distracting, as well as the white and blue wall/door in the background Clarity (focus, details)=the feathers and bird itself could be in sharper focus... A smaller aperature setting may help with this... I am wondering if you were in low light conditions, as some of the colors and areas are blotchyExposure=goodInteresting or Emotive=interestingI am using a this new detailed commenting method inspired by autool. (Thanksautool!). I hope you find it helpful.Thanks for submitting, and good luck!  ;0)', '2002-10-06 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
