(134937, 6623, 3080, '<td valign="top">All my family lives right near here.  Except me, I live in MI.  I have been here many times, and have never seen THIS view of it.  very pretty.  I love the angle and the lighting is perfect for the shot.  focus and clarity are great.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'All my family lives right near here.  Except me, I live in MI.  I have been here many times, and have never seen THIS view of it.  very pretty.  I love the angle and the lighting is perfect for the shot.  focus and clarity are great.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-30 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134938, 6623, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot... Good use of limited DOF.  The image that is reflecting is crystal clear and very much in focus.  The only thing that I see the detracts from the photo is the ear piece folded behind the lense.  I  don''t think it would look right sticking out of the back of the photo either... and I can''t ask you to break your sunglasses ;)   -   7   -   JB</td>', 'This is a nice shot... Good use of limited DOF.  The image that is reflecting is crystal clear and very much in focus.  The only thing that I see the detracts from the photo is the ear piece folded behind the lense.  I  don''t think it would look right sticking out of the back of the photo either... and I can''t ask you to break your sunglasses ;)   -   7   -   JB', '2002-09-30 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
