(134943, 6623, 3672, '<td valign="top">I was really tired of seeing all of the sunglass photos, till I came across this one. I really like the waterfall. Good job. 8 smshats</td>', 'I was really tired of seeing all of the sunglass photos, till I came across this one. I really like the waterfall. Good job. 8 smshats', '2002-10-02 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
