(134945, 6623, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a superb idea that''s been very neatly done.  However, DOF lets it down quite a bit; I think had the glasses also been in sharp focus and the surrounding background were totally black, this would have been a masterpiece.  I''d try shooting this again in manual mode, set F8  or higher if possible  experimenting with the shutter speed to get the right background exposure. Other than that, keep shooting it''s a great shot  (7)</td>', 'This is a superb idea that''s been very neatly done.  However, DOF lets it down quite a bit; I think had the glasses also been in sharp focus and the surrounding background were totally black, this would have been a masterpiece.  I''d try shooting this again in manual mode, set F8  or higher if possible  experimenting with the shutter speed to get the right background exposure. Other than that, keep shooting it''s a great shot  (7)', '2002-10-03 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134946, 6623, 3599, '<td valign="top">did you use a tripod?  if not shame on you!  in my opinion this one could have been a winner if it weren''t blurry.  but that''s my opinion.</td>', 'did you use a tripod?  if not shame on you!  in my opinion this one could have been a winner if it weren''t blurry.  but that''s my opinion.', '2002-10-03 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134947, 6623, 2472, '<td valign="top">The selected natural setting seems good and atractive, but IMHO this image absolutely requires a perfect technique to compensate for the lack of originality; the reflection of the waterfall would need to be in a perfect focus in order to provide interest. I''m not saying that would be easily achieved.</td>', 'The selected natural setting seems good and atractive, but IMHO this image absolutely requires a perfect technique to compensate for the lack of originality; the reflection of the waterfall would need to be in a perfect focus in order to provide interest. I''m not saying that would be easily achieved.', '2002-10-03 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
