(134950, 6623, 4100, '<td valign="top">You managed to take one of the most-repeated reflective surfaces (glasses) for this subject and produce a genuinely original image. The composition and depth-of-field work very effectively on this one.</td>', 'You managed to take one of the most-repeated reflective surfaces (glasses) for this subject and produce a genuinely original image. The composition and depth-of-field work very effectively on this one.', '2002-10-05 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
