(134956, 6625, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot.  Your reflections are mostly shadowed, I don''t know how one would change that or if that''s what you wanted, it was about the only thing I could think of to say.  Good color.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot.  Your reflections are mostly shadowed, I don''t know how one would change that or if that''s what you wanted, it was about the only thing I could think of to say.  Good color.  7 Swash', '2002-10-03 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134957, 6625, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I like the composition, but the reflections seem secondary to the rest of the shot.  I know, I know - you''re saying, "..but hey, there''s a reflection in the shot, it never said the shot  had to be ONLY about the reflection" - and this is true; I''m just saying that to me, this  shot is about the vehicle, and my eye is drawn to the vehicle and not to the reflections.  lhall-7</td>', 'Good shot, I like the composition, but the reflections seem secondary to the rest of the shot.  I know, I know - you''re saying, "..but hey, there''s a reflection in the shot, it never said the shot  had to be ONLY about the reflection" - and this is true; I''m just saying that to me, this  shot is about the vehicle, and my eye is drawn to the vehicle and not to the reflections.  lhall-7', '2002-10-03 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134958, 6625, 2586, '<td valign="top">An engaging image. Nice composition,  good clarity and DOF. Love the muted colors and texture. Would have cropped out that bright shiny bar ? from the lower right but image size restrictions may have prevented this. 8 Journey</td>', 'An engaging image. Nice composition,  good clarity and DOF. Love the muted colors and texture. Would have cropped out that bright shiny bar ? from the lower right but image size restrictions may have prevented this. 8 Journey', '2002-10-05 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
