(134960, 6626, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed.</td>', 'Nicely framed.', '2002-09-30 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134961, 6626, 3932, '<td valign="top">I think that this shot has a lot of potential.  The focus seems to be a bit soft on the far side of the river.  Maybe being a little close to the ground would help?  That way you could get the full reflection in the photo (the whole tree).  Keep up the good work!   -    JB</td>', 'I think that this shot has a lot of potential.  The focus seems to be a bit soft on the far side of the river.  Maybe being a little close to the ground would help?  That way you could get the full reflection in the photo (the whole tree).  Keep up the good work!   -    JB', '2002-09-30 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134962, 6626, 4008, '<td valign="top">Opportunity for a beautifull reflection, but : composition not very good, branches are in the way, shoreline exactly in the middle, overexposed. Should have looked further.</td>', 'Opportunity for a beautifull reflection, but : composition not very good, branches are in the way, shoreline exactly in the middle, overexposed. Should have looked further.', '2002-10-01 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134963, 6626, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 3<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 4<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 2<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 5<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 3<br/><br/>Score: 3 - setzler<br/><br/>Note:  I think that trees on the edge should either be in or out of the frame rather than splitting them on the edges...  Your focus here is very weak also...</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 3Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 4Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 2Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 5WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 3Score: 3 - setzlerNote:  I think that trees on the edge should either be in or out of the frame rather than splitting them on the edges...  Your focus here is very weak also...', '2002-10-01 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134964, 6626, 1792, '<td valign="top">The reflection is very nice.  It might look nice without the tree trunk on the left.  The one on the right has some interest to it with the bark pattern, but the one on the left seems too dark and just "stops" the scene.  The limbs hanging down and to the left would, to me anyhow, would give the sense that the scene continues.</td>', 'The reflection is very nice.  It might look nice without the tree trunk on the left.  The one on the right has some interest to it with the bark pattern, but the one on the left seems too dark and just "stops" the scene.  The limbs hanging down and to the left would, to me anyhow, would give the sense that the scene continues.', '2002-10-01 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
