(134971, 6628, 3932, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I think I get this photo?  The back of the orange flower is yellow, and the front of the yellow flower is orange?  If so - this is a great shot.  I didn''t look at it hard enough the first time, and did vote low.  The 4 colors in this shot work great together.  It''s a pretty tight crop - I wonder how it would look moved further back from the subject?  Tough to say!  You''ve met the challenge here!  -  7  -  JB</td>', 'Hmm... I think I get this photo?  The back of the orange flower is yellow, and the front of the yellow flower is orange?  If so - this is a great shot.  I didn''t look at it hard enough the first time, and did vote low.  The 4 colors in this shot work great together.  It''s a pretty tight crop - I wonder how it would look moved further back from the subject?  Tough to say!  You''ve met the challenge here!  -  7  -  JB', '2002-09-30 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134972, 6628, 2928, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, works really well. Great use of colour, first class still life.  It is hard to say if there isnt a mirror involved and I like that, if there is  it''s well disguised, if there isn''t it''s well done in fact, I like the shot the more I look at it. (10)</td>', 'Nice idea, works really well. Great use of colour, first class still life.  It is hard to say if there isnt a mirror involved and I like that, if there is  it''s well disguised, if there isn''t it''s well done in fact, I like the shot the more I look at it. (10)', '2002-10-01 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134973, 6628, 3127, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! Great color and great concept!</td>', 'I love this picture! Great color and great concept!', '2002-10-01 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(134974, 6628, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice.  The photo is top notch, if I had anything at all to "complain" about, it''s a tiny detail in the set up.  See the blue on the stem, just above the water line.  This could be from capillary seapage, or an accidental dunk.  If the former, sorry, but take the photo quicker.  If the later, be more careful!  Please remember this a a true nit.  The shot is still a 10!  It was just the only thing  I could find to comment on.  Great job!  Swash</td>', 'Wow, very nice.  The photo is top notch, if I had anything at all to "complain" about, it''s a tiny detail in the set up.  See the blue on the stem, just above the water line.  This could be from capillary seapage, or an accidental dunk.  If the former, sorry, but take the photo quicker.  If the later, be more careful!  Please remember this a a true nit.  The shot is still a 10!  It was just the only thing  I could find to comment on.  Great job!  Swash', '2002-10-01 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
