(134978, 6628, 2920, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I think the colours work very well and the composition is just right.  The angle of the camera (making the reflection appear to have more water in the vase) and the back of the flower being a different colour makes it look like two items rather than a reflection of one.  I could see this on the wall, in the right environment. 9 - Well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I think the colours work very well and the composition is just right.  The angle of the camera (making the reflection appear to have more water in the vase) and the back of the flower being a different colour makes it look like two items rather than a reflection of one.  I could see this on the wall, in the right environment. 9 - Well done.', '2002-10-02 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
