(135037, 6631, 3178, '<td valign="top">Interesting symbolism and commentary on female psychology with the opposing hot and cold faucets. I think the picture might have had more emotion if she''d been looking toward the hot!!! Seriously though, really nice shot!</td>', 'Interesting symbolism and commentary on female psychology with the opposing hot and cold faucets. I think the picture might have had more emotion if she''d been looking toward the hot!!! Seriously though, really nice shot!', '2002-10-01 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135038, 6631, 1829, '<td valign="top">This is probably one of the best ''bath'' shots I have seen for a while.  The reflection of the woman is outstanding.  Her pose really suits the small space in the tap.  Very creative and a well thought through photo.   Good luck with this weeks challenge :) 9</td>', 'This is probably one of the best ''bath'' shots I have seen for a while.  The reflection of the woman is outstanding.  Her pose really suits the small space in the tap.  Very creative and a well thought through photo.   Good luck with this weeks challenge :) 9', '2002-10-01 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
