(135040, 6631, 3859, '<td valign="top">Another of my favorites this week.  So very original! Lighting is very well done.  I''m sure this one will score well this week. 10 from me.</td>', 'Another of my favorites this week.  So very original! Lighting is very well done.  I''m sure this one will score well this week. 10 from me.', '2002-10-01 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
