(135062, 6631, 4388, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity and composition!  Very nice photograph.</td>', 'I like the creativity and composition!  Very nice photograph.', '2002-10-03 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135063, 6631, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is just superb I really love the colours and the way they all work seamlessly to produce a really pleasing overall image.  The curved area  top left third  is a little bit of a negative; mainly because it draws the eye away from the central subject; this is also true, but much less so, of the tile line at the base.  Other than those really tiny  points, the picture is flawless, interesting and artistic. The lighting is pure perfection; this just compliments the colour beautifully. The soft lighting and creamy colours  and superb DOF I might add  when combined produce a feeling of purity and innocence within the shot Wonderful, truly wonderful. (10+++)  First class photography  you''ve made it look easy</td>', 'This is just superb I really love the colours and the way they all work seamlessly to produce a really pleasing overall image.  The curved area  top left third  is a little bit of a negative; mainly because it draws the eye away from the central subject; this is also true, but much less so, of the tile line at the base.  Other than those really tiny  points, the picture is flawless, interesting and artistic. The lighting is pure perfection; this just compliments the colour beautifully. The soft lighting and creamy colours  and superb DOF I might add  when combined produce a feeling of purity and innocence within the shot Wonderful, truly wonderful. (10+++)  First class photography  you''ve made it look easy', '2002-10-04 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135064, 6631, 472, '<td valign="top">great framing and clarity.. i wish she was smiling.   i also wish the side of her face on my left was a bit brighter. good work. mag99.</td>', 'great framing and clarity.. i wish she was smiling.   i also wish the side of her face on my left was a bit brighter. good work. mag99.', '2002-10-04 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135065, 6631, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and colours. I took a sort if similar photo of myself a few weeks ago when on holiday. I was sitting in the hotel bath and noticed my huge feet and small head in the little round metal thing that you turn to close and open the plug - also lets overflow water out, but through the sides. I wouldn''t inflict those on anyone but your lady friend is very pretty. The taps seem slightly fuzzy and the rest of the photo doesn''t excite me as much as the faucet bit. I quite like it cropped on a portrait orientation and including only one tap with the faucet. Just my rambling thoughts. <br/>Nice work. Best of luck for a ribbon!<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Great clarity and colours. I took a sort if similar photo of myself a few weeks ago when on holiday. I was sitting in the hotel bath and noticed my huge feet and small head in the little round metal thing that you turn to close and open the plug - also lets overflow water out, but through the sides. I wouldn''t inflict those on anyone but your lady friend is very pretty. The taps seem slightly fuzzy and the rest of the photo doesn''t excite me as much as the faucet bit. I quite like it cropped on a portrait orientation and including only one tap with the faucet. Just my rambling thoughts. Nice work. Best of luck for a ribbon!Kavey', '2002-10-04 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135066, 6631, 2667, '<td valign="top">Yes, I will buy that faucet! Shot is slick and glossy and should be used in advertising. Image jumps right out at you. Perfect execution. (10) ~mcmurma</td>', 'Yes, I will buy that faucet! Shot is slick and glossy and should be used in advertising. Image jumps right out at you. Perfect execution. (10) ~mcmurma', '2002-10-04 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135067, 6631, 4412, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful composition and mood. I like that you got her entire body in the faucit. Very clever shot. Well lite.</td>', 'Beuatiful composition and mood. I like that you got her entire body in the faucit. Very clever shot. Well lite.', '2002-10-04 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
