(135115, 6633, 3002, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a higher mark if the DHILDREN  didn''t have make up on.  They  doesn''t need makeup.  They are beautiful enough without eyeshadow, mascara, lipstick and blush.  I do not mean to insult the photographer;  I just wanted to mention this.  LIttle girls grow up too fast as it is!</td>', 'I would have given this a higher mark if the DHILDREN  didn''t have make up on.  They  doesn''t need makeup.  They are beautiful enough without eyeshadow, mascara, lipstick and blush.  I do not mean to insult the photographer;  I just wanted to mention this.  LIttle girls grow up too fast as it is!', '2002-09-30 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
