(135215, 6640, 51167, '<td valign="top">you have a very great TV.  I work in an electronic store and I love the XBRs.  I like the little girl in the shot.  Wish the tv was a little more square or not cut off on the top. 5 -Jubei</td>', 'you have a very great TV.  I work in an electronic store and I love the XBRs.  I like the little girl in the shot.  Wish the tv was a little more square or not cut off on the top. 5 -Jubei', '2002-09-30 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135216, 6640, 1827, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea.  The reflection IS there, but IMO it''s not strong enough to make this a compelling photo.  Playing with the lighting a bit may have produced a stronger reflection.  Also, the angle of the shot doesn''t add anything for for me.  I would prefer to see it more angled or not angled at all.  Take what you can use, disregard the rest.  4, just-married</td>', 'This is a good idea.  The reflection IS there, but IMO it''s not strong enough to make this a compelling photo.  Playing with the lighting a bit may have produced a stronger reflection.  Also, the angle of the shot doesn''t add anything for for me.  I would prefer to see it more angled or not angled at all.  Take what you can use, disregard the rest.  4, just-married', '2002-09-30 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135217, 6640, 3859, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  I wish the reflection were more obvious.  I would like to be able to the child''s face better.</td>', 'A good idea.  I wish the reflection were more obvious.  I would like to be able to the child''s face better.', '2002-09-30 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
