(135226, 6640, 811, '<td valign="top">A great idea, but I almost missed the reflection!  Maybe if you could have taken it when there was a dark scene or something, so that all of the reflection would show as well as the bottom part.  karmat</td>', 'A great idea, but I almost missed the reflection!  Maybe if you could have taken it when there was a dark scene or something, so that all of the reflection would show as well as the bottom part.  karmat', '2002-10-02 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
