(135242, 6642, 2111, '<td valign="top">I like the other reflection of a bridge. This is ok but maybe if u tried to make the viewer feel as if he was at a bridge that would mean something instead of just a portion of it 4 Mags</td>', 'I like the other reflection of a bridge. This is ok but maybe if u tried to make the viewer feel as if he was at a bridge that would mean something instead of just a portion of it 4 Mags', '2002-10-02 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135243, 6642, 3982, '<td valign="top">good idea for a reflection now if there had just been a big ole catfish swimming under there.....</td>', 'good idea for a reflection now if there had just been a big ole catfish swimming under there.....', '2002-10-05 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135244, 6643, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Fantastic tones. Lovely Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. Fantastic tones. Lovely Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135245, 6643, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not particularly wild about this photo, but there is something about the lighting on the glass (I think) on the right that is really neat.</td>', 'I''m not particularly wild about this photo, but there is something about the lighting on the glass (I think) on the right that is really neat.', '2002-10-01 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135246, 6643, 2764, '<td valign="top">without the title I thought it was a stone tile floor and giant pillars.  the sunglasses were then out of scale in an interesting way and the sepia worked for the old temple feel.  I''m not sure it works as well as a drink on a table clothe but still is a nice picture-8</td>', 'without the title I thought it was a stone tile floor and giant pillars.  the sunglasses were then out of scale in an interesting way and the sepia worked for the old temple feel.  I''m not sure it works as well as a drink on a table clothe but still is a nice picture-8', '2002-10-01 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135247, 6643, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fine photo, well taken (lots of backspacing).  I don''t know exactly what to say about this.  7 Swash</td>', 'Fine photo, well taken (lots of backspacing).  I don''t know exactly what to say about this.  7 Swash', '2002-10-01 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135248, 6643, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 6<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 6<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 8<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 6<br/><br/>Score: 6 - setzler<br/><br/>Note: This image would probably be stronger in some other color tone than sepia.  Sepia is traditionally used to impose an old or antique look.  The ''modern'' sunglasses here don''t seem to fit into an ''antique'' image :)</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 6Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 6Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 8WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 6Score: 6 - setzlerNote: This image would probably be stronger in some other color tone than sepia.  Sepia is traditionally used to impose an old or antique look.  The ''modern'' sunglasses here don''t seem to fit into an ''antique'' image :)', '2002-10-01 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135249, 6643, 4343, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia color and the frame of the shot.</td>', 'I like the sepia color and the frame of the shot.', '2002-10-02 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135250, 6643, 637, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this a few times and don''t really see the beverage.  5 sjgleah</td>', 'I''ve looked at this a few times and don''t really see the beverage.  5 sjgleah', '2002-10-03 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135251, 6644, 2928, '<td valign="top">Superb  can''t fault the shot.  Great drama created by those powerful symmetrical lines. Even the red blobs work  though they do draw the eye away from the picture as whole while you work out what they are.  Nice colour combinations too. I''m glad you didn''t fall into the temptation of B&amp;W for this.  (9)</td>', 'Superb  can''t fault the shot.  Great drama created by those powerful symmetrical lines. Even the red blobs work  though they do draw the eye away from the picture as whole while you work out what they are.  Nice colour combinations too. I''m glad you didn''t fall into the temptation of B&W for this.  (9)', '2002-09-30 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135252, 6644, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice job. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-30 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135253, 6644, 2661, '<td valign="top">great composition, great colors, great lighting, great shapes. I really like the lone red dot in the lower right corner.</td>', 'great composition, great colors, great lighting, great shapes. I really like the lone red dot in the lower right corner.', '2002-09-30 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
