(135255, 6644, 4316, '<td valign="top">Love the evening lighting on the bridge and reflection.  Very moody and colorful!</td>', 'Love the evening lighting on the bridge and reflection.  Very moody and colorful!', '2002-09-30 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135256, 6644, 3419, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo - the colors and focus are great. Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo - the colors and focus are great. Nicely done.', '2002-10-01 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135257, 6644, 3540, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t need a comment, it''s a great pic.</td>', 'This doesn''t need a comment, it''s a great pic.', '2002-10-01 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135258, 6644, 3287, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I like it</td>', 'Nice composition, I like it', '2002-10-01 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135259, 6644, 1543, '<td valign="top">good one, 9.  queen</td>', 'good one, 9.  queen', '2002-10-01 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135260, 6644, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and framine... I love the symmetry and strong diagonals, and the lights under the bridge help keep things interesting... the bridge is sharp and crisp, and the reflectrions look like an Impressionist painting.  My only complaint would be the grey sky but with limited time to shoot the challenge sometimes we have to take what we can get.  Nicely done. -ClubJuggle</td>', 'Great perspective and framine... I love the symmetry and strong diagonals, and the lights under the bridge help keep things interesting... the bridge is sharp and crisp, and the reflectrions look like an Impressionist painting.  My only complaint would be the grey sky but with limited time to shoot the challenge sometimes we have to take what we can get.  Nicely done. -ClubJuggle', '2002-10-02 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135261, 6644, 3672, '<td valign="top">Nice Angles! Gives the picture geat DOF, I also like the movement of water and how it makes the lights dance. Good job :)</td>', 'Nice Angles! Gives the picture geat DOF, I also like the movement of water and how it makes the lights dance. Good job :)', '2002-10-02 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135262, 6644, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love the focus on the bridge and the color on the lights, especially on the water.  The reflection appears almost as if a watercolor painting. Good composition as well.  Keep up the great work.  DPz</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love the focus on the bridge and the color on the lights, especially on the water.  The reflection appears almost as if a watercolor painting. Good composition as well.  Keep up the great work.  DPz', '2002-10-02 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135263, 6644, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 9<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 10<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 8<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 10<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 10<br/><br/>Score: 9 - setzler<br/><br/>I''m curious to see what this image would look like with the bridge light white balanced out... try this: open it up in photoshop and go to the hue/saturation menu and desaturate the green channel to see if it will remove the green tinting from the light here... :)</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 9Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 10Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 8Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 10WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 10Score: 9 - setzlerI''m curious to see what this image would look like with the bridge light white balanced out... try this: open it up in photoshop and go to the hue/saturation menu and desaturate the green channel to see if it will remove the green tinting from the light here... :)', '2002-10-02 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135264, 6644, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great shot..nice perspective..love the lighting (7)</td>', 'Great shot..nice perspective..love the lighting (7)', '2002-10-03 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135265, 6644, 4078, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous red line in the lower left!</td>', 'Gorgeous red line in the lower left!', '2002-10-03 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135266, 6644, 4259, '<td valign="top">Great colours, balance and atmosphere. I love the red light and reflection.</td>', 'Great colours, balance and atmosphere. I love the red light and reflection.', '2002-10-03 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135267, 6644, 4378, '<td valign="top">XCELLENT COLOURS,DUDE! HAVE YOU TRIED THIS SHOT VIEWED "VERTICALLY", the effect would have been more effective, artistically.</td>', 'XCELLENT COLOURS,DUDE! HAVE YOU TRIED THIS SHOT VIEWED "VERTICALLY", the effect would have been more effective, artistically.', '2002-10-03 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135268, 6644, 4182, '<td valign="top">wow ... where did all those colors come from in the water? the bridge lights are white ?</td>', 'wow ... where did all those colors come from in the water? the bridge lights are white ?', '2002-10-03 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135269, 6644, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool composition.  Love the reflected lights in the water.  Moderate to high impact for me. lhall-8</td>', 'Cool composition.  Love the reflected lights in the water.  Moderate to high impact for me. lhall-8', '2002-10-03 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135270, 6644, 3932, '<td valign="top">I love the angle that you shot the bridge at. The bridge leads nicely to the edge of the frame.  Excellent clarity/focus.  The colors work very well together - very natural tones, and the lighting on the bridge really compliments the subject and enhances the reflections in the shot.  -   8    -  JB</td>', 'I love the angle that you shot the bridge at. The bridge leads nicely to the edge of the frame.  Excellent clarity/focus.  The colors work very well together - very natural tones, and the lighting on the bridge really compliments the subject and enhances the reflections in the shot.  -   8    -  JB', '2002-10-04 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135271, 6644, 4397, '<td valign="top">cliche</td>', 'cliche', '2002-10-04 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135272, 6644, 2989, '<td valign="top">The cropping on this is a little too high, I would have liked to see more of the bridge.  Good work</td>', 'The cropping on this is a little too high, I would have liked to see more of the bridge.  Good work', '2002-10-04 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135273, 6644, 472, '<td valign="top">this must be at dusk.  i like the lighting on the bridge, both green and the red spots which set it off great.  the diagonal makes for a strong composition.  good clarity in the image.  i wonder if the horizon is slightly tilted to the right.  mag99</td>', 'this must be at dusk.  i like the lighting on the bridge, both green and the red spots which set it off great.  the diagonal makes for a strong composition.  good clarity in the image.  i wonder if the horizon is slightly tilted to the right.  mag99', '2002-10-04 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135274, 6644, 2667, '<td valign="top">beautiful symmetry. well done! (9)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'beautiful symmetry. well done! (9)  ~mcmurma', '2002-10-04 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
