(135341, 6648, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the idea used at the bottom of the photo - the toy holding the CD and using it as a mirror. I don''t like the rest of the image and feel it just detracts. I''d like to see this done with a plain background, perhaps cream cloth or something, with the lower right subject matter as the whole thing.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I love the idea used at the bottom of the photo - the toy holding the CD and using it as a mirror. I don''t like the rest of the image and feel it just detracts. I''d like to see this done with a plain background, perhaps cream cloth or something, with the lower right subject matter as the whole thing.Kavey', '2002-10-03 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
