(135367, 6651, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty picture. Coloring and exposure are quite good.  I would have beefed up the saturation a little...not too much.  To improve this image the rule of thirds would enhance it, to avoid the subject being dead center. Rules are meant to be broken.  BUT...I still like it and help my suggestions help and not hurt.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is a very pretty picture. Coloring and exposure are quite good.  I would have beefed up the saturation a little...not too much.  To improve this image the rule of thirds would enhance it, to avoid the subject being dead center. Rules are meant to be broken.  BUT...I still like it and help my suggestions help and not hurt.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135368, 6651, 1202, '<td valign="top">Too much tower centered,could you have panned to the left and eliminated the power pole on the right.   If that could have been done I think you would have had a much more powerful shot.   Just my opinion.   5 autool</td>', 'Too much tower centered,could you have panned to the left and eliminated the power pole on the right.   If that could have been done I think you would have had a much more powerful shot.   Just my opinion.   5 autool', '2002-10-02 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
