(135385, 6652, 2221, '<td valign="top">For a couple of seconds I belived that there''s really a baby reflection in a mirror or something. Now I see that it''s a photo. Nice idea! -stephan</td>', 'For a couple of seconds I belived that there''s really a baby reflection in a mirror or something. Now I see that it''s a photo. Nice idea! -stephan', '2002-10-06 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135386, 6652, 4008, '<td valign="top">Now I see your own comment and you say your daughter loved her bath time. How interpretations can differ !!! When I saw your title and your picture my interpretation was that it was the duck who loved the bath time and was thinking back about past times when your daughter was small and playing with him in the batch, which she did not do anymore after growing up. How funny, a twist in my own mind. If a photo makes me think or causes surprise, I rate it higher, and obviously yours did. Thanks, Willem</td>', 'Now I see your own comment and you say your daughter loved her bath time. How interpretations can differ !!! When I saw your title and your picture my interpretation was that it was the duck who loved the bath time and was thinking back about past times when your daughter was small and playing with him in the batch, which she did not do anymore after growing up. How funny, a twist in my own mind. If a photo makes me think or causes surprise, I rate it higher, and obviously yours did. Thanks, Willem', '2002-10-07 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(135387, 6653, 92, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful place to fish !  I love the soft feel of this one. Not heavy and over done. This would be awesome on a lakehouse wall !!!! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful place to fish !  I love the soft feel of this one. Not heavy and over done. This would be awesome on a lakehouse wall !!!! Shiiizzzam', '2002-09-30 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
