(135406, 6654, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, and if I''m not mistaken, that looks remarkably like an Airedale Terrier. There are a few odd line distortions, and perhaps the colour saturation is a bit weak, but the shot carries drama and beauty, almost like seeing into the dogs dream. I love the pose; it''s very much a look of exploration, like he/she is looking for something  this add to the overall effect. Great capture (8)</td>', 'This is a great idea, and if I''m not mistaken, that looks remarkably like an Airedale Terrier. There are a few odd line distortions, and perhaps the colour saturation is a bit weak, but the shot carries drama and beauty, almost like seeing into the dogs dream. I love the pose; it''s very much a look of exploration, like he/she is looking for something  this add to the overall effect. Great capture (8)', '2002-10-03 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
