(135456, 6657, 3080, '<td valign="top">your main subject is the duck, but there are reflections in the water, not quite sure what they are reflections of, but they are there, and that was the requirement.  The duck is cute. I like the angle and the framing/cropping on this.  Focus and clarity are also ok. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'your main subject is the duck, but there are reflections in the water, not quite sure what they are reflections of, but they are there, and that was the requirement.  The duck is cute. I like the angle and the framing/cropping on this.  Focus and clarity are also ok. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-30 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
