(135471, 6658, 1280, '<td valign="top">This technique, though interesting, has been overused here lately. I do realize it has been a tough challenge to come up with something original though.  You did a good job, and the reflection is interesting.  Congrats!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This technique, though interesting, has been overused here lately. I do realize it has been a tough challenge to come up with something original though.  You did a good job, and the reflection is interesting.  Congrats!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-30 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
