(135474, 6658, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection!  Challenge met.  To me, the black and white darkens the foreground of the bridge too much.  No slam on B&amp;W, but didn''t it look better in color?  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice reflection!  Challenge met.  To me, the black and white darkens the foreground of the bridge too much.  No slam on B&W, but didn''t it look better in color?  7 Swash', '2002-10-01 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
