(135478, 6658, 4316, '<td valign="top">Well presented with BW, and a nice subject in the reflection.</td>', 'Well presented with BW, and a nice subject in the reflection.', '2002-10-02 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135479, 6658, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very good shot Although the picture is well composed, sharp as a knife and the DOF is perfect, I don''t  personally  think the shot works too well in B&amp;W.  The reflection doesn''t carry much power; the shades of grey within the reflection seem to darken into a babble of unidentifiable shapes.  I think, had you used colour, this wouldn''t have happened.  It would be interesting to see a colour version after the challenge Other than that, the way you have chosen to do the shot works very well indeed (8)</td>', 'Great idea, very good shot Although the picture is well composed, sharp as a knife and the DOF is perfect, I don''t  personally  think the shot works too well in B&W.  The reflection doesn''t carry much power; the shades of grey within the reflection seem to darken into a babble of unidentifiable shapes.  I think, had you used colour, this wouldn''t have happened.  It would be interesting to see a colour version after the challenge Other than that, the way you have chosen to do the shot works very well indeed (8)', '2002-10-04 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135480, 6658, 3127, '<td valign="top">Good shot with great depth. I find myself wondering how it would have looked in color. Either way, it''s a good one.</td>', 'Good shot with great depth. I find myself wondering how it would have looked in color. Either way, it''s a good one.', '2002-10-04 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135481, 6659, 4210, '<td valign="top">The trees are really cool, but I feel that they somehow detract from the building. One or the other would be cool though.</td>', 'The trees are really cool, but I feel that they somehow detract from the building. One or the other would be cool though.', '2002-09-30 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
