(135568, 6669, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge: Yes<br/>Artistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5<br/>Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 8<br/>Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6<br/>Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 7<br/>WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 7<br/><br/>Score: 7 - setzler<br/><br/>I have a feeling that this photo may be a reflection of a reflection?  I think that is a neat idea, but the color here is flat.  I would love to have seen this with more rich colors.  The subject window on the right is just a tad too close to the edge of the frame...</td>', 'Meets the Challenge: YesArtistic Merit (Would I print/frame/hang it?): 5Creativity (Did a lot of thought go into this photo?): 8Technical (Focus/DOF/Lighting/Etc): 6Composition (Subject well-positioned and framed): 7WOW Factor (Is the photo interesting?): 7Score: 7 - setzlerI have a feeling that this photo may be a reflection of a reflection?  I think that is a neat idea, but the color here is flat.  I would love to have seen this with more rich colors.  The subject window on the right is just a tad too close to the edge of the frame...', '2002-10-02 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
