(135612, 6672, 4049, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and color to the liquid, but I don''t like the bright spot toward the bottom, and I think you should have either been a bit closer to the glass, without seeing the stem, or farther away seeing more stem, because the amount shown doesn''t seem quite right.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and color to the liquid, but I don''t like the bright spot toward the bottom, and I think you should have either been a bit closer to the glass, without seeing the stem, or farther away seeing more stem, because the amount shown doesn''t seem quite right.', '2002-09-30 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(135613, 6672, 2928, '<td valign="top">Superb colour  you can almost feel the alcohol punching you in the face.  Great use of DOF.  I quite like the composition, but I think that the unintentional diagonal line in the bottom left draws the attention away from the central subject.  A completely black background  I feel  would have focused more power onto the centre of the glass turning a really great shot into a bombshell (8)</td>', 'Superb colour  you can almost feel the alcohol punching you in the face.  Great use of DOF.  I quite like the composition, but I think that the unintentional diagonal line in the bottom left draws the attention away from the central subject.  A completely black background  I feel  would have focused more power onto the centre of the glass turning a really great shot into a bombshell (8)', '2002-10-01 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
